	["(Adopt the power of the forest, gradually covering your body in bark. Getting hit by enemy attacks causes bark to be removed. You take reduced damage from physical attack hits the more bark builds up, but higher chance to evade when less covered in bark)"] = "（汲取森林的力量，逐渐用树皮覆盖你的身体。被敌人的攻击击中会移除树皮。覆盖的树皮越多，你受到的物理攻击击中伤害越低。覆盖的树皮越少，你的闪避率越高）",
	["(Adrenaline grants 100% increased Damage, 25% increased Attack, Cast and Movement Speed and 10% additional Physical Damage Reduction. You cannot gain Adrenaline if you already have it)"] = "（肾上腺素会增加100%伤害，提高25%攻击速度、施法速度和移动速度，并且获得10%额外物理伤害减免。如果你已经有肾上腺素就不能再获得肾上腺素。）",
	["(Affects Melee Strikes, including the Default Attack. Does not apply to Areas of Effect)"] = "（影响近战打击，包括普通攻击。无法用于效果区域）",
	["(Affliction permanently Afflicts any of your damageable minions in a targeted area, causing them to take physical damage over time, at an accelerating rate. Each such minion causes you to regenerate life at a rate based on the current damage of its Affliction debuff. Afflicted Minions explode if their life is lowered to a fifth of maximum)"] = "（折磨会永久性地影响你在目标区域内可受伤害的召唤生物，使其持续受到越来越高的物理伤害。每个受到该效果影响的召唤生物使你再生生命，再生速度由折磨减益效果造成的伤害决定。受折磨的召唤生物的生命低于上限的五分之一时会爆炸）",
	["(Ailment Threshold is about equal to Life except on bosses where it is about half of their life)"] = "(异常状态门槛约等于生命；首领的门槛约为其生命的一半)",
	["(Ailment mode: Average Damage)"] = "(异常状态计算模式：平均伤害)",
	["(Ailments are Bleeding, Ignited, Scorched, Chilled, Frozen, Brittle, Shocked, Sapped, and Poisoned)"] = "(异常状态包括流血、点燃、冰缓、冰冻、感电、中毒、脆弱、精疲力尽和烧灼)",
	["(Ailments that deal Damage are Bleeding, Ignited, and Poisoned)"] = "(伤害类异常状态包括流血、点燃和中毒)",
	["(Ailments that do not deal Damage are Scorched, Chilled, Frozen, Brittle, Shocked, and Sapped)"] = "(非伤害类异常状态包括冰缓、冰冻、烧灼、脆弱、精疲力尽和感电)",
	["(Alchemist's Genius increases Flask Charges gained by 20% and effect of Flasks by 10%, for 4 seconds)"] = "（炼金奇才可以在 4 秒内使药剂充能获取率提高 20%，药剂效果提高 10%）",
	["(Allies on your Consecrated Ground Regenerate a percentage of their Maximum Life per second, and Curses have 50% reduced effect on them)"] = "（友军在你产生的奉献地面上按照生命上限百分比每秒再生生命，并且他们身上的诅咒效果降低 50%）",
	["(Allies on your Fungal Ground have +25% to Chaos Resistance. Enemies on your Fungal Ground have -10% to all Resistances.)"] = "（在你真菌地表上的队友获得 +25% 混沌抗性。在你真菌地表上的敌人所有抗性 -10%。）",
	["(Arcane Surge grants 20% increased Cast Speed and 30% increased Mana Regeneration rate)"] = "（秘术增强可以使施法速度提高 20%，魔力恢复速度提高 30%）",
	["(Arcane Surge grants 20% increased Cast Speed and 30% increased Mana Regeneration rate, for 4 seconds)"] = "（秘术增强可以在 4 秒内使施法速度提高 20%，魔力恢复速度提高 30%）",
	["(Armour is treated as this percentage of its actual value, only for calculating damage mitigation)"] = "（护甲被视为实际数值的百分比，只用于缓阻伤害）",
	["(Armour, Evasion Rating and Energy Shield are the standard Defences)"] = "（护甲值、闪避值、能量护盾都属于标准防御属性）",
	["(Assuming 'non-Poisoned' Enemy)"] = "(假设敌人尚未中毒)",
	["(Attacks made against Enemies affected by Hallowing Flame gain 25% of Physical Damage as Extra Fire Damage."] = "（对受圣焰影响的敌人发动的攻击，将获得物理伤害的 25% 作为额外火焰伤害。",
	["(Attributes are Strength, Dexterity, and Intelligence)"] = "(属性分为力量，敏捷和智慧三种)",
	["(Auras can only grant bonuses to things they affect)"] = "（光环只能给受影响的事物提供加成）",
	["(Average Ignite DPS)"] = "(平均点燃每秒伤害)",
	["(Avg. Warcry Count)"] = "(平均战吼数量)",
	["(Base Damage)"] = "(基础伤害)",
	["(Base Maximum Rage is 30)"] = "（基础怒气上限为 30 点）",
	["(Base chance)"] = "(基础几率)",
	["(Base damage)"] = "(基础伤害)",
	["(Being Blinded causes 20% less Accuracy Rating and Evasion Rating)"] = "（被致盲时，命中值和闪避值总降 20%）",
	["(Being Blinded causes 20% less Accuracy Rating and Evasion Rating, for 4 seconds)"] = "（被致盲时命中和闪避在接下来 4 秒总降 20%）",
	["(Being Covered in Ash applies 20% less Movement Speed and 20% increased Fire Damage Taken)"] = "（处于灰烬缠身状态的敌人移动速度总降 20%，受到的火焰伤害额外提高 20%）",
	["(Being Covered in Ash applies 20% less Movement Speed and 20% increased Fire Damage Taken, for 4 seconds)"] = "（处于灰烬缠身状态的敌人移动速度总降 20%，受到的火焰伤害额外提高 20%，持续 4 秒）",
	["(Being Covered in Frost applies 50% less Critical Strike Chance and 20% increased Cold Damage Taken)"] = "（冰霜缠身的敌人暴击率总降 50%，受到的冰霜伤害提高 20 %）",
	["(Bleed DPS Range)"] = "(流血每秒伤害范围)",
	["(Bleed DoT Multi for Crit)"] = "(流血暴击持续伤害加成)",
	["(Bleed DoT Multi for Non-Crit)"] = "(流血非暴击持续伤害加成)",
	["(Bleed DoT Multi)"] = "(流血持续伤害加成)",
	["(Bleed duration / Attack Time)"] = "(流血持续时间／攻击间隔)",
	["(Bleeding deals Physical Damage over time, based on the base Physical Damage of the Skill. Damage is 200% higher while moving)"] = "（流血造成持续物理伤害，伤害取决于技能初始的物理伤害，移动时受到的流血伤害总增 200%）",
	["(Bleeding which has been Aggravated always deals higher Damage as though the target was moving)"] = "（恶性流血将目标视作正在移动，始终造成较高的伤害）",
	["(Brand Critical Strikes are any Critical Strikes dealt by Brand Skills or by Skills Triggered by a Brand)"] = "（由烙印技能和烙印触发的技能造成的暴击都为烙印暴击）",
	["(Brand Damage is any Damage dealt by Brand Skills or by Skills Triggered by a Brand)"] = "（由烙印技能和烙印触发的技能造成的伤害都为烙印伤害）",
	["(By default you gain 1 Valour on Melee Kill, or on Melee Hit against Rare or Unique enemies, no more than once every 0.5 seconds, up to a maximum of 50)"] = "（近战击败敌人，或近战击中稀有或传奇敌人时，默认获得 1 点胆魄，每 0.5 秒只能获得一次，最多 50 点）",
	["(Can be allocated without pathing to it)"] = "（无需连通路径即可分配）",
	["(Cannot apply to any of the active skills)"] = "（无法辅助当前任何主动技能）",
	["(Capped Bleed DPS Range)"] = "(达到上限的流血每秒伤害范围)",
	["(Capped Bleed DPS)"] = "(达到上限的流血每秒伤害)",
	["(Capped Ignite DPS Range)"] = "(达到上限的点燃每秒伤害范围)",
	["(Capped Ignite DPS)"] = "(达到上限的点燃每秒伤害)",
	["(Capped Poison DPS Range)"] = "(达到上限的中毒每秒伤害范围)",
	["(Capped Poison DPS)"] = "(达到上限的中毒每秒伤害)",
	["(Chance to even be hit)"] = "(实际被击中的几率)",
	["(Chaotic Might grants 30% of Physical Damage as extra Chaos Damage)"] = "（混沌之威会附加等同于 30% 物理伤害的额外混沌伤害）",
	["(Characters inherently gain +12 Life per Level)"] = "（角色本身每级获得 +12 生命）",
	["(Chill reduces Action Speed by up to 30%)"] = "（冰缓可使行动速度降低最多30%）",
	["(Chill reduces Enemy Action Speed by 10%)"] = "(冰缓敌人10%)",
	["(Chill reduces Enemy Action Speed by up to 30%, depending on the amount of Cold Damage in the hit, for 2 seconds)"] = "(取决于造成的冰霜伤害量, 冰缓能至多使敌人减速30%并持续2秒)",
	["(Chill reduces Enemy Action Speed for 2 seconds)"] = "(冰缓可使敌人的动作速度减缓 2 秒）",
	["(Choose one of the three attached options)"] = "( 请在三个选项中选择一项 )",
	["(Choose one of the two attached options)"] = "（请在两个选项中选择一项）",
	["(Close Range is up to 2 metres)"] = "（近程即 2 米以内）",
	["(Cold Ailments are Chilled, Frozen and Brittle)"] = "（冰霜元素异常状态指冰缓、冻结、脆弱）",
	["(Combined chance)"] = "(综合几率)",
	["(Contribution from Crits)"] = "(暴击部分的贡献)",
	["(Contribution from Non-crits)"] = "(非暴击部分的贡献)",
	["(Convergence grants 30% more Elemental Damage and lasts 4 seconds)"] = "（汇聚使总元素伤害总增 30%，并持续 4 秒）",
	["(Cooldown, Cast Time)"] = "(冷却时间、施法时间)",
	["(Creates a Dark Effigy tethered to you. Damage you take from enemy hits is taken from the Effigy's life before you, and damage the Effigy takes from enemy hits is taken from your life before it, at doubled value. The Effigy is destroyed if you get too far away from it)"] = "（召唤一个与你绑定的黑暗塑像。你受到的击中伤害会由塑像的生命承受，塑像受到的击中伤害会由你的生命承受，并且数值翻倍。距离塑像过远会将其摧毁。）",
	["(Creates a Suspended Mirage - an astral-infused clone of yourself that is suspended in time, just before the release of the spellcast that triggered them. On reaching three Suspended Mirages, all Suspended Mirages will be released, using the spell which was cast to create them. Suspended Mirages are not created by Vaal spells, channelling spells, instant spells, or spells which create minions)"] = "（创造一个悬停的幻境——一个注入星界能量、悬停在时间中的自身克隆体，定格在即将释放触发该效果的那个法术的瞬间。当达到 3 个悬停幻境时，所有悬停幻境将被释放，触发创造出它们时所施放的法术。悬停的幻境无法由瓦尔技能、持续吟唱技能、瞬发技能或创造召唤生物的技能产生）",
	["(Crit Dmg Derivation)"] = "(暴击伤害推导)",
	["(Crit confirmation roll)"] = "(暴击确认判定)",
	["(Crushed lowers Physical Damage Reduction by 15%)"] = "（碾压使物理伤害减免降低 15%）",
	["(Culling Strike means enemies that are on 10% or lower life after your Hit are Killed)"] = "( 对生命等于或少于 10% 生命上限的敌人可以造成终结，敌人将直接死亡 )",
	["(Curses a single enemy, making them more vulnerable to Critical Strikes. Killing the cursed enemy will grant life and mana, and a power charge. You can only have one Mark at a time)"] = "（诅咒单个敌人，使其更易受到暴击。击杀他将回复生命和魔力，并获得一个暴击球。你每次只能标记一个印记。）",
	["(DPS Range)"] = "(每秒伤害范围)",
	["(DPS multiplier for this skill)"] = "(此技能的每秒伤害倍率)",
	["(Damage from Crits)"] = "(暴击伤害)",
	["(Damage from Non-crits)"] = "(非暴击伤害)",
	["(Damage per Instance)"] = "(单次效果伤害)",
	["(Damage taken multi)"] = "(承受伤害倍率)",
	["(Dash backwards, leaving a short-lived mist copy of yourself that Taunts nearby Enemies for a short duration. The copy can be damaged by Enemies, and copies that are killed by an Enemy will apply a debuff in an area that makes affected targets take 30% increased Damage and deal 30% less Damage for 4 seconds)"] = "（向后疾退，留下一个你的短暂的迷雾幻象，该幻象会短暂嘲讽附近敌人。该幻象可被敌人攻击。若被敌人摧毁则会在区域内施加减益效果，使受影响的敌人 4 秒内承受的伤害提高 30% ，造成的伤害减少 30%。）",
	["(Debuffs you are Unaffected by can still be placed on you, but will not actually apply their effect)"] = "(你受到的未生效的减益效果依然会被显示，但是他们不会产生效果)",
	["(Dex)"] = "(敏捷)",
	["(Disabled)"] = "（已禁用）",
	["(Dmg Derivation)"] = "(伤害推导)",
	["(Dual Wielding inherently grants +20% chance to Block Attack Damage and 10% more Attack Speed)"] = "（双持本使格挡攻击伤害几率 +20%，攻击速度总增 10%）",
	["(Each instance of Gale Force lasts 4 seconds. Maximum 10 Gale Force)"] = "（每个飓风之力都持续 4 秒。最多 10 个飓风之力）",
	["(Effective DoT Multiplier)"] = "(有效持续伤害加成)",
	["(Effective chance to trigger)"] = "(有效触发几率)",
	["(Effective source rate)"] = "(来源的有效频率)",
	["(Effects cannot be slowed below 25% of their normal expiry rate)"] = "（效果无法低于正常消退速率的 25%）",
	["(Elemental Ailments are Ignited, Scorched, Chilled, Frozen, Brittle, Shocked, and Sapped)"] = "(被点燃、烧灼、冰缓、冰冻、脆弱、感电和精疲力尽统称为元素异常状态)",
	["(Elemental Ailments are Ignited, Scorched, Chilled, Frozen, Brittled, Shocked, and Sapped)"] = "（元素异常状态包括点燃、烧灼、冰缓、冻结、脆弱、感电和力竭）",
	["(Elusive initially grants 15% chance to Avoid All Damage from Hits, and 30% increased Movement Speed. The buff reduces its effect over time, removing itself at 0% effect. If you already have an Elusive buff, you cannot gain Elusive)"] = "（灵巧最初有 15% 的几率避免所有攻击击中，并使移动速度提高 30%，该增益随时间流逝递减，降低到 0% 时移除。在已经获得灵巧的情况下，无法再次获得灵巧）",
	["(Enemies affected by Barnacles Convert 5% of Physical Damage to Cold and have 5% increased duration of Chill and Freeze on them."] = "（受到藤壶影响的敌人将物理伤害的 5% 转化为冰霜伤害，其受到的冰缓和冻结持续时间提高 5%。",
	["(Enemies affected by Barnacles Convert 5% of Physical Damage to Cold and have 5% increased duration of Chill and Freeze on them. Each instance of Barnacles lasts 30 seconds and can be inflicted up to 10 times)"] = "（受藤壶影响的敌人会将 5% 的物理伤害转化为冰霜伤害，且身上冰缓和冻结状态的持续时间延长 5%。每层藤壶持续 30 秒，最多可叠加 10 层）",
	["(Enemies on your Brine Ground have 30% increased effect of Lightning and Cold Ailments on them and have 25% reduced Armour and Evasion Rating. Allies on your Brine Ground gain 10% of Physical Damage as extra Cold Damage and as extra Lightning Damage)"] = "（处于你海蚀地面上的敌人，身上的闪电与冰霜异常状态效果提高 30%，且护甲与闪避值降低 25%。处于你海蚀地面上的队友获得 10% 物理伤害作为额外冰霜伤害与额外闪电伤害）",
	["(Enemies you Taunt can only target you, and deal 10% less damage to anyone else. Taunt lasts for 3 seconds)"] = "(受你嘲讽的敌人只会攻击你, 并对你以外的其他人造成额外减少 10% 的总伤害, 嘲讽持续3秒)",
	["(Estimated impact of linked spells)"] = "(连接法术的预估影响)",
	["(Estimated impact of skill rotation, cooldown alignment and trigger chance)"] = "(技能循环、冷却对齐和触发几率的预估影响)",
	["(Every Rage grants 1% more Attack Damage. Maximum Rage is 30. Lose 10 Rage per second if you have not been Hit or gained Rage in the last 2 seconds)"] = "（每点怒火使攻击伤害总增 1%。怒火上限为 30 点。若过去 2 秒内没有被击中或获得怒火，则每秒失去 10 点怒火）",
	["(Every Rage has an inherent effect of 1% more Attack Damage, and modifiers can add extra effects to Rage)"] = "（每一点怒火的固有效果使攻击伤害总增 1%，词缀可以为怒火提供额外效果）",
	["(Explodes when your Ward is broken, dealing Physical Spell Damage around you equal to a percentage of your Ward and inflicting Enervation on Hit, a debuff that lowers Movement Speed by 20% and prevents Life and Energy Shield Recovery for 4 seconds)"] = "（你的结界被打破时产生爆炸，对周围敌人造成等同于你结界一定百分比的物理法术伤害，并且在击中时施加衰退，该减益效果在 4 秒内降低 20% 移动速度并阻止生命值和能量护盾回复）",
	["(Fanaticism grants Spells you Cast yourself 75% more Cast Speed, 75% less Cost and 75% increased Area of Effect)"] = "（欣喜若狂使你自身施放的法术的施法速度总增 75%，消耗总降 75%，效果区域扩大 75%）",
	["(Farrul's Farric Presence is an Aura which grants 80% increased Accuracy Rating, 120% increased Critical Strike Chance and Take no Extra Damage from Critical Hits)"] = "（法瑞尔的大地之灵为光环效果，命中值提升 80%、暴击几率提升 120% ，且不会受到暴击的额外伤害。）",
	["(Farrul's Fertile Presence is an Aura which grants 100% increased Damage, Regenerate 3% of Life per second and Cannot be Stunned)"] = "（法瑞尔的丰沃之灵为光环效果，伤害提升100% 、每秒回复 3% 生命，并免疫晕眩。）",
	["(Farrul's Wild Presence is an Aura which grants 20% increased Attack, Cast and Movement Speed and prevents Action Speed from being lowered below the Base Value)"] = "（法瑞尔的狂野之灵为光环效果，攻击、施法和移动速度提升 20% ，并防止行动速度被降至基础值以下。）",
	["(Final Chaos Damage taken)"] = "(最终承受的混沌伤害)",
	["(Final Cold Damage taken)"] = "(最终承受的冰霜伤害)",
	["(Final Fire Damage taken)"] = "(最终承受的火焰伤害)",
	["(Final Lightning Damage taken)"] = "(最终承受的闪电伤害)",
	["(Final Physical Damage taken)"] = "(最终承受的物理伤害)",
	["(Fire Ailments are Ignited and Scorched)"] = "（火焰异常状态指点燃和烧灼）",
	["(Forced Active)"] = "（强制启用）",
	["(Fortifying grants an amount of Fortification based on the Damage of the Hit)"] = "（护体可以按照击中伤害提供一定数量的护体值）",
	["(Freeze lowers Enemy Action Speed to zero, preventing them from acting. Duration is based on the Cold Damage of the Hit)"] = "(冰冻将完全冻结敌人, 使其无法移动。冰冻的持续长度取决于命中时造成的冰霜伤害量)",
	["(Freezes that would have a duration of 0.3 seconds or below are not inflicted)"] = "（持续时间不超过 0.3 秒的冻结不会施加）",
	["(FullDPS)"] = "（计入完整 DPS）",
	["(Gain Added Spell Damage equal to the Damage of your Main Hand Weapon)"] = "（获得等于你主手武器伤害的附加法术伤害）",
	["(Grants 100% of Physical Damage converted to Chaos Damage)"] = "（将物理伤害的 100% 转化为混沌伤害）",
	["(Grants 25% of the skill's mana cost as Physical Damage and causes you to take physical damage over time equal to a percentage of the skill's mana cost.)"] = "（获得等同于技能魔力消耗 25% 的物理伤害，并使你受到等同于技能魔力消耗一定比例的持续物理伤害。）",
	["(Grants 30% of Physical Damage as Extra Chaos Damage)"] = "（获得等同于物理伤害 30% 的额外混沌伤害）",
	["(Grants Glorious Madness. While under Glorious Madness gain a random Touched Debuff every 2 seconds. Using this skill again will remove Glorious Madness and the Touched Debuffs it inflicts, but you will be unable to Embrace Madness again until the cooldown expires)"] = "（赋予疯狂荣光状态。每 2 秒获得一个随机的触碰类减益效果。再次使用此技能将移除疯狂荣光及其施加的触碰类减益效果，但在冷却结束前无法再次使用疯狂之拥。）",
	["(Hextoad trigger interval)"] = "(魔蛊蟾蜍触发间隔)",
	["(Hinder reduces movement speed by 30% for 4 seconds)"] = "(被缓速的敌人移动速度会在 4 秒内降低 30%)",
	["(Hinder reduces movement speed by 30%)"] = "(缓速使移动速度降低 30%)",
	["(Hit damage)"] = "(击中伤害)",
	["(Hits against Enemies on Profane Ground have 100% increased Critical Strike Chance, and Curses have 10% increased Effect on them)"] = "（击中对渎神地面上的敌人的暴击几率提高 100%，诅咒对其的效果提高 10%）",
	["(Hits have up to +6% Critical Strike Chance against Brittle Enemies, based on the Cold Damage of the Hit which inflicted Brittle, for 4 seconds)"] = "（基于造成【脆弱】的击中冰霜伤害，使对抗【脆弱】的敌人时，最多+6%暴击率，持续4秒）",
	["(Hoarfrost lasts 10 seconds and can be inflicted multiple times, each refreshing the duration of existing Hoarfrost on the target. Each Hoarfost increases Freeze Duration on the target by 20%. All Hoarfrost is removed if the target is Frozen)"] = "（白霜持续 10 秒，可以施加多次，每次都会刷新目标身上的白霜的持续时间。每层白霜使目标受到的冻结持续时间延长 20%。目标被冻结时移除所有白霜层数）",
	["(If a curse expires instantly curse expiration is equivalent to curse replacement)"] = "(诅咒立即消退时，诅咒消退等同于诅咒被替换)",
	["(Ignite DPS Range)"] = "(点燃每秒伤害范围)",
	["(Ignite DoT Multi for Crit)"] = "(点燃暴击持续伤害加成)",
	["(Ignite DoT Multi for Non-Crit)"] = "(点燃非暴击持续伤害加成)",
	["(Ignite DoT Multi)"] = "(点燃持续伤害加成)",
	["(Ignite Duration / Attack Time)"] = "(点燃持续时间／攻击间隔)",
	["(Ignite deals Fire Damage over time, based on the base Fire Damage of the Skill, for 4 seconds)"] = "(点燃会造成持续燃烧的火焰伤害, 取决于技能的基础火焰伤害, 持续4秒)",
	["(Ignoring Resistances means your Damage cannot be modified in any way by any Resistance stats)"] = "（无视抗性表示你的伤害不会被任何抗性相关的词缀以任何方式修改）",
	["(In game source skill usage duration in seconds)"] = "(游戏内来源技能的使用持续时间，单位为秒)",
	["(Increases and Reductions to Maximum Energy Shield"] = "（对能量护盾上限的增幅与减益",
	["(Increases and Reductions to Maximum Life also apply to Attack Damage at 30% of their value)"] = "（对生命上限的增幅与减益有 30% 也套用于攻击伤害）",
	["(Increases and Reductions to Maximum Mana also apply to Damage at 30% of their value)"] = "（对魔力上限的增幅与减益有 30% 也套用于伤害）",
	["(Int)"] = "(智慧)",
	["(Intimidated enemies take 10% increased Attack Damage)"] = "（受到威吓的敌人受到的攻击伤害会提高10%）",
	["(Killing an Enemy is not Spawning a corpse)"] = "（击败敌人不会唤起灵柩）",
	["(Knockback pushes Enemies away when Hit)"] = "(命中时击退敌人)",
	["(Leeched Energy Shield is recovered over time. Multiple Leeches can occur simultaneously, up to a maximum rate)"] = "（被偷取的能量护盾会持续恢复。可以同时进行多次偷取，次数有上限）",
	["(Leeched Life is recovered over time. Multiple Leeches can occur simultaneously, up to a maximum rate)"] = "(吸取的生命会随时间逐渐回复。多个吸取效果可以同时发生, 但有一个上限)",
	["(Leeched Mana is recovered over time. Multiple Leeches can occur simultaneously, up to a maximum rate)"] = "(吸取的魔力会随时间逐渐回复。多个吸取效果可以同时发生, 但有一个上限)",
	["(Life Recovery from Regeneration grants Blood Barrier while on Full Life. Maximum Blood Barrier is equal to 30% of your Maximum Life. Damage from Hits is taken from Blood Barrier before your Life or Energy Shield. 50% less Life Regeneration Rate)"] = "（满血状态下，来自再生效果的生命回复将转化为血液屏障。血液屏障上限等于你最大生命值的 30%。来自击中的伤害将优先从血液屏障中扣除，之后再计算生命值或能量护盾的损失。生命回复速度降低 50%）",
	["(Lightning Ailments are Shocked and Sapped)"] = "（闪电异常状态指感电、精疲力尽）",
	["(Local Modifiers on Weapons that add damage to that Weapon do not grant you Added Damage, so are unchanged by this)"] = "（武器上增加该武器伤害的局部词缀，并不会为你提供附加伤害，因此不受此影响。）",
	["(Lucky things are rolled twice and the best result used)"] = "（幸运会重复判定两次，并采用较好的结果）",
	["(MH average physical hit before mitigation)"] = "(主手减伤前平均物理击中伤害)",
	["(MH chance to hit)"] = "(主手命中几率)",
	["(MH impale damage multiplier)"] = "(主手穿刺伤害倍率)",
	["(Maimed enemies have 30% reduced Movement Speed)"] = "( 被瘫痪的敌人减少 30% 移动速度 )",
	["(Malediction causes 10% reduced Damage dealt and 10% increased Damage taken)"] = "（恶语术使造成的伤害降低 10%，受到的伤害提高 10%）",
	["(Mana Burn causes you to lose 1% of your maximum Mana per stack per second)"] = "（魔力燃烧每层使你每秒失去 1% 的最大魔力）",
	["(Mana Cost of triggered)"] = "(被触发技能的魔力消耗)",
	["(Mana cost of trigger source)"] = "(触发来源的魔力消耗)",
	["(Manaforged threshold multiplier)"] = "(法铸箭矢的门槛倍率)",
	["(Manaforged trigger threshold)"] = "(法铸箭矢的触发门槛)",
	["(Mania applies 4% increased Damage taken, 2% reduced Action Speed and 10% reduced Life and Energy Shield Recovery Rate for 15 seconds, and can be inflicted up to 15 times)"] = "（狂躁状态在 15 秒内会使目标承受的伤害提高4%，行动速度降低 2% ，生命与能量护盾回复速度降低 10% 。该效果最多可叠加 15 次。）",
	["(Max)"] = "（上限）",
	["(Maximum Chance to Block Attack Damage cannot be raised above 90%)"] = "（格挡攻击伤害的最大几率不能超过 90%）",
	["(Maximum Chance to Block Spell Damage cannot be raised above 90%)"] = "（格挡法术伤害的最大几率不能超过 90%）",
	["(Maximum Resistances cannot be raised above 90%)"] = "（抗性上限不能超过 90%）",
	["(Maximum hit is calculated in reverse -)"] = "(最大承受击中按反向顺序计算——)",
	["(Maximum of)"] = "(取最大值)",
	["(Mirage)"] = "(幻影)",
	["(Molten Burst launches molten projectiles from the point of impact, causing area attack damage to enemies where they land)"] = "（熔岩爆破会对目标造成物理及火焰伤害, 并在挥击的途中从武器弹射出熔岩球. 这些熔岩球在着地时会爆炸, 并对附近的敌人造成伤害）",
	["(NOTE: Calculation uses a Weighted Avg formula)"] = "(注意：此计算使用加权平均公式)",
	["(NOTE: Having any energy shield when the hit occurs grants 50% chance to avoid stun.)"] = "(注意：受到击中时拥有任意能量护盾，即有 50% 的几率避免晕眩。)",
	["(No chance to avoid damage can be higher than 75%)"] = "（躲避伤害的几率不能高于 75%）",
	["(Non-Crit Dmg Derivation)"] = "(非暴击伤害推导)",
	["(Normal Monsters have 1 Power, Magic Monsters 2, Rare Monsters 10, Unique Monsters 20, and Players 5)"] = "（普通怪物的威力为 1，魔法怪物为 2，稀有怪物为 10，传奇怪物为 20，玩家为 5）",
	["(Not supported in PoB yet)"] = "（PoB 尚未支持此效果）",
	["(Note that you can still apply multiple stacks via 'inflict additional poison' mods)"] = "（仍可通过额外施加中毒的词缀施加多层中毒。）",
	["(Number of mitigated hits)"] = "(抵御的击中次数)",
	["(OH average physical hit before mitigation)"] = "(副手减伤前平均物理击中伤害)",
	["(OH chance to hit)"] = "(副手命中几率)",
	["(OH impale damage multiplier)"] = "(副手穿刺伤害倍率)",
	["(Only Damage from Hits can be Recouped, over 4 seconds following the Hit)"] = "（仅能回收击中伤害，它在击中 4 秒内回收）",
	["(Only one Hit every 0.5 seconds can cause you to gain Rage)"] = "（每 0.5 秒内只有一次击中可以使你获得怒火）",
	["(Onslaught grants 20% increased Attack, Cast, and Movement Speed)"] = "( 猛攻赋予你额外你 20% 攻击速度, 施法速度, 和移动速度 )",
	["(Overcapped Chance to Block is the amount by which Uncapped Chance to Block is higher than Maximum Chance to Block)"] = "（超量格挡率指通过某些方式超出最大格挡率的数值）",
	["(Overkill Damage is any Damage from a Hit in excess of the Enemy's remaining Life)"] = "(溢出伤害是造成的伤害超出怪物剩余生命的部分)",
	["(POB only applies this modifier when ES > Total incoming damage.)"] = "(仅当能量护盾大于总传入伤害时，PoB 才应用此修正。)",
	["(Pacify curses all targets in an area, having no effect at first, but causing them to deal no damage once 60% of the curse's duration has expired)"] = "（宁心会诅咒区域中的所有目标，最初没有效果，但在诅咒的持续时间消减 60% 后使其无法造成伤害）",
	["(Passive Skills that are not Notable, Masteries, Keystones, or Jewel Sockets are Small)"] = "（小天赋指天赋树上所有非核心天赋、非专精天赋、非基石天赋，以及非珠宝插槽）",
	["(Penance Mark curses a single enemy, causing them to spawn multiple phantasms when hit. The phantasms will be allies of the marked enemy with the same monster level. They cast a projectile spell which deals physical damage, and are immune to curses. You can only have one Mark at a time)"] = "（忏悔印记会诅咒一名敌人，使其被击中时产生多个幽影。幽影被视作被标记的敌人的盟友，拥有相同的怪物等级，会施放造成物理伤害的投射物法术，并且免疫诅咒。你同时只能施加一个印记）",
	["(Phantasmal Might grants Added Spell Physical Damage based on the level of the Phantasm. Multiple instances of Phantasmal Might stack)"] = "（幽影之力基于幻灵等级附加法术物理伤害。幽影之力可以反复叠加）",
	["(Poison DPS Range)"] = "(中毒每秒伤害范围)",
	["(Poison DoT Multi for Crit)"] = "(中毒暴击持续伤害加成)",
	["(Poison DoT Multi for Non-Crit)"] = "(中毒非暴击持续伤害加成)",
	["(Poison DoT Multi)"] = "(中毒持续伤害加成)",
	["(Poison deals Chaos Damage over time, based on the base Physical and Chaos Damage of the Skill. Multiple instances of Poison stack)"] = "( 中毒造成持续混沌伤害, 伤害取决于技能初始的物理和混沌伤害。中毒效果可以叠加 )",
	["(Primal Aegis calls forth a protective aegis which takes elemental damage from hits for you until depleted. The aegis will be restored to its full value after a short delay if you stop taking elemental damage from hits, or if depleted)"] = "（原能护盾会灵唤一个守护护盾，在消散前抵挡击中造成的元素伤害。该护盾在未受到元素伤害或消散一段时间后会自动回复满值）",
	["(Rage Regeneration)"] = "(怒火再生)",
	["(Raise two spectral spiders from each nearby corpse that will attack your enemies with Viper Strike. Each raised spider grants you increased Attack Speed and increased Damage with Poison. Enemies will not engage the spiders directly, and they are immune to damage)"] = "（周围每具灵柩召唤两只幽魂巨蛛，用毒蛇打击攻击你的敌人。每只幽魂巨蛛使你的攻击速度加快，并提高中毒的伤害。敌人将不会主动攻击你的蜘蛛，并且它们免疫伤害）",
	["(Random Shrine buffs have a base duration of 20 seconds)"] = "（随机神龛增益效果的基础持续时间为 20 秒）",
	["(Ravenous consumes a targeted corpse, granting you a buff that causes you to deal more damage to, and take less damage from, enemies of the same Monster Category as the corpse)"] = "（贪噬会吞噬一个目标灵柩，使你获得一项增益，在对抗与灵柩怪物类型相同的敌人时能造成更高的伤害，并降低受到该类怪物造成的伤害）",
	["(Recently refers to the past 4 seconds)"] = "( 近期内意指 4 秒内 )",
	["(Rune Daggers are considered Daggers)"] = "（符文匕首视为匕首）",
	["(Sapped Enemies deal up to 20% less Damage, based on the Lightning Damage of the Hit, for 4 seconds)"] = "（基于击中的闪电伤害，使【精疲力尽】的敌人造成的总伤害降低最多 20%，持续 4 秒）",
	["(Scorched Enemies have their Elemental Resistances lowered by up to 30%, based on the Fire Damage of the Hit, for 4 seconds)"] = "（基于击中的火焰伤害，使被【灼烧】的敌人元素抗性最多降低 30%，持续 4 秒）",
	["(Shattershard duration)"] = "(破裂碎片持续时间)",
	["(Shock increases Damage taken by 15%)"] = "（感电使敌人受到的伤害提高 15%）",
	["(Shock increases Damage taken by up to 50%)"] = "（感电可使敌人受到的伤害最多提高50%）",
	["(Shock increases Damage taken by up to 50%, depending on the amount of Lightning Damage in the hit, for 2 seconds)"] = "（感电能额外提高至多50%的伤害，取决于击中的闪电伤害量, 持续2秒）",
	["(Skill usages required)"] = "(所需技能使用次数)",
	["(Str)"] = "(力量)",
	["(Such a hit would drain the following resources:)"] = "(此击中将消耗以下资源：)",
	["(Summon two Triggerbots which follow you around and run towards enemies. Your Triggered Spells Trigger twice, once from each Triggerbot's location)"] = "（召唤两个会跟随你移动的触发机器人，它们会冲向你的敌人。你的触发法术在每个触发机器人的位置各触发一次，共两次）",
	["(Summons a Relic of a random element that stays near you. Depending on the element chosen, the relic minion will have an Anger, Hatred, or Wrath aura. These relics explode when they die, dealing elemental damage to enemies around them. If you already have a relic of the chosen element, its duration will be refreshed instead of summoning a new one)"] = "（在你身旁召唤一个随机元素的遗物。根据选择的元素，遗物召唤生物会具有愤怒、憎恨或雷霆光环。遗物被击败时爆炸，对周围的敌人造成元素伤害。如果你已拥有该元素的遗物，则会刷新它的持续时间，而非召唤一个新的遗物）",
	["(Summons a Sentinel of Radiance which follows you and attacks enemies in melee, while burning enemies around it and taking a portion of damage from hits for you. You can only have one Sentinel of Radiance)"] = "（召唤一个跟随你的光辉哨兵，它会攻击近战范围内的敌人，使周围的敌人燃烧，并替你承受一定比例的击中伤害。你只能拥有一个光辉哨兵）",
	["(Summons a spectral tiger companion that attacks nearby enemies and dies after a duration. Each spectral tiger grants you a buff that increases Critical Strike Chance, and increases Attack and Cast Speed. If you have the maximum number of them, refreshes the duration and life of an existing one instead)"] = "（召唤一头幽虎同伴攻击周围的敌人，持续一段时间后消失。每头幽虎都会给你提供增益效果，可以增加暴击几率，并提升攻击和施法速度。达到召唤上限时使用会刷新其中一头幽虎的生命和持续时间。）",
	["(Summons an immortal Harbinger minion. The minion will cast a random buff on you that grants one or all of the following: Fire 2 additional Projectiles, Chain 2 additional times, Projectiles Pierce 2 additional targets, or Projectiles Fork then Fork an additional time)"] = "（召唤一个不死的先驱者。它会对你施放随机增益，附加以下任意一个或全部效果：发射 2 个额外投射物，额外连锁 2 次，投射物穿透 2 个额外目标，或者投射物分裂时额外分裂一次）",
	["(Superseded)"] = "（已被替代）",
	["(Swap)"] = "(切换)",
	["(Tailwind increases Action Speed by 8%)"] = "（提速尾流使行动速度加快 8%）",
	["(Take 1% less Damage from Hits per Fortification. Maximum 20 Fortification)"] = "（受到的击中伤害按照每层护体效果总降 1%。最多 20 层护体）",
	["(Take 1% less Damage from Hits per Fortification. Maximum 20 Fortification. Fortification lasts 6 seconds)"] = "（受到的击中伤害按照每层护体效果总降1%。最多20层护体。护身持续6秒）",
	["(Tawhoa's Chosen base cooldown)"] = "(塔赫亚神选基础冷却时间)",
	["(The Damage Types are Physical, Fire, Cold, Lightning, and Chaos)"] = "( 伤害种类分为物理, 火焰, 冰霜, 闪电, 和混沌 )",
	["(The Stun Threshold determines how much Damage can Stun something)"] = "(眩晕门槛决定了多少伤害可以眩晕目标)",
	["(The buff still applies to you after you leave the Banner's area)"] = "（离开旗帜范围后，该增益依然对你生效）",
	["(The effects of the ground still apply to you, allies or enemies after leaving its area)"] = "（离开此区域，地面的效果也会附加于你、友军或敌人）",
	["(These are consecutive)"] = "(这些都是连续的)",
	["(They will also not be put on cooldown if they remain Usable)"] = "（维持可用状态时，技能不会进入冷却）",
	["(They will deal the same total damage over a shorter duration)"] = "（他们会在短时间内造成相同的伤害）",
	["(This is the average roll of an ignite affecting the enemy if you are constantly attacking)"] = "(持续攻击时，这是敌人所受点燃伤害的平均浮动值)",
	["(This only affects the inherent loss of Rage when you haven't been Hit or gained Rage Recently)"] = "（只影响近期内没有被击中或没有获得怒火时，怒火的固有损耗）",
	["(This part of the hit drains the following resources:)"] = "(此次击中的这一部分将消耗以下资源：)",
	["(Throwing Mines takes 10% more time for each additional Mine thrown)"] = "（每投掷一个额外地雷都使投掷地雷时间延长 10%）",
	["(Tinctures periodically inflict Mana Burn on you while active)"] = "（酊剂激活时会周期性地对你造成魔力燃烧）",
	["(Total damage)"] = "(总伤害)",
	["(Total life protected)"] = "(受保护的生命总量)",
	["(Trigger bots effectively cause the skill to trigger twice)"] = "(触发机器人使技能实际触发两次)",
	["(Unbound Avatar requires 100 Unbound Fury to use and causes you to become Unbound for 10 seconds, which has no effects beyond those listed here)"] = "（不羁化身需要 100 点不羁狂怒才能使用，使你在 10 秒内获得不羁状态，其效果皆已在此列出）",
	["(Uncapped Bleed DPS Range)"] = "(未受上限限制的流血每秒伤害范围)",
	["(Uncapped Bleed DPS)"] = "(未受上限限制的流血每秒伤害)",
	["(Uncapped Chance to Block is the value Chance to Block would have if ignoring Maximum Chance to Block)"] = "（无上限格挡率指通过某些方式无视最大格挡率的数值）",
	["(Uncapped Ignite DPS Range)"] = "(未受上限限制的点燃每秒伤害范围)",
	["(Uncapped Ignite DPS)"] = "(未受上限限制的点燃每秒伤害)",
	["(Uncapped Poison DPS Range)"] = "(未受上限限制的中毒每秒伤害范围)",
	["(Uncapped Poison DPS)"] = "(未受上限限制的中毒每秒伤害)",
	["(Uncapped raw Bleed DPS)"] = "(未受上限限制的原始流血每秒伤害)",
	["(Uncapped raw Ignite DPS)"] = "(未受上限限制的原始点燃每秒伤害)",
	["(Uncapped raw Poison DPS)"] = "(未受上限限制的原始中毒每秒伤害)",
	["(Unholy Might grants 100% of Physical Damage converted to Chaos Damage and 25% chance to apply Withered on Hit)"] = "（不洁之力使 100% 的物理伤害转化为混沌伤害，并且击中时有 25% 的几率施加死亡凋零）",
	["(Unlucky things are rolled twice and the worst result used)"] = "（不幸会重复判定两次，并采用较差的结果）",
	["(Unnerved enemies take 10% increased Spell Damage)"] = "（恐惧的敌人受到的法术伤害提高 10%）",
	["(Unseen Strike from The Hidden Blade has no cooldown but is still triggered)"] = "(隐匿之刃提供的隐形打击没有冷却时间，但仍属于触发技能)",
	["(Unsupported)"] = "（尚未支持）",
	["(Up to 10 Vines can grasp you, inflicting 8% less Movement Speed per Vine. Broken by moving)"] = "（最多有 10 根蔓藤可以抓住你，每根蔓藤都使你移动速度降低 8%。移动可以挣脱）",
	["(Vaal Non-Aura Skills require 80% less Souls. Vaal Non-Aura Skills require 100% increased Souls per Vaal Skill used in the past 8 seconds)"] = "（非光环瓦尔技能的灵魂消耗总降 80%。你在过去 8 秒内每使用一个瓦尔技能，非光环瓦尔技能的灵魂消耗提高 100%。）",
	["(Valour is gained while you have a Banner skill and augments the power of those skills)"] = "（拥有旗帜技能时，你可以获得胆魄，并以此强化旗帜技能的效果）",
	["(Vixen's trigger cooldown)"] = "(刁妇的圈套触发冷却时间)",
	["(WarcryMaxHit Override)"] = "(战吼最大击中覆盖设置)",
	["(Warstaves are considered Staves)"] = "（战杖视为长杖）",
	["(Weeping Wounds cause you to lose 1% of your maximum Life per second per stack. Tinctures deactivate when you have 1 life remaining)"] = "（泣血创伤每层使你每秒失去 1% 的最大生命。酊剂会在你剩余 1 点生命时失效。）",
	["(When an Impaled enemy is hit, the Impale reflects 10% of the physical damage of the Impaling hit to that enemy. Impale lasts for 5 hits or 8 seconds)"] = "（当一个被穿刺的敌人被击中，穿刺效果会对该敌人造成该穿刺击中物理伤害的 10%。穿刺效果持续 5 次击中，或持续 8 秒）",
	["(When you cast a Spell, Sacrifice all Mana to gain Added Maximum Lightning Damage"] = "（施放法术时献祭全部魔力，获得附加最大闪电伤害，",
	["(When you reach full Energy Shield, Sacrifice all Energy Shield to gain +5% to all Maximum Resistances for 4 seconds)"] = "（能量护盾回满时，献祭所有能量护盾，使抗性上限在 4 秒内 +5%）",
	["(While you have Phasing, your movement is not blocked by Enemies)"] = "( 当你进入迷踪状态时, 你将不会被敌人所阻挡 )",
	["(While you have this passive allocated, you will have the option to permanently hire Mercenaries found in the wild. Permanently hired Mercenaries and their Minions deal less Damage than temporarily hired Mercenaries, but you can change what gear they have equipped. Passives that affect your Mercenary do not affect temporarily hired Mercenaries. Permanently hired Mercenaries will only follow Luminaries with this passive allocated)"] = "（当你分配此天赋后，你将可以选择永久雇佣在野外遭遇的佣兵。永久雇佣的佣兵及其召唤生物造成的伤害低于临时佣兵，但你可以更换他们的装备。影响佣兵的天赋不会影响临时佣兵。永久佣兵只会跟随分配了此天赋的光明使者）",
	["(Wild Savagery grants 100% increased Physical Damage, 10% increased Action Speed, Hits ignore Enemy Physical Damage Reduction and Cannot be Stunned)"] = "（野性凶暴使你造成的物理伤害提高100%，行动速度提高10%，击中将使敌人的物理伤害减免失效，并且你无法被眩晕。）",
	["(Withered applies 6% increased Chaos Damage Taken, and can be inflicted up to 15 times)"] = "（死亡凋零会使受到的混沌伤害提高 6%，最多造成 15 次)",
	["(You are Unencumbered while you have no Gloves, no Main Hand Item, and no Off Hand Item Equipped)"] = "（未装备手部装备、主手物品、副手物品时，视为无负重状态）",
