	["A Chilling Wind"] = "一股寒风",
	["A Primalist of the\nWildwood answers\nto no one."] = "独行荒林的原初者，\n不曾回应，\n不曾俯首。",
	["A Warden of the Maji has sworn\nto walk the righteous path."] = "献身众神的守望者，\n立誓践行正义之路。",
	["A bloody scythe swipes across a selected area, applying a physical damage over time debuff and hitting enemies with physical damage. If any survive, you gain a blood charge which raises the damage and cost of the skill. Players can have 5 maximum blood charges."] = "召唤一把赤色镰刀横扫选择的区域，对敌人造成物理伤害，并附加持续物理伤害的减益效果。如果有敌人幸存，你获得 1 个赤炼球，它可以同时提高技能的消耗和伤害。玩家最多可以有 5 个赤炼球。",
	["A bloody scythe swipes around you, applying a physical damage over time debuff and hitting enemies with physical damage. If any survive, you gain a blood charge which raises the damage and cost of the skill. Players can have 5 maximum blood charges."] = "召唤一把赤色镰刀环绕挥舞，对敌人造成物理伤害，并附加持续物理伤害减益效果。如果有敌人幸存，你获得 1 个赤炼球，同时提高技能的消耗和伤害。玩家最多可以有 5 个赤炼球。",
	["A bolt of Beidat's lightning strikes an area, dealing lightning damage."] = "一道贝达特的闪电击中一片区域，造成闪电伤害。",
	["A bolt of lightning strikes an area, dealing lightning damage."] = "使用雷击攻击一个区域, 造成闪电伤害.",
	["A burst of flame errupts from the location of a hit, dealing fire damage."] = "喷发出一道火焰, 造成火焰伤害.",
	["A chilling circle of ice expands from the caster, repeating from every enemy it hits."] = "从施法者散发出一圈寒冰之环，并在每位被击中的敌人身上再次散发。",
	["A circle of ice expands from the caster."] = "从施法者散发出一圈寒冰之环。",
	["A circle of ice expands from the caster. If the caster targets near their Frostbolt projectiles, it will expand from a number of those projectiles instead. If this skill would repeat when cast this way, it will instead expand again from the same projectiles after a short delay."] = "从施法者散发出一圈寒冰之环。如果施法者目标在寒冰弹附近，冰环就会在冰弹处扩散。如果该技能通过此方式重复触发，则会在短暂延迟后在相同冰弹处再次扩散。",
	["A corpse near the targeted location explodes, dealing damage in a small area and creating an orb which moves towards nearby enemies before dealing spell damage in a larger area. The explosion of the corpse is not affected by modifiers to spell damage, and cannot be reflected."] = "目标附近的灵柩爆炸造成小范围伤害，并召唤一个自动追踪敌人的火球，可以造成较大范围的法术伤害。灵柩爆炸造成的伤害无法被法术伤害词缀加成，并且无法被反射。",
	["A debuff that applies:"] = "施加以下减益：",
	["A debuff that applies:\n\tDeal 10% less Damage\n\t10% reduced Action Speed"] = "施加以下减益：\n\t造成的伤害总降 10%\n\t行动速度降低 10%",
	["A fixed number of flaming bolts rain down in a spiral, culminating in the central one impacting the targeted location. They explode when landing, dealing damage to nearby enemies and leaving burning ground, which deals fire damage over time."] = "固定数量的火焰之箭呈螺旋状落下，并最终击中目标位置。它们在落地时会产生爆炸，对附近的敌人造成伤害，并留下燃烧的地面，持续造成火焰伤害。",
	["A giant crystal of abyssal soulstone is called from above, falling to slam down at the targeted location."] = "从天空召唤一块巨大的深渊魂石水晶，坠落并砸击目标地点。",
	["A large flaming bolt falls towards the targeted area. The bolt explodes when landing, dealing damage to nearby enemies."] = "低语呢喃，呼唤一枚巨大的火焰之球向目标区域撞击。火球落地时将会爆炸，并对周围的敌人造成伤害。",
	["A more realistic value would be to match your Arcane Cloak spend %."] = "更接近实际的数值应与你的奥术斗篷消耗比例一致。",
	["A sacred duty. An ancestral promise.\nDeliver the fury of the wilds and\ntear evil asunder."] = "神圣的职责，先祖的承诺。\n宣泄荒野的愤怒，\n令邪恶粉身碎骨。",
	["A shocking arc of lightning reaches from the caster to a targeted enemy and chains to other enemies. Each time the arc chains from an enemy, it will do so simultaneously to two further enemies, but never to enemies that have already been hit by any of these chains. Also grants a buff making your Arc damage lucky for a short duration."] = "一道感电电弧从施放者射向目标，并会弹射至其他敌人。每次主电弧弹射至一个敌人时，还会同时影响两个远处的敌人，但不会影响已经被任意弹射击中的敌人。同时提供一个增益，使你的电弧伤害在短时间内特别幸运。",
	["A sip of poison each day keeps the shadow of death at bay."] = "日饮少许毒药，方能远离死亡。",
	["A targeted corpse explodes, dealing area damage and turning into a volcanic geyser, which will repeatedly unleash projectiles sequentially over the surrounding area and detonate nearby corpses for a duration. Corpse explosions are not affected by modifiers to spell damage, and cannot be reflected."] = "使目标灵柩爆炸，造成范围伤害并转化为一个熔火喷泉。它将在一段时间内持续向周围放出投射物并引爆周围的灵柩。灵柩的爆炸无法被法术伤害词缀加成，并且无法被反射。",
	["A targeted corpse explodes, dealing area damage and turning into a volcanic geyser, which will repeatedly unleash projectiles sequentially over the surrounding area for a duration. The explosion of the corpse is not affected by modifiers to spell damage, and cannot be reflected."] = "使目标灵柩爆炸，造成范围伤害并转化为一个熔火喷泉。它将在一段时间内持续向周围放出投射物。灵柩的爆炸无法被法术伤害词缀加成，并且无法被反射。",
	["A toad leaps towards enemies and explodes, dealing spell damage in an area."] = "一只蟾蜍跃向敌人并爆炸，对一片区域造成法术伤害。",
	["A toad spawns from the corpse of the slain enemy, leaps towards enemies and explodes, dealing forty percent of the slain enemy's Life as Chaos Damage. This skill's damage is not affected by modifiers to spell damage and cannot be reflected."] = "从被击杀敌人的灵柩中召唤一只蟾蜍，它会扑向敌人并爆炸，造成相当于被击杀敌人生命值 40% 的混沌伤害。此技能的伤害不受法术伤害加成影响，且无法被反射。",
	["A wave of divine fire deals damage in a line, then creates Consecrated Ground and deals damage in an area around the targeted location. A larger shockwave then expands outwards, damaging enemies standing on Consecrated Ground that were not already hit."] = "一股神圣的波涌对一条线上的敌人造成伤害，随后创造奉献地面，并对目标位置周围的区域造成伤害。然后向外发射一股更大的冲击波，对置身于奉献地面中，但没有被击中的敌人造成伤害。",
	["A woman can change the world \nwith a single well-placed arrow."] = "只需一箭，\n便可改变世界的女人。",
