	["Amount of stacks of Barnacle applied to the enemy."] = "施加于敌人的藤壶层数。",
	["Amount of stacks of Barnacle applied to the enemy.\n\n(Enemies affected by Barnacles Convert 5% of Physical Damage to Cold and have 5% increased duration of Chill and Freeze on them.\nEach instance of Barnacles lasts 30 seconds and can be inflicted up to 10 times)"] = "施加于敌人的藤壶层数。\n\n（受到藤壶影响的敌人将物理伤害的 5% 转化为冰霜伤害，其受到的冰缓和冻结持续时间提高 5%。\n每层藤壶持续 30 秒，最多可施加 10 层）",
	["Amount of stacks of Hoarfrost applied to the enemy."] = "施加于敌人的白霜层数。",
	["Amount of stacks of Scorch applied to the enemy."] = "施加于敌人的烧灼层数。",
