	["Animated Weapons deal 40% increased Damage"] = "幻化武器的伤害提高 40%",
	["Animated and Manifested Minions' Melee Strikes deal 50% less Splash Damage"] = "已幻化和已显化的召唤生物的近战攻击造成的扩散伤害总降 50%",
	["Animated and Manifested Minions' Melee Strikes deal Splash"] = "已幻化和已显化的召唤生物的近战攻击",
	["Animated and Manifested Minions' Melee Strikes deal Splash\nDamage to surrounding targets"] = "已幻化和已显化的召唤生物的近战攻击\n对周围目标造成扩散伤害",
	["Animates a Melee Weapon Item or Lingering Blade to fight by your side. You cannot animate unidentified Weapons. Will not animate weapons with 6 sockets. Cannot be used by Traps or Mines."] = "幻化一把近战武器或徘徊之刃为你而战，无法幻化未鉴定的物品。无法幻化有6个插槽的物品。无法用于陷阱或地雷。",
	["Animates a Ranged Weapon Item or Lingering Blade to fight by your side. You cannot animate unidentified Weapons. Will not animate weapons with 6 sockets. Cannot be used by Traps or Mines."] = "幻化一把远程武器或徘徊之刃为你而战，无法幻化未鉴定的物品。无法幻化有6个插槽的物品。无法用于陷阱或地雷。",
	["Animates a copy of your Animated Guardian's main-hand weapon to fight by your side."] = "操纵一把你幻化守卫的主手武器来为你作战。",
	["Animates a copy of your main hand Melee Weapon to fight by your side. Cannot be used by Totems, Traps or Mines."] = "幻化一把你的主手近战武器副本为你而战，无法用于陷阱或地雷。",
	["Animates a melee weapon or armour, attaching it to an invisible Guardian that fights by your side using Smite of Divine Judgement, ignoring weapon restrictions. Animating multiple items attaches them to the same Guardian. You cannot animate unidentified items. Cannot be used by Traps or Mines. If your Guardian dies you cannot summon an Animated Guardian again in that area."] = "为一位隐形守卫幻化一把近战武器或一件护甲，使其为你而战，它会使用圣裁之惩击并忽略武器限制。可以为同一个守卫附加多个幻化物品。无法为其幻化未鉴定的物品。无法用于陷阱或地雷。如果守卫被击败，你无法再该地图再次召唤幻化守卫。",
	["Animates a melee weapon or armour, attaching it to an invisible Guardian that fights by your side. Animating multiple items attaches them to the same Guardian. You cannot animate unidentified items. Cannot be used by Traps or Mines. If your Guardian dies you cannot summon an Animated Guardian again in that area."] = "为一位隐形守卫幻化一把近战武器或一件护甲，使其为你而战。可以为同一个守卫附加多个幻化物品。无法为其幻化未鉴定的物品。无法用于陷阱或地雷。如果守卫被击败，你无法再该地图再次召唤幻化守卫。",
	["Animates multiple Melee Weapon Items and Lingering Blades to fight by your side, and transforms them into different, unique weapons. You cannot animate unidentified Weapons. Will not animate weapons with 6 sockets. Cannot be used by Traps or Mines."] = "幻化多把近战武器和徘徊之刃为你而战，并且将它们变成不同的传奇武器。无法幻化未鉴定的武器。无法幻化有6个插槽的物品。无法用于陷阱或地雷。",
