	["Attacks an area in front of you. Each Reave that hits an enemy grants stages, which you will begin to lose after a short period without hitting anything. Only works with Daggers, Claws, and One-Handed Swords."] = "攻击前方一片区域。击中敌人的每道冲击波都会积累阶段，只要短期内没有击中任何目标就会失去阶段。限定匕首，爪类，单手剑。",
