	["Attacks cannot cause Bleeding"] = "攻击不能导致流血",
	["Attacks enemies with a forceful blow. Requires a Mace, Sceptre, Axe, Sword or Staff."] = "对敌人进行一次强力攻击。限定锤类、短杖、斧类，剑类或长杖。",
	["Attacks enemies with a forceful blow. Requires a Staff."] = "对敌人进行一次强力攻击。需要长杖发动。",
	["Attacks enemies with a melee strike, applying a debuff for a short duration. If a non-unique enemy dies while affected by the debuff, the enemy's corpse will be consumed and a Sentinel of Dominance with the same rarity, prefix and suffix modifiers will be summoned for a longer secondary duration."] = "近战攻击敌人，在短期内施加一个减益效果。如果非传奇敌人在受到该效果影响时击败，则会消耗它的灵柩创造一个统御哨兵，具有相同稀有度、前缀和后缀，并持续一段更长的时间。",
	["Attacks enemies with a powerful melee strike which grants Fortification, reducing damage you take from hits. The cooldown can be bypassed by expending an Endurance Charge. Requires a Melee Weapon."] = "使用一次强力的近战攻击打击敌人并获得防御效果，降低你受到的伤害。可以通过消耗一个耐力球来跳过冷却时间。需要近战武器。",
