	["Calls forth a protective aegis which takes cold damage from hits for you until depleted. The aegis will be restored to its full value after a short delay if you stop taking cold damage from hits, or if depleted."] = "灵唤一个守护护盾，在消散前抵挡击中造成的冰霜伤害。该护盾在一段时间未受到冰霜伤害后会自动回复满值，或自然消散。",
	["Calls forth a protective aegis which takes elemental damage from hits for you until depleted. The aegis will be restored to its full value after a short delay if you stop taking elemental damage from hits, or if depleted."] = "灵唤一个守护护盾，在消散前抵挡击中造成的元素伤害。该护盾在一段时间未受到元素伤害后会自动回复满值，或自然消散。",
	["Calls forth a protective aegis which takes fire damage from hits for you until depleted. The aegis will be restored to its full value after a short delay if you stop taking fire damage from hits, or if depleted."] = "灵唤一个守护护盾，在消散前抵挡击中造成的火焰伤害。该护盾在一段时间未受到火焰伤害后会自动回复满值，或自然消散。",
	["Calls forth a protective aegis which takes lightning damage from hits for you until depleted. The aegis will be restored to its full value after a short delay if you stop taking lightning damage from hits, or if depleted."] = "召唤一个守护护盾，在消散前抵挡击中造成的闪电伤害。该护盾在一段时间未受到闪电伤害后会自动回复满值，或自然消散。",
	["Calls forth a protective aegis which takes physical damage from hits for you until depleted. The aegis will be restored to its full value after a short delay if you stop taking physical damage from hits, or if depleted."] = "召唤一个守护护盾，在消散前抵挡击中造成的物理伤害。该护盾在一段时间未受到物理伤害后会自动回复满值，或自然消散。",
	["Calls forth pillars of ashen flame. These pillars deal Fire damage in an area, and cover Enemies they hit in Ash. Requires a Melee Weapon or Unarmed."] = "召唤出数根苍焰火柱。这些火柱造成范围火焰伤害，并给击中的敌人覆盖灰烬。需要近战武器或徒手发动。",
	["Calls lightning down to infuse your weapon, then performs a melee attack and causes lightning to strike nearby enemies, dealing damage in an area. Hitting an enemy grants an aura for a duration. Requires a Sword, Axe, Mace, Sceptre, Staff or Unarmed."] = "召唤雷霆灌注武器，然后发动一次近战攻击并用闪电攻击周围的敌人，造成范围伤害。击中敌人时使你获得光环并持续一段时间。限定剑类、斧类、锤类、短杖、长杖或空手。",
