	["Cast a pact, Empowering non-channelling spells that either fire projectiles, apply an effect to an area around a targeted location or fire chaining beams, causing them to deal more damage and have enhanced coverage. However, using this skill also burdens you with an Affliction."] = "施放一道契约，强化发射投射物、对目标地点施加范围效果或发射连锁光束的非持续吟唱法术，使其造成更多伤害并拥有更广的覆盖范围。然而，使用此技能也会为你施加 1 项苦痛。",
	["Cast a pact, Empowering the next channelling spells you cast yourself but burdening you with an Affliction. Empowered spells deal more damage and periodically trigger lightning bolts while channelling."] = "施放一道契约，强化你接下来自己施放的持续吟唱法术，但同时为你施加一项苦痛。被强化的法术在吟唱期间造成更多伤害，并周期性触发闪电箭。",
	["Cast a pact, Empowering your damage over time spells but burdening you with an Affliction. This skill also grants the Hunger of Ghorr buff for a duration causing Fleshrend to trigger periodically."] = "施放一道契约，强化你的持续伤害法术，但会为你施加一项苦痛。此技能还会在一段时间内赋予咕尔饥渴增益，使血肉撕裂周期性触发。",
	["Cast a pact, Empowering your damaging Vaal spells but burdening you with an Affliction. Empowered Vaal spells deal more damage, have less soul gain prevention duration and regain consumed souls on use."] = "施放一道契约，强化你的伤害性瓦尔法术，但同时为你施加 1 项苦痛。被强化的瓦尔法术造成更多伤害，阻灵术时间缩短，并在使用时返还消耗的灵魂。",
	["Cast on Death"] = "死亡时施放(辅)",
	["Cast on Death Support"] = "死亡时施放(辅)",
	["Cast on Frostbolt?"] = "是否在寒冰弹上施放？",
	["Cast on Melee Kill"] = "近战击败时施放(辅)",
	["Cast on Melee Kill Support"] = "近战击败时施放(辅)",
	["Cast on Ward Break"] = "结界破碎时释放（辅）",
	["Cast on Ward Break Support"] = "结界破碎时释放（辅）",
	["Cast time"] = "施法耗时",
	["Cast when Damage Taken"] = "受伤时施放(辅)",
	["Cast when Damage Taken Support"] = "受伤时施放(辅)",
	["Cast when Stunned"] = "晕眩时施放(辅)",
	["Cast when Stunned Support"] = "晕眩时施放(辅)",
	["Cast while Channelling"] = "吟唱时施放(辅)",
	["Cast while Channelling Support"] = "吟唱时施放(辅)",
	["Caster Mastery"] = "施法专精",
	["Caster Weapon Display"] = "施法者武器展示台",
	["Caster's"] = "施放者的",
	["Casts a buff that grants different bonuses to melee skills depending on your stance. Using the skill again alternates between Blood Stance and Sand Stance."] = "施放一个增益效果，基于不同的姿态给近战技能施加不同的加成。再次使用该技能会在血姿态和沙姿态之间切换。",
	["Casts a debilitating debuff on enemies in an area, hindering their movement and also inflicts the Withered debuff, which increases the Chaos Damage they take and can stack up to 15 times."] = "施放一个对敌人造成虚弱的范围效果, 造成缓速并且叠加一个使他们增加受到的混沌伤害之减益效果. 此减益效果可叠加 15 层.",
	["Casts a delayed teleport for nearby enemies to a target destination. When the teleport occurs, lightning damage is dealt to the enemies both before and after they teleport."] = "在指定位置施放一个法阵, 在数秒之后将周围的敌人传送过去. 当传送时, 在原本位置与传送法阵位置的敌人都会受到闪电伤害.",
	["Casts a ring of Lightning around you, followed by a larger Lightning nova. Each effect hits enemies caught in their area with Lightning Damage."] = "从施法者散发出一圈闪电之环, 接着散发出更大范围的一圈闪电之环. 每次被击中的敌人会受到闪电伤害.",
	["Casts a ring of Lightning around you, followed by a larger Lightning nova. Each effect hits enemies caught in their area with Lightning Damage. This then repeats, with each repeat offset from the previous in the direction you target."] = "在你周围施放一圈闪电之环，随后释放一道更大的闪电新星。每个效果都会以闪电伤害命中其作用范围内的敌人。此过程将重复进行，且每次重复都会朝你瞄准的方向偏移。",
	["Casts a temporary aura that grants you and your allies additional chance to evade attacks, and makes suppressed spell damage unlucky against you."] = "施放一个光环，让你和友军在短时间内有额外几率避开攻击，并被压制的法术伤害对你特别不幸。",
	["Casts a temporary aura that increases the movement speed, attack speed and cast speed of you and your allies."] = "施放一个短暂的光环, 使你与受光环影响友军获得额外移动速度, 攻击速度以及施法速度.",
	["Casts a temporary aura that lets you and your allies cast skills without paying their mana costs."] = "施放一个短暂的光环，使你与受光环影响友军施放技能时无须消耗魔力.",
	["Casts a temporary aura that prevents energy shield recharge being delayed by damage taken for you and your allies."] = "施放一个短暂的光环，使你与受光环影响友军获得额外的能量护盾，并且不会因为受到攻击而延迟护盾的回复.",
	["Casts an aura that adds chaos damage to the attacks and spells of you and your allies."] = "施放一个光环，使你与受光环影响友军在攻击和施放法术时额外附带混沌伤害.",
	["Casts an aura that adds fire damage to the attacks and spells of you and your allies."] = "施放一个光环，使你与受光环影响友军在攻击和施放法术时额外附带火焰伤害.",
	["Casts an aura that adds lightning damage to the attacks of you and your allies, and makes your spells deal more lightning damage."] = "施放一个光环, 使你与受光环影响友军在攻击时额外附带闪电伤害, 并且造成更多法术闪电伤害.",
	["Casts an aura that causes nearby enemies to take more physical damage."] = "施放一个光环，使你周围的敌人受到的物理伤害提高。",
	["Casts an aura that causes taking elemental damage to heal you and nearby allies instead."] = "施展治愈你和友方的灵气，治愈量等同所受的元素伤害量。",
	["Casts an aura that deals Chaos Damage over Time to nearby Enemies. This skill cannot be cast by Totems."] = "施放一个光环对周围敌人造成持续混沌伤害. 该技能无法被图腾施放.",
	["Casts an aura that grants accuracy and critical strike chance to you and your allies."] = "施放一个光环，使你与受光环影响友军获得命中和暴击几率。",
	["Casts an aura that grants additional energy shield and increased energy shield recharge rate to you and your allies."] = "施放一个光环，使你与受光环影响友军获得额外的能量护盾.",
	["Casts an aura that grants armour to you and your allies."] = "施放一个光环，使你与受光环影响友军获得额外的护甲.",
	["Casts an aura that grants bonuses to damage and critical strike chance of spells to you and your allies, and gives a chance to create Consecrated Ground against stronger enemies."] = "施放一个光环, 使你与受光环影响的友军获得伤害和法术暴击几率加成，并在面对强大敌人时有几率创造奉献地面。",
	["Casts an aura that grants cold resistance to you and your allies."] = "施放一个光环，使你与受光环影响的友军获得额外的冰霜抗性.",
	["Casts an aura that grants elemental resistances and elemental ailment immunity to you and your allies."] = "施放一个光环, 为你和友军提供元素抗性，并免疫元素异常状态。",
	["Casts an aura that grants evasion to you and your allies."] = "施放一个光环，使你与受光环影响友军获得额外的闪避.",
	["Casts an aura that grants extra cold damage based on physical damage to you and your allies."] = "施放一个光环，使你与受光环影响友军获得额外冰霜伤害.",
	["Casts an aura that grants fire resistance to you and your allies."] = "施放一个光环，使你与受光环影响的友军获得额外的火焰抗性.",
	["Casts an aura that grants life regeneration to you and your allies."] = "施放一个光环，使你与受光环影响友军获得额外的生命回复.",
	["Casts an aura that grants lightning resistance to you and your allies."] = "施放一个光环，使你与受光环影响的友军获得额外的闪电抗性.",
	["Casts an aura that grants mana regeneration to you and your allies."] = "施放一个光环，使你与受光环影响友军获得额外的魔力回复.",
	["Casts an aura that increases the movement speed, attack speed and cast speed of you and your allies."] = "施放一个光环, 使你与受光环影响友军获得额外的移动速度, 攻击速度以及施法速度.",
	["Casts an aura that multiplies damage over time and increases skill effect duration of you and your allies."] = "施放一个光环，使你与受光环影响友军造成的持续伤害叠加，技能效果延长。",
	["Casts an aura that reduces cold damage taken and provides freeze and chill immunity to you and nearby allies, and makes hits against nearby enemies ignore their cold resistance."] = "施放一个光环，使你和周围友军受到的冰霜伤害降低，并免疫冰缓效果，并在击中周围敌人时无视他们的冰霜抗性。",
	["Casts an aura that reduces fire damage taken and provides ignite immunity to you and nearby allies, and makes hits against nearby enemies ignore their fire resistance."] = "施放一个光环，使你和周围友军受到的火焰伤害降低，并免疫点燃效果，并在击中周围敌人时无视他们的火焰抗性。",
	["Casts an aura that reduces lightning damage taken and provides shock immunity to you and nearby allies, and makes hits against nearby enemies ignore their lightning resistance."] = "施放一个光环，使你和周围友军受到的闪电伤害降低，并免疫感电效果，并在击中周围敌人时无视他们的闪电抗性。",
