	["Cause spires of bone to erupt from the earth around you. When you use a slam on them, these spires will explode to deal damage in an area and inflicting bleeding."] = "使你周围的地面爆发出白骨尖刺。当你使用猛击击打它们时，这些尖刺会爆炸，对周围区域造成伤害，并施加流血。",
