	["Channelling Spells deal 5% more Damage and"] = "引导法术的伤害总增 5%，且",
	["Channelling Spells have 10% more Cost"] = "引导法术的消耗总增 10%",
	["Channelling draws in energy around you to repeatedly build up stages, damaging a number of nearby enemies when you do so. Release to unleash this energy in a burst around you and a beam in front of you. Modifiers to area of effect do not affect the beam. Maximum of 10 Stages."] = "持续吟唱时会在你的周围汇聚能量，不断堆叠，对周围的一群敌人造成伤害。释放此技能会在你周围产生一次冲击，并在面前射出一道光束。效果范围词缀不影响该光束。最多叠加 10 层。",
	["Channelling draws in energy around you to repeatedly build up stages, damaging a number of nearby enemies when you do so. Release to unleash this energy in a powerful burst around you. Maximum of 10 Stages."] = "持续吟唱时会在你的周围汇聚能量，不断堆叠，对周围的一群敌人造成伤害。释放此技能会在你周围产生一次强大的冲击。最多叠加 10 层。",
	["Channelling draws in energy around you to repeatedly build up stages. Release to unleash this energy in a beam in front of you. Modifiers to area of effect do not affect this skill. Maximum of 10 Stages."] = "持续吟唱时会在你的周围汇聚能量，不断堆叠。释放此技能会在你面前射出一道光束。效果范围词缀不影响该技能。最多叠加 10 层。",
	["Channelling stops when Total Circle Radius reaches 9 metres"] = "当圆圈总范围达到 9 米时停止吟唱",
	["Channelling, Spell, Support"] = "持续吟唱, 法术, 辅助",
	["Channels to build up a large explosion, which is released when you stop using the skill. The longer you channel, the larger the area of effect and damage of the explosion."] = "持续吟唱来施放大型的爆炸。吟唱的时间越长，爆炸的范围与造成的伤害越大。停止使用该技能变会触发爆炸。",
	["Channels to build up an explosion, which is released when you stop using the skill or automatically at maximum stages. The longer you channel, the larger the area of effect and damage of the explosion."] = "持续吟唱来施放一场爆炸。吟唱的时间越长，爆炸的范围与造成的伤害越大。停止使用该技能或达到最大层数时会触发爆炸。",
	["Channels to concentrate an explosion, which is released when you stop using the skill. The longer you channel, the larger the damage of the explosion, but the smaller the area."] = "持续吟唱来汇聚一场爆炸。吟唱的时间越长，爆炸造成的伤害越大，但范围越小。停止使用该技能会触发爆炸。",
