	["Consume Remembrance to summon a memory of the Shaper, which will use a skill once before fading away."] = "消耗铭记以召唤塑界者的记忆，使用一次技能后消散。",
	["Consume Steel Shards to fire a single projectile that splits on impact or at the targeted location, dealing area damage when it splits and again when the split projectiles explode at the end of their flight. Projectiles from this skill cannot return. Requires a Sword or Axe. Steel Shards are gained with the Call of Steel Skill."] = "消耗钢刃碎片发射一枚投射物，在撞击或抵达目标地点时分裂，造成范围伤害。分裂的投射物继续飞行，在结束时再次造成范围伤害。此技能的投射物无法归返。需要剑类或斧类发动。钢刃碎片由钢铁呼唤提供。",
	["Consume a Void Charge to Trigger this Skill when you fire Arrows with a Non-Triggered Skill"] = "你使用非触发型技能发射箭矢时，消耗一枚虚空之矢来触发该技能",
	["Consumed 12 Steel Shards Recently?"] = "近期内是否消耗过 12 枚钢刃碎片？",
	["Consumed a corpse Recently?"] = "近期内是否消耗过灵柩？",
	["Consumed a corpse in the past 2s?"] = "过去 2 秒内是否消耗过灵柩？",
	["Consumes 10 Remembrance"] = "消耗 10 铭记",
	["Consumes Frenzy Charges on use"] = "使用时消耗狂怒球",
	["Consumes Maximum Charges to use"] = "使用会消耗最大充能",
	["Consumes Rage at an accelerating rate to increase the effects of Rage."] = "以越来越快的速度消耗怒火，并提高怒火的效果。",
	["Consumes Socketed Uncorrupted Support Gems when they reach Maximum Level"] = "当插槽内未腐化的辅助宝石达到最大等级时吞噬该宝石",
	["Consumes Socketed Uncorrupted Support Gems when they reach Maximum Level\nCan Consume 4 Uncorrupted Support Gems\nHas not Consumed any Gems"] = "当插槽内未腐化的辅助宝石达到最大等级时吞噬该宝石\n可以吞噬 4 个未腐化的辅助宝石\n尚未吞噬任何宝石",
	["Consumes a Void Charge to Trigger Level 20 Void Shot when you fire Arrows with a Non-Triggered Skill"] = "你使用非触发型技能发射箭矢时，消耗一枚虚空之矢可以触发 20 级的虚空射击",
	["Consumes a corpse, and sacrifices a portion of your life, granting your minions life regeneration based on the life sacrificed, and a bonus to damage. The skill consumes other nearby corpses, increasing the duration and life regeneration for each corpse consumed."] = "消耗一具灵柩，牺牲你的一部分生命，根据牺牲量给予你的召唤生物生命再生以及伤害加成的效果。技能会消耗附近的灵柩，每消耗一具灵柩就会增加持续时间和生命再生。",
	["Consumes a corpse, granting all of your minions the power to block both attacks and spells. The skill consumes other nearby corpses, increasing the duration for each corpse consumed."] = "献祭一具灵柩, 使你的召唤生物获得格挡攻击与法术的能力. 这个技能会持续献祭附近的灵柩, 每具献祭的灵柩将会延长强化召唤生物的时间.",
	["Consumes a corpse, granting increased critical strike chance and additional critical strike multiplier to your minions. The skill consumes other nearby corpses, increasing the duration for each corpse consumed."] = "消耗一具灵柩，提高你的召唤生物的暴击率，赋予它额外的暴击伤害加成效果。技能会消耗附近的灵柩，每消耗一具灵柩就会增加持续时间。",
	["Consumes a corpse, which temporarily empowers your minions with swiftness. The skill consumes other nearby corpses, increasing the duration for each corpse consumed."] = "献祭一具灵柩, 短暂的强化与加速你的召唤生物. 这个技能会持续献祭附近的灵柩, 每具献祭的灵柩将会延长强化召唤生物的时间.",
	["Consumes a spirit charge to fire projectiles which deals physical damage."] = "消耗一个精神能量球发射一个投射物并造成物理伤害。",
	["Consumes a targeted corpse, granting you a buff that gives you bonuses against enemies of the same monster category as the corpse."] = "吞噬一个目标灵柩，使你获得一项增益，在对抗与灵柩怪物类型相同的敌人时获得加成效果。",
	["Consumes all Unbound Fury on use"] = "使用时消耗所有不羁狂怒",
	["Consumes one Cooldown Use per Statue Summoned"] = "每召唤一个雕像，消耗一次冷却时间次数",
	["Consumes up to 1 corpse"] = "最多消耗 1 具灵柩",
	["Consuming Tempest"] = "消耗风暴",
	["Contagion"] = "顽疾",
	["Contagion of Subsiding"] = "痼疾之瘟疫",
	["Contagion of Transference"] = "转移之瘟疫",
	["Contains searches from the official trading site to help find"] = "包含官方交易网站的搜索条件，用于查找",
	["Contaminate"] = "玷污",
	["Contemplative Meditation"] = "沉思冥想",
	["Continue"] = "继续",
	["Continuous"] = "恒续的",
	["Continuously launches a torrent of fire from your hand, repeatedly damaging enemies. As you channel this spell longer, the flames spread wider close to you and spread longer directly in front of you."] = "持续从手中发出烈焰洪流，反复对敌人造成伤害。你吟唱此法术时间越长，烈焰在你近身的面积就越广，在你前方的波及范围就越长。",
	["Continuously launches a torrent of fire from your hand, repeatedly damaging enemies. As you channel this spell longer, the flames spread wider close to you and spread longer directly in front of you. When you stop channelling you release a slow-moving wave of fire damage over a very large area that will apply a powerful Ignite."] = "持续从手中发出烈焰洪流，反复对敌人造成伤害。你吟唱此法术时间越长，烈焰在你近身的面积就越广，在你前方的波及范围就越长。当你停止吟唱，则在大范围内释放一道移动缓慢的火焰伤害波，并附加强大的点燃效果。",
	["Continuously launches a torrent of fire from your hand, repeatedly damaging enemies. As you channel this spell longer, the flames spread wider close to you and spread longer directly in front of you. When you stop channelling you release a wave of fire damage over a wide and long area that will apply a powerful Ignite."] = "持续从手中发出烈焰洪流，反复对敌人造成伤害。你吟唱此法术时间越长，烈焰在你近身的面积就越广，在你前方的波及范围就越长。当你停止吟唱，则对已波及的面积和范围内造成一股火焰伤害，并附加强大的点燃效果。",
	["Continuously launches unpredictable sparks in all directions that move randomly until they hit an enemy or expire."] = "持续的施放出大量变幻莫测的电球，这些电球将会随机移动直到撞到敌人或是自然消失.",
	["Contribution from Crits"] = "暴击部分的贡献",
	["Contribution from Non-crits"] = "非暴击部分的贡献",
	["Control + click to open in web-browser"] = "按住 Ctrl 点击以在浏览器中打开",
	["Controlled Blaze"] = "精准炽炎（辅）",
	["Controlled Blaze Support"] = "精准炽炎（辅）",
	["Controlled Destruction"] = "精准破坏(辅)",
	["Controlled Destruction Support"] = "精准破坏(辅)",
	["Controls how Defending with Double Armour is calculated:"] = "设置以两倍护甲防御的计算方式：",
	["Controls how Defending with Double Armour is calculated:\n\tMinimum: never Defend with Double Armour\n\tAverage: Damage Reduction from Defending with Double Armour is proportional to chance\n\tMaximum: always Defend with Double Armour\nThis setting has no effect if you have 100% chance to Defend with Double Armour."] = "设置以两倍护甲防御的计算方式：\n\t最小：从不以两倍护甲防御\n\t平均：以两倍护甲防御获得的伤害减免按触发几率折算\n\t最大：始终以两倍护甲防御\n以两倍护甲防御的几率达到 100% 时，此设置无效。",
	["Controls how Empowered spells from Pacts are calculated:"] = "设置契约强化法术的计算方式：",
	["Controls how Empowered spells from Pacts are calculated:\nAverage: Averages the effect based on Pact uptime.\nMax Hit: Applies the full effect to one Empowered spell."] = "设置契约强化法术的计算方式：\n平均：根据契约生效时间占比计算平均效果。\n最大击中：将全部效果应用于一次强化法术。",
	["Controls how exerted attacks from Warcries are calculated:"] = "设置战吼增助攻击的计算方式：",
	["Controls how exerted attacks from Warcries are calculated:\nAverage: Averages out Warcry usage with cast time, attack speed and warcry cooldown.\nMax Hit: Shows maximum hit for lining up all warcries."] = "设置战吼增助攻击的计算方式：\n平均：根据施放时间、攻击速度和战吼冷却时间计算战吼使用的平均效果。\n最大击中：显示全部战吼效果同时生效时的最大击中伤害。",
	["Controls how life regeneration is calculated:"] = "设置生命再生的计算方式：",
	["Controls how life regeneration is calculated:\n\tMinimum: does not include burst regen\n\tAverage: includes burst regen, averaged based on uptime\n\tBurst: includes full burst regen"] = "设置生命再生的计算方式：\n\t最小：不计入爆发再生\n\t平均：计入爆发再生，并按生效时间占比折算\n\t爆发：计入完整的爆发再生效果",
	["Controls how modifiers which choose a random element will function."] = "设置随机选择元素的词缀如何计算。",
	["Controls how modifiers which choose a random element will function.\n\tAverage: Modifiers will grant one third of their value to Fire, Cold, and Lightning simultaneously\n\tFire / Cold / Lightning: Modifiers will grant their full value as the specified element\nIf a modifier chooses between just two elements, the full value can only be given as those two elements."] = "设置随机选择元素的词缀如何计算。\n\t平均：词缀数值同时按三分之一计入火焰、冰霜和闪电\n\t火焰／冰霜／闪电：词缀数值全部计入指定元素\n若词缀只在两种元素中选择，则完整数值只能分配给这两种元素。",
	["Controls how resource on hit/kill is calculated:"] = "设置击中／击败敌人时获取资源的计算方式：",
	["Controls how resource on hit/kill is calculated:\n\tMinimum: does not include chances\n\tAverage: includes chance gains, averaged based on uptime\n\tMaximum: treats all chances as certain"] = "设置击中／击败敌人时获取资源的计算方式：\n\t最小：不计入几率触发的效果\n\t平均：计入几率触发的获取效果，并按生效时间占比折算\n\t最大：将所有几率视为必定触发",
	["Controls how the base damage for applying Ailments is calculated:"] = "设置异常状态基础伤害的计算方式：",
	["Controls how the base damage for applying Ailments is calculated:\n\tAverage: damage is based on the average application, including both crits and non-crits\n\tCrits Only: damage is based solely on Ailments inflicted with crits"] = "设置异常状态基础伤害的计算方式：\n\t平均：按包含暴击及非暴击的平均效果计算伤害\n\t仅暴击：仅按暴击施加的异常状态计算伤害",
	["Controls how the chance on hit to ignore enemy physical damage reduction is calculated:"] = "设置击中时有几率无视敌人物理伤害减免的计算方式：",
	["Controls how the chance on hit to ignore enemy physical damage reduction is calculated:\n\tMinimum: never ignores unless chance is at least 100%\n\tAverage: damage is based on the average application\n\tMax Effect: always ignores if you have any chance"] = "设置击中时有几率无视敌人物理伤害减免的计算方式：\n\t最小：只有触发几率达到 100% 时才无视\n\t平均：按平均生效效果计算伤害\n\t最大效果：只要有触发几率就视为始终无视",
	["Controls how the hit/ailment effect of Ruthless Support is calculated:"] = "设置无情辅助击中／异常状态效果的计算方式：",
	["Controls how the hit/ailment effect of Ruthless Support is calculated:\n\tAverage: damage is based on the average application\n\tMax Effect: damage is based on maximum effect"] = "设置无情辅助击中／异常状态效果的计算方式：\n\t平均：按平均生效效果计算伤害\n\t最大效果：按最大效果计算伤害",
	["Controls which types of damage the EHP calculation uses:"] = "设置有效生命计算所使用的伤害类型：",
	["Controls which types of damage the EHP calculation uses:\n\tAverage: uses the Average of all typed damage types (except Damage Over Time and Untyped)\n\nIf a specific damage type is selected, that will be the only type used."] = "设置有效生命计算所使用的伤害类型：\n\t平均：使用所有明确类型伤害的平均值（持续伤害及无类型伤害除外）\n\n若选择了具体伤害类型，则仅使用该类型计算。",
