	["Counts Conductivity as self-cast for Balance of Terror without applying it to enemies."] = "为恐惧之平衡判定计入自行施放的导电，但不将此诅咒施加于敌人。",
	["Counts Despair as self-cast for Balance of Terror without applying it to enemies."] = "为恐惧之平衡判定计入自行施放的绝望，但不将此诅咒施加于敌人。",
	["Counts Elemental Weakness as self-cast for Balance of Terror without applying it to enemies."] = "为恐惧之平衡判定计入自行施放的元素要害，但不将此诅咒施加于敌人。",
	["Counts Enfeeble as self-cast for Balance of Terror without applying it to enemies."] = "为恐惧之平衡判定计入自行施放的衰弱，但不将此诅咒施加于敌人。",
	["Counts Flammability as self-cast for Balance of Terror without applying it to enemies."] = "为恐惧之平衡判定计入自行施放的易燃，但不将此诅咒施加于敌人。",
	["Counts Frostbite as self-cast for Balance of Terror without applying it to enemies."] = "为恐惧之平衡判定计入自行施放的冻伤，但不将此诅咒施加于敌人。",
	["Counts Punishment as self-cast for Balance of Terror without applying it to enemies."] = "为恐惧之平衡判定计入自行施放的惩戒，但不将此诅咒施加于敌人。",
	["Counts Temporal Chains as self-cast for Balance of Terror without applying it to enemies."] = "为恐惧之平衡判定计入自行施放的时空锁链，但不将此诅咒施加于敌人。",
	["Counts Vulnerability as self-cast for Balance of Terror without applying it to enemies."] = "为恐惧之平衡判定计入自行施放的脆弱，但不将此诅咒施加于敌人。",
