	["Cover Enemies in Ash for 5 seconds when you Ignite them"] = "你点燃敌人时在接下来 5 秒使其被灰烬缠身",
	["Cover Enemies in Ash on Hit"] = "击中施加灰烬缠身",
	["Cover Enemies in Ash when they Hit you"] = "被击中时让敌人受到灰烬缠身",
