	["Cover Full Life Enemies in Ash for (4-10) seconds on Melee Weapon Hit"] = "近战武器击中满血敌人时使其灰烬缠身，持续 (4-10) 秒",
	["Covered In Ash"] = "灰烬缠身",
	["Covered In Frost"] = "冰霜缠身",
	["Covered in Ash applies the following to the enemy:"] = "灰烬缠身对敌人施加以下效果：",
	["Covered in Ash applies the following to the enemy:\n\t20% increased Fire Damage taken\n\t20% less Movement Speed"] = "灰烬缠身对敌人施加以下效果：\n\t承受的火焰伤害提高 20%\n\t移动速度总降 20%",
	["Covered in Frost applies the following to the enemy:"] = "冰霜缠身对敌人施加以下效果：",
	["Covered in Frost applies the following to the enemy:\n\t20% increased Cold Damage taken\n\t50% less Critical Strike Chance"] = "冰霜缠身对敌人施加以下效果：\n\t承受的冰霜伤害提高 20%\n\t暴击几率总降 50%",
