	["Create"] = "创建",
	["Create Consecrated Ground when Hit, lasting 8 seconds"] = "被击中时制造奉献地面，持续 8 秒",
	["Create Consecrated Ground when you Shatter an Enemy"] = "当你击碎冰冻的敌人时，制造奉献地面",
	["Create Custom"] = "创建自定义",
	["Create Custom..."] = "创建自定义…",
	["Create Fungal Ground instead of Consecrated Ground"] = "产生真菌地表，而非奉献地面",
	["Create Lesser Shrine"] = "创造低等神龛",
	["Create Profane Ground instead of Consecrated Ground"] = "创造渎神地面来代替奉献地面",
	["Create a Blighted Spore when your Skills or Minions Kill a Rare Monster"] = "当技能或召唤生物击败稀有怪物时产生一个菌潮孢子",
	["Create a Tornado of a random element that hinders and repeatedly damages enemies around it, converting physical damage to its element. The Tornado will chase down enemies for a duration."] = "产生一道随机元素的龙卷风妨碍敌人，并反复对它们施加伤害，将物理伤害转换为该类元素伤害。龙卷风会追逐敌人一段时间。",
	["Create a Tornado that hinders and repeatedly damages enemies around it. It will move forward for a duration, during which your projectiles can collide with it to deal damage as though it was an enemy. Then it will chase down enemies for a secondary duration, and reflect a portion of the damage it took from your projectiles to them in addition to its own damage."] = "产生一道龙卷风妨碍敌人，并反复对它们施加伤害。它会向前移动一段时间，你可以借此机会朝它发射投射物，使其提升对敌人造成的伤害。随后它会追逐敌人一段时间，把你对它施加的伤害和它本身的伤害一起施加给敌人。",
	["Create a burst of lightning from your Bow, firing no arrows but damaging enemies in a cone in front of you."] = "用弓引起闪电爆发，不射出箭矢，但会对前方锥形区域内的敌人造成伤害。",
	["Create a sphere of water, or move an existing sphere and reset its duration. The sphere continually applies a drenched debuff with a short duration to enemies in its area or those it moves through. You can hit the sphere with other skills to inflict Cold and Lightning Ailments (other than Chill). The sphere pulses when created, at regular intervals while afflicted by an Ailment, and after moving, damaging all drenched enemies in a large area."] = "创造一个水球，或移动一个现有的水球并重置它的持续时间。水球持续不断会给它范围内或穿越其范围的生物施加一个短时间存在的浸湿减益效果。你可以用其它技能攻击水球，使其施加冰霜和闪电异常状态。它会固定间隔一段时间发射脉冲。它移动后，会对浸湿的敌人造成广域伤害。",
	["Create a wall of fire for a duration, which deals burning damage to everything in its area. Each enemy that enters the wall also receives a secondary burning debuff which persists for a short duration after leaving the wall. Any projectiles fired through the wall by you and allies deal added fire damage and apply the wall's secondary debuff on hit."] = "产生一面火墙，持续一段时间，对其中的一切造成燃烧伤害。每个进入火墙的敌人在离开时都会获得一个持续很短时间的次级燃烧减益效果。你和友军发射的投射物只要穿过火墙都会附加火焰伤害，并且击中附加次级燃烧减益效果。",
	["Create custom..."] = "创建自定义物品…",
	["Creates Chilled Ground on Use"] = "使用时制造冰缓地面",
	["Creates Consecrated Ground on Use"] = "使用时产生奉献地面",
	["Creates a Lesser Shrine, which will grant a bonus when touched. The Lesser Shrine will disappear after a short duration, or when used. This skill starts on cooldown."] = "创造一个低等神龛, 触摸即可获得加成. 使用后或是放置一段时间后低等神殿即会消失. 技能冷却开始生效.",
	["Creates a Smoke Cloud in an area, which blinds enemies within it."] = "在一个区域内创建一片烟雾，处于其中的敌人将被致盲。",
	["Creates a Smoke Cloud on Rampage"] = "暴走状态时创造一团烟雾",
	["Creates a Smoke Cloud on Use"] = "使用时产生一片烟雾",
	["Creates a Void Sphere which Hinders enemies in an area around it, with the debuff being stronger on enemies closer to the sphere. It also regularly releases pulses of area damage. The Void Sphere will consume the corpses of any enemies which die in its area. Can only have one Void Sphere at a time."] = "创造一个虚空法球，使它周围的敌人缓速。距离法球越近，该减益效果就越强。法球还会定期辐射范围伤害。虚空法球会消耗其范围内被击败的任何敌人的残骸。同时只能施放一个虚空法球。",
	["Creates a ball of lightning at a location that damages each enemy in an area around it repeatedly with bolts of lightning. Cannot be supported by Spell Echo or used by Totems."] = "在一个位置创造天雷之珠，对周围的每个敌人反复施放闪电并造成伤害。无法被施法回响辅助或被图腾使用。",
	["Creates a clone of you that attacks with your weapon."] = "制造一个与你使用同样武器的复制体。此技能有短暂冷却时间。",
	["Creates a crystal that pulses with cold for a duration. Each pulse applies a debuff to nearby enemies for a secondary duration which reduces life regeneration rate, and also inflicts Cold Exposure. When the crystal's duration ends, it explodes, dealing heavy cold damage to enemies around it."] = "创造一个冰晶，在一段时间内脉冲冰霜能量。每次脉冲都会给周围敌人施加一个有单独持续时间的减益效果，降低其生命回复速度，同时给它们施加冰霜曝露。冰晶持续时间结束后会爆炸，对周围敌人造成大量冰霜伤害。",
	["Creates a crystal which lasts for a duration. When the crystal's duration ends, it explodes, dealing cold damage to enemies around it."] = "创造一个冰晶，持续一段时间。冰晶持续时间结束后会爆炸，对周围敌人造成冰霜伤害。",
	["Creates a crystal which lasts for a duration. When the crystal's duration ends, it explodes, dealing heavy cold damage to enemies around it."] = "创造一个冰晶，持续一段时间。冰晶持续时间结束后会爆炸，对周围敌人造成高额冰霜伤害。",
	["Creates a giant barnacle that continually snaps at enemies, dealing off-hand area damage augmented by the defences of the shield. Increases and reductions to attack speed affect the rate at which damage occurs."] = "创造一个巨大的藤壶，持续朝敌人猛咬，造成副手范围伤害，伤害值受盾牌防御属性加成。攻击速度的增减会影响伤害的发生频率。",
	["Creates a magical brand which can attach to a nearby enemy, dealing cold damage over time and chilling them. It periodically activates while attached, gaining stages that raise the damage. When removed, a short-duration debuff dealing the same damage over time and chill is applied to each nearby enemy. The brand keeps its charges while detached."] = "创造一道魔法烙印，附着在周围一个敌人身上，造成持续冰霜伤害，并冰缓敌人。同时附着后会周期性激活，积累层数提升伤害。移除烙印时会附加一个减益效果，在短时间内造成相同的持续伤害，并对范围内的每个敌人施加冰缓。解除烙印时会保留使用次数。",
	["Creates a magical brand which can attach to a nearby enemy. It activates once, causing a fiery meteor to fall from the sky, then is destroyed."] = "创造一个可以附着于周围某个敌人的魔法烙印，它会激活一次并召唤从天而降的流星，随后便会消失。",
	["Creates a magical brand which can attach to a nearby enemy. It periodically activates while attached, adding energy to the branded enemy and causing a pulse that deals damage to the branded enemy and other nearby enemies. The pulse gains area of effect and damage for each energy on the branded enemy, up to 20. All energy is removed from the enemy when the brand is detached."] = "创造一道魔法烙印，附着在周围一个敌人身上。一旦附着就会周期性激活，给附着烙印的敌人附加能量并产生一股脉冲，对附着烙印的敌人和周围其它敌人造成伤害。附着烙印的敌人的每层能量都会提高脉冲的效果范围和伤害，最多 20 层。烙印消失时移除敌人的所有能量。",
	["Creates a magical brand which can attach to a nearby enemy. It periodically activates while attached, adding energy to the branded enemy and nearby enemies who do not have energy. When the brand is detached, all enemies with energy are dealt damage."] = "创造一道魔法烙印，附着在周围一个敌人身上。一旦附着就会周期性激活，给附着烙印的敌人和周围未具有能量的敌人附加能量。烙印消失时，对所有具有能量的敌人造成伤害。",
	["Creates a magical brand which can attach to a nearby enemy. It periodically activates while attached, adding energy to the branded enemy. When the branded enemy reaches 20 energy, a large explosion occurs and the brand is removed. All energy is removed from the enemy when the brand is detached."] = "创造一道魔法烙印，附着在周围一个敌人身上。一旦附着就会周期性激活，给附着烙印的敌人附加能量。附着烙印的敌人有 20 层能量时，产生一次大爆炸并将烙印移除。烙印消失时移除敌人的所有能量。",
	["Creates a magical brand which can attach to a nearby enemy. It periodically activates while attached, causing a fiery meteor to fall from the sky. The brand will detach if the enemy dies."] = "创造一个可以附着于周围某个敌人的魔法烙印。该烙印附着后会阶段性激活，召唤从天而降的流星。敌人被击败后烙印消失。",
	["Creates a magical brand which can attach to a nearby enemy. It periodically activates while attached, firing a beam which deals damage to the branded enemy and those around it. The brand will detach if the enemy dies."] = "创造一个可以附着于周围某个敌人的魔法烙印。该烙印附着后会阶段性激活，发射出一道光束，对具有烙印的敌人及其的敌人造成伤害。敌人被击败后烙印消失。",
	["Creates a magical brand which can attach to a nearby enemy. It periodically activates while attached, firing beams which deal damage to nearby enemies and those around them. The brand will detach if the enemy dies."] = "创造一个可以附着于周围某个敌人的魔法烙印。该烙印附着后会阶段性激活，发射光束，对周围和围绕他们的敌人造成伤害。敌人被击败后烙印消失。",
	["Creates a magical brand which can attach to a nearby enemy. It periodically activates while attached, triggering linked spells. The brand will detach if the enemy dies."] = "创造一道魔法烙印，附着在周围一个敌人身上。附着后会周期性激活，触发链接的法术。创造一个可以附着于周围某个敌人的魔法烙印。附着烙印的敌人被击败后烙印才会解除。",
	["Creates a number of markers around the targeted location, which will explode after a duration, dealing lightning damage. Cannot be supported by Spell Cascade."] = "在目标地点周围产生数个印记，它们随后爆炸，造成闪电伤害。不能被多重范围施法辅助。",
	["Creates a patch of Fungal Ground at the targeted location."] = "在目标地点创造一小片真菌地表。",
	["Creates a patch of Shocked Ground in a radius around you."] = "在你周围创造一片感电地面。",
	["Creates a portal to the current area's town."] = "开启一个连接城镇的时空之门.",
	["Creates a stationary electrical orb that strikes enemies in its area of effect with beams of lightning that can then split to hit more enemies. Modifiers to cast speed will increase how frequently it does this. Casting this skill again will replace the previous orb."] = "产生一个静止的电球，用闪电束打击它效果区域内的敌人，随后分裂的闪电束会击中更多敌人。施法速度词缀可以提高其攻击频率。重新施放该法术会取代原有的电球。",
	["Creates a storm when you Kill a Shocked Enemy"] = "你击败被感电的敌人时产生一个风暴",
	["Creates a sudden burst of cold around you, damaging enemies. This also creates a chilling area around you which expands and deals cold damage over time to surrounding enemies in addition to chilling them. Enemies that die while in the area grant Frenzy Charges, and you will passively gain Frenzy Charges while there are enemies in the area."] = "在你身边创造一股急促的寒流，并对敌人造成伤害。此攻击还会在你身边创造一片开散的冰缓地面效果，并持续对周围的敌人造成冰霜伤害。在此区域内被击败的敌人会生成狂怒球。若你在此区域内，则可以自动获得这些狂怒球。",
	["Creates a sudden burst of cold in a targeted area, damaging enemies. Also creates an expanding area which is filled with chilled ground, and deals cold damage over time to enemies. Enemies that die while in the area have a chance to grant Frenzy Charges. The cooldown can be bypassed by expending a Frenzy Charge."] = "在目标区域创造一股急促的寒流，并对敌人造成伤害，同时创造一片开散的冰缓地面效果，并持续对敌人造成冰霜伤害。在此区域内被击败的敌人有几率生成狂怒球。消耗一个狂怒球能重置其技能冷却。",
	["Creates a sudden burst of cold in a targeted area, damaging enemies. The cooldown can be bypassed by expending a Power Charge."] = "在目标区域创造一股急促的寒流，并对敌人造成伤害。消耗一个暴击球能重置其技能冷却。",
	["Creates a voidstorm that blinds enemies within it. Entering the storm will cause it to explode, dealing attack damage in an area."] = "创造一片虚空风暴，使其中的敌人致盲。进入风暴区域将引发爆炸，造成范围攻击伤害。",
	["Creates a volcanic geyser at a location, which will repeatedly unleash projectiles sequentially over the surrounding area for a duration."] = "在目标位置产生一个熔火喷泉，它将在一段时间内持续向周围放出投射物。",
	["Creates a wall of force which allies and enemies can pass through, but allied projectiles which can collide with enemies will also collide with this wall, and can chain from it to other targets. Projectiles can only collide with a single Wall of Force, and no more than once."] = "创造一道可被友方和敌人穿过的力场之墙。但能对敌人产生碰撞的友方投射物也会与此墙发生碰撞，并可从墙面连锁至其他目标。单个投射物仅可与一道力场之墙发生碰撞，且最多碰撞一次。",
	["Creates a wall of ice which holds back enemies. Targets under the wall are damaged and pushed back."] = "聚集空气中的水分, 制造一堵能阻挡敌人行动的冰墙. 在冰墙成形位置的敌人将会受到伤害并且被击退.",
	["Creates a weighted search to find the highest Stat Value items for this slot.\nNote that even if you are authenticated, you can click this button again to show the search link.\nIf you have additional requirements that the trade tool doesn't cover (e.g. Adorned Magic jewels),\nyou can add them, copy the link here, and press \"Price Item\" to evaluate the items."] = "创建加权搜索，查找此装备栏位中属性评分最高的物品。\n即使已经授权，也可再次点击此按钮显示搜索链接。\n若有交易工具尚未涵盖的额外条件（例如使用浮华珠宝的魔法珠宝），\n可自行添加条件，将链接复制到此处，再点击“物品估价”评估搜索结果。",
	["Creates already-caught projectiles without firing them first, both immediately and over a secondary duration. Caught projectiles spiral outwards when you use Whirling Blades and do not return. Requires a Dagger or Claw."] = "创造已经抓回的投射物，但先不把它们发射出去，并且都有即时和附加的持续时间。当你使用回旋之刃时，抓回的投射物向外盘旋飞出，并不再返回。限定爪类和匕首。",
	["Creates an area of Consecrated Ground, providing life regeneration and reducing the effect of curses for you and allies who stand in it."] = "产生一片奉献地面，为你和友军提供生命再生，并降低你们身上的诅咒效果。",
	["Creates an electrical orb that will strike enemies in its area of effect with beams of lightning when placed, as well as when you use a lightning skill while within its area. These beams of lightning can then split to hit more enemies. When striking enemies, this orb will teleport to a random enemy struck. Casting this skill again will replace the previous orb."] = "产生一个的电球，放置时、以及你在其范围内释放闪电技能时，它会以闪电光束攻击范围内的敌人。这些闪电光束可分裂，以击中更多敌人。击中敌人时，电球会传送至被击中的随机一个敌人处。再次施放该技能会替换原有的电球。",
	["Creates an independently-moving vortex of ethereal blades which lasts for a duration. The vortex moves toward nearby enemies, repeatedly damaging enemies that it passes through."] = "创造独立飞行的飞刃或虚空的武器，并持续一段时间。飞刃以你为中心不断飞舞旋转, 将周围的敌人削成肉泥.",
	["Creates an orb which moves towards nearby enemies, exploding after a duration or when it gets close enough. The explosion deals cold spell damage in an area, and leaves behind a Vortex on the ground for a secondary duration which continues to deal cold damage over time and chill enemies caught in it."] = "制造一个向附近敌人移动的法球，在一段时间后或足够接近敌人时爆炸。爆炸造成范围冰霜法术伤害，并在地面留下一个持续额外时间的漩涡，对其中的敌人持续造成冰霜伤害并使其冰缓。",
	["Creates markers at your location and a targeted location, which grow over time based on cast speed, then explode, dealing fire damage. Cannot be supported by Spell Cascade."] = "同时在你所在位置和目标地点产生印记，它们根据施法速度生长，随后爆炸，造成火焰伤害，不能被多重范围施法辅助。",
	["Creates multiple fissures that deal area damage while travelling outwards. Requires an Axe, Mace, Sceptre, Staff or Unarmed."] = "创造出多条向外行进的裂缝，行进过程中造成范围伤害。需要装备斧、锤、短杖、长杖或徒手状态。",
	["Creating link..."] = "正在创建链接……",
