	["Curse Skills have 100% increased Skill Effect Duration"] = "诅咒技能的技能效果持续时间延长 100%",
	["Curse Skills have 15% increased Cast Speed"] = "诅咒技能的施法速度加快 15%",
	["Curse Skills have 25% increased Skill Effect Duration"] = "诅咒技能的技能效果持续时间延长 25%",
	["Curse Skills have 8% increased Cast Speed"] = "诅咒技能的施法速度加快 8%",
	["Curse all targets in an area, causing them to take increased physical damage. Attacks against the cursed enemies have a chance to inflict bleeding."] = "诅咒一片区域的所有目标，提高它们受到的物理伤害。攻击它们有几率施加流血。",
	["Curse and Chaos Resistance"] = "诅咒和混沌抗性",
	["Curse expiry rate cannot be modified"] = "诅咒消解速度无法被修改",
	["Curse overlaps"] = "诅咒重叠次数",
	["Cursed Enemies become Pacified once 60% of Curse Duration has Expired, preventing them from dealing Damage"] = "被诅咒的敌人在诅咒持续时间消减 60% 后受到止心，使其无法造成伤害",
	["Cursed Enemies cannot inflict Elemental Ailments on You"] = "被诅咒的敌人无法对你施加元素异常状态",
	["Cursed Enemies you Kill are destroyed"] = "你击败的被诅咒的敌人会被毁灭",
	["Cursed Enemies you or your Minions Kill have a (10-15)% chance to Explode, dealing a quarter of their maximum Life as Chaos Damage"] = "你或你的召唤生物击败的受诅咒敌人有 (10-15)% 的几率爆炸，造成等同该敌人最大生命四分之一的混沌伤害",
	["Cursed Enemies you or your Minions Kill have a (11-15)% chance to Explode, dealing a quarter of their maximum Life as Chaos Damage"] = "你或你的召唤生物击败的受诅咒敌人有 (11-15)% 的几率爆炸，造成等同该敌人最大生命四分之一的混沌伤害",
	["Cursed Enemies you or your Minions Kill have a (6-10)% chance to Explode, dealing a quarter of their maximum Life as Chaos Damage"] = "你或你的召唤生物击败的受诅咒敌人有 (6-10)% 的几率爆炸，造成等同该敌人最大生命四分之一的混沌伤害",
	["Cursed Enemies you or your Minions Kill have a 50% chance to Explode, dealing a quarter of their maximum Life as Chaos Damage"] = "你或你的召唤生物击败的受诅咒敌人有 50% 的几率爆炸，造成等同该敌人最大生命四分之一的混沌伤害",
	["Cursed Flesh"] = "诅咒肉身",
	["Cursed Ground"] = "诅咒之地辅助",
	["Cursed Ground Support"] = "诅咒之地辅助",
	["Cursed Mariner"] = "水手咒灵",
	["Curses"] = "诅咒",
	["Curses a single enemy, causing them to spawn multiple phantasms when hit. The phantasms will be allies of the marked enemy with the same monster level. They cast a projectile spell which deals physical damage, and are immune to curses and knockback. You can only have one Mark at a time."] = "诅咒一名敌人，使其在被击中时产生多个幻灵。幻灵被视作被标记的敌人的盟友，拥有相同的怪物等级，会施放造成物理伤害的投射物法术，并且免疫诅咒和击退。你同时只能施加一个印记。",
	["Curses a single enemy, giving a chance to double the duration of stuns on them. Attacking the cursed enemy will leech life and mana, stunning them will grant rage, and killing it will grant an endurance charge. You can only have one Mark at a time."] = "诅咒单个敌人，使它身上的眩晕持续时间有几率翻倍。攻击该敌人会获得生命和魔力偷取，使它眩晕可以获得怒火，击败它可以获得一个耐力球。你每次只能添加一种印记。",
	["Curses a single enemy, granting flask charges when you hit them and creating Burning Ground under them if your hit Ignites them, and Caustic Ground if it Poisons them. Damage modifiers do not apply to these ground effects. You can only have one Mark at a time."] = "诅咒单个敌人，击中敌人时产生药剂充能效果，如果击中并点燃敌人，则在其下方产生燃烧地面，如果使敌人中毒，则在其下方产生腐蚀地面。伤害词缀对这些地面效果无效。一次只能有一个“印记”。",
	["Curses a single enemy, increasing the damage they take from projectiles, and making projectiles split when hitting them, to hit other targets around them. You can only have one Mark at a time."] = "诅咒单个敌人，增加其被投射物击中后的伤害，并使投射物在击中敌人时裂化，击中周围的其他目标。一次只能有一个“印记”。",
	["Curses a single enemy, lowering their physical damage reduction, and adding physical damage to all hits against them. Attacking the cursed enemy will grant life and mana, and killing them will grant a frenzy charge. You can only have one Mark at a time."] = "诅咒单个敌人，降低它的物理伤害减免，并使它受到的任何击中都附加物理伤害。攻击它会获得生命和魔力，击败它会获得一个狂怒球。你每次只能添加一种印记。",
	["Curses a single enemy, making them more vulnerable to Critical Strikes. Killing the cursed enemy will grant life and mana, and a power charge. You can only have one Mark at a time."] = "诅咒单个敌人，使它更弱暴击。击败它可以获得生命和魔力，以及一个暴击球。你每次只能添加一种印记。",
	["Curses all enemies in an area, lowering their action speed and making other effects on them expire more slowly."] = "诅咒一片区域的所有敌人，降低它们的行动速度，并使它们身上的效果消减得更慢。",
	["Curses all targets in an area, causing them to be debilitated when they hit enemies and increasing damage they take while on low life."] = "诅咒一片区域的所有目标，使它们击中敌人会获得疲惫状态，并使它们在濒血时受到更多伤害。",
	["Curses all targets in an area, having no effect at first, but causing them to deal no damage once 60% of the curse's duration has expired."] = "诅咒区域中的所有目标，最初没有效果，但在诅咒的持续时间消减 60% 后使其无法造成伤害。",
	["Curses all targets in an area, lowering their chaos resistance."] = "诅咒一片区域的所有目标，降低它们的混沌抗性。",
	["Curses all targets in an area, lowering their cold resistance and giving them a chance to be frozen when hit."] = "诅咒一片区域的所有目标，降低它们的冰霜抗性，并使它们被击中时有几率被冻结。",
	["Curses all targets in an area, lowering their elemental resistances."] = "诅咒一片区域的所有目标，降低它们的元素抗性。",
	["Curses all targets in an area, lowering their fire resistance and giving them a chance to be ignited when hit."] = "诅咒一片区域的所有目标，降低它们的火焰抗性，并使它们被击中时有几率被点燃。",
	["Curses all targets in an area, lowering their lightning resistance and giving them a chance to be shocked when hit."] = "诅咒一片区域的所有目标，降低它们的闪电抗性，并使它们被击中时有几率获得感电效果。",
	["Curses all targets in an area, reducing their accuracy and making them deal less damage."] = "诅咒一片区域的所有目标，降低它们的命中值，使它们造成的伤害更低。",
