	["Deal (12-15)% of your maximum Life as Fire Damage to nearby Enemies when Hit"] = "被击中时对周围敌人造成等同你 (12-15)% 最大生命的火焰伤害",
	["Deal (16-19)% of your maximum Life as Fire Damage to nearby Enemies when Hit"] = "被击中时对周围敌人造成等同你 (16-19)% 最大生命的火焰伤害",
	["Deal (8-11)% of your maximum Life as Fire Damage to nearby Enemies when Hit"] = "被击中时对周围敌人造成等同你 (8-11)% 最大生命的火焰伤害",
	["Deal 1% more Damage with Hits and Ailments to Rare and Unique Enemies for each second they've ever been in your Presence, up to a maximum of 100%"] = "稀有和传奇怪物每在场一秒，对其造成的击中和异常状态伤害总增 1%，最多 100%",
	["Deal 1% more Damage with Hits and Ailments to Rare and Unique Enemies for every 2 seconds they've ever been in your Presence, up to a maximum of 50%"] = "稀有和传奇怪物每在场 2 秒，对其造成的击中和异常状态伤害总增 1%%，最多 50%",
	["Deal 10% less Damage"] = "造成的伤害总降 10%",
