	["Deals 100% less Damage of each unchosen Damage Type"] = "每个未选择的伤害类型造成的伤害总降 100%",
	["Deals 450 Chaos Damage per second to nearby Enemies"] = "每秒对周围敌人造成 450 混沌伤害",
	["Deals 50 Chaos Damage per second to nearby Enemies"] = "每秒对周围敌人造成 50 混沌伤害",
	["Deals a portion of your main hand damage in an area around you and creates Consecrated Ground, causing you and your allies to regenerate life."] = "在你的四周制造奉献地面，并造成一定比例的主手武器伤害，奉献地面为你和友军提供生命再生。",
	["Deals attack damage in an area."] = "对一片区域造成攻击伤害。",
	["Deals attack damage in an area. A number of enemies hit by the wave will release an additional wave."] = "在一定范围内造成攻击伤害。被该波击中的数个敌人将会释放一道额外的波。",
	["Deals chaos damage in an area."] = "对一片区域造成混沌伤害。",
	["Deals chaos damage to a single enemy, dealing more damage if they are Hexed, then removing the Hex. If the enemy was Hexed, also deals area damage to other enemies around the target, boosting damage and removing Hexes from those enemies in the same way."] = "对单独目标造成混沌伤害，如果它有魔蛊效果则造成更高伤害，然后移除魔蛊。目标具有魔蛊效果时还会对目标周围其它敌人造成范围伤害，并且如果这些目标身上也有魔蛊，则同样造成更高伤害并移除魔蛊。",
	["Deals chaos damage to a single enemy. If the enemy was Hexed, also deals area damage to other enemies around the target."] = "对单个敌人造成混沌伤害。如果该敌人有魔蛊效果，还会对目标周围的其他敌人造成范围伤害。",
	["Deals lightning damage based upon your missing mana in a circular area around the targeted location, as well as in four rectangular extensions whose lengths depend upon your remaining mana."] = "对目标地点的环形区域造成闪电伤害，并以矩形朝四角的方向延伸，其长度由你剩余的魔力决定。造成的额外闪电伤害则由你失去的魔力决定。",
	["Deals no Damage of other Damage Types"] = "无法造成其他元素类型的伤害",
	["Deals no Non-Elemental Damage"] = "不造成非元素伤害",
	["Deals spell damage in a targeted area. Each time this spell deals damage,  it will detonate any of your Lingering Blades it touches, dealing damage again in an area around them. Up to 50 Blades can be detonated this way."] = "在指定区域造成法术伤害，每次造成伤害时引爆触及的徘徊之刃，再次对它们周围区域造成伤害。这种方式最多引爆 50 枚剑刃。",
	["Deals spell damage in an area around you. If you have Blade Vortex blades orbiting you, it will detonate each of them in turn, dealing damage again in an area around you for each one."] = "在周围区域造成法术伤害。若你被飞刃风暴的剑刃环绕，则会依次将其引爆，每次引爆再次对你周围的区域造成伤害。",
	["Deals spell damage in an area around you. Your equipped daggers add to this damage."] = "在周围区域造成法术伤害。你装备的匕首会计入此伤害。",
