	["Each Arrow leaves 1 Spore Pod"] = "每支箭矢投放 1 个孢囊",
	["Each Attack is sacrificing a damage minion to grant you extra projectiles."] = "每次攻击都献祭一个造成伤害的召唤生物，为你提供额外投射物。",
	["Each Magic enemy grants 2 Power"] = "每个魔法敌人提供 2 点威力",
	["Each Mine applies 2% increased Damage taken to Enemies near it, up to 10%"] = "每个地雷使它附近敌人受到的伤害提高 2%，最高 10%",
	["Each Mine applies 2% reduced Damage dealt to Enemies near it, up to 10%"] = "每个地雷对它附近敌人造成的伤害降低 2%，最低 10%",
	["Each Normal enemy grants 1 Power"] = "每个普通敌人提供 1 点威力",
	["Each Projectile fired remains in the ground as a Lingering Blade"] = "每个发射的投射物都会在地面留下一把徘徊之刃",
	["Each Rage also grants +1% to Damage over Time Multiplier for Bleeding while wielding an Axe"] = "装备斧类武器时，每一点怒火还会使流血的持续伤害加成 +1%",
	["Each Rage also grants +2% to Damage over Time Multiplier for Bleeding while wielding an Axe"] = "装备斧类武器时，每一点怒火还会使流血的持续伤害加成 +2%",
	["Each Rage also grants +2% to Fire Damage Over Time Multiplier"] = "每点怒火也使持续火焰伤害加成 +2%",
	["Each Rare enemy grants 10 Power"] = "每个稀有敌人提供 10 点威力",
	["Each Spore Pod inflicts 1 Withered Debuff on nearby Enemies"] = "每个孢囊对周围敌人施加 1 层死亡凋零减益",
	["Each Summoned Phantasm grants you Phantasmal Might"] = "每个召唤的幻灵都给你幽影之力",
	["Each Supported Spell will Trigger when its Cooldown is over"] = "每个被辅助法术的冷却时间结束时触发",
	["Each Totem applies 1% increased Damage taken to Enemies near it"] = "每个图腾都使其周围敌人受到的伤害提高 1%",
	["Each Unique enemy grants 20 Power"] = "每个传奇敌人提供 20 点威力",
	["Each attack with a melee weapon will choose an element at random, and will only be able to deal damage of that element. If the attack hits an enemy, it will deal damage in an area around them, with the radius being larger if that enemy is suffering from an ailment of the chosen element. It will avoid choosing the same element twice in a row."] = "使用近战武器的每次攻击都会随机选择一种元素，并只能造成该元素的伤害。若击中敌人，还会在其周围造成伤害，若该敌人正承受所选元素的异常状态，则伤害范围扩大。不能连续选择同一种元素。",
	["Each cast of this spell waits for a short duration, releasing a burst of lightning and chaos spell damage in an area around you when that duration ends. Enemies killed by this damage, or shortly after, will explode. The explosions of the corpses are not affected by modifiers to spell damage, and cannot be reflected."] = "每次施放该法术都会在等待一小段时间后对一片区域释放闪电和混沌法术伤害的爆炸。被这种方式消灭的敌人也会爆炸，但它们的灵盒产生的爆炸不受法术伤害类词缀影响，也不能被反射。",
	["Each instance of Barnacles lasts 30 seconds and can be inflicted up to 10 times)"] = "每层藤壶持续 30 秒，最多可施加 10 层）",
	["Each page fetches up to 10 items."] = "每页最多获取 10 件物品。",
	["Each stack of Corrosion applies -5000 to total Armour and -1000 to total Evasion Rating to the enemy."] = "每层腐蚀使敌人的总护甲 -5000、总闪避值 -1000。",
	["Each stack of Corrosion applies -5000 to total Armour and -1000 to total Evasion Rating to the enemy.\nCorrosion lasts 4 seconds and refreshes the duration of existing Corrosion stacks\nCorrosion has no stack limit"] = "每层腐蚀使敌人的总护甲 -5000、总闪避值 -1000。\n腐蚀持续 4 秒，并刷新已有腐蚀层数的持续时间\n腐蚀没有层数上限",
	["Each stack of Spirit Infusion grants:"] = "每层精魂灌注提供：",
	["Each stack of Spirit Infusion grants:\n15% faster start of Energy Shield Recharge, \nChannelling Spells deal 5% more Damage and \nChannelling Spells have 10% more Cost\nMaximum 10 stacks"] = "每层精魂灌注提供：\n能量护盾充能提前 15% 开始，\n引导法术的伤害总增 5%，且\n引导法术的消耗总增 10%\n最多 10 层",
	["Each supported spell skill will be triggered when you die. Cannot support skills used by totems, traps, or mines. Vaal skills, channelling skills, and skills with a reservation cannot be triggered."] = "你被击败时触发所有被辅助的法术。无法辅助图腾、陷阱或地雷施放的技能。瓦尔技能、持续吟唱类技能或有保留效果的技能无法被触发。",
	["Each supported spell skill will be triggered when your Ward breaks. Cannot support skills used by totems, traps, or mines. Vaal skills, channelling skills, and skills with a reservation cannot be triggered."] = "每个被辅助的法术技能将在你的结界破裂时触发。无法辅助由图腾、陷阱或地雷使用的技能。瓦尔技能、持续吟唱技能以及带有保留效果的技能无法被触发。",
	["Each supported spell skill will have a chance to be triggered when you are stunned. Cannot support skills used by totems, traps, or mines. Vaal skills, channelling skills, and skills with a reservation cannot be triggered."] = "你被晕眩时有几率触发所有被辅助的法术技能。无法辅助图腾、陷阱或地雷施放的技能。瓦尔技能、持续吟唱技能或有保留效果的技能无法被触发。",
	["Each supported spell skill will track damage you take, and be triggered when the total damage taken reaches a threshold. Cannot support skills used by totems, traps, or mines. Vaal skills, channelling skills, and skills with a reservation cannot be triggered."] = "所有被辅助的法术技能会记录你受到的伤害，当受到的总伤害达到阈值时触发。无法辅助图腾、陷阱或地雷施放的技能。瓦尔技能、持续吟唱技能或有保留效果的技能无法被触发。",
	["Each supported spell will track how much mana you spend on it, granting a buff when the total mana spent reaches a threshold. Cannot support skills used by totems, traps, mines or skills with a reservation."] = "所有被辅助的法术技能会记录你消耗的魔力，当消耗的总魔力达到阈值时提供一个增益效果。不能辅助图腾、陷阱、地雷施放的技能，不能辅助有保留效果的技能。",
