	["Fire Walker"] = "火灵之道",
	["Fire Weapon"] = "烈焰武器",
	["Fire a damaging projectile from your wand which aims itself towards an enemy and applies a shell to the first enemy struck. Damage from hits against that target is taken from the shell first. If fully depleted, the shell will explode, dealing area damage and firing a projectile at another target to apply a new shell to it. If multiple projectiles are fired by an exploding shell, only the first one to hit a target can apply a shell."] = "从法杖射出一枚自动索敌的伤害性投射物，对首个击中的敌人施加一个护盾。对该目标的击中伤害将优先由护盾承受。若护盾被完全击破，将发生爆炸造成范围伤害，并向另一个目标发射一枚新的投射物，为其施加新的护盾。若多个投射物因护盾爆炸同时射出，仅首个命中目标的投射物能成功施加护盾。",
	["Fire a projectile from your wand that changes direction in a zig-zag pattern at regular intervals or when hitting enemies. Each time it changes direction, a secondary projectile breaks off, flying in the direction it changed away from."] = "用法杖发射一枚投射物，会定期或击中敌人时改变飞行方向。每次改变方向都会产生一枚次要投射物，朝原本的方向飞行。",
	["Fire a projectile from your wand that changes direction in a zig-zag pattern at regular intervals or when hitting enemies. Each time it changes direction, a secondary projectile breaks off, flying in the direction it changed away from. Multiple of these projectiles can hit the same target."] = "用法杖发射一枚投射物，会定期或击中敌人时改变飞行方向。每次改变方向都会产生一枚次要投射物，朝原本的方向飞行。多个投射物可以击中同一个目标。",
	["Fire a single icy projectile that bursts on impact or when reaching the targeted area, dealing area damage and creating a chilling area that deals cold damage over time. This area will creep rapidly across the ground towards nearby enemies until its duration expires."] = "射出一个寒冰投射物，在命中目标或抵达目标区域时爆炸，造成范围伤害并生成一片冰缓区域，该区域会持续造成冰霜伤害。该区域会快速向附近的敌人蔓延，直到持续时间结束。",
	["Fire a single projectile that splits on impact or at the targeted location, dealing area damage when it splits and again when the split projectiles explode at the end of their flight. Projectiles from this skill cannot return. Requires a Sword or Axe."] = "发射一枚投射物，在撞击或抵达目标地点时分裂，造成范围伤害。分裂的投射物继续飞行，在结束时再次造成范围伤害。此技能的投射物无法归返。需要剑类或斧类发动。",
	["Fire a trio of electrical arrows that quickly dissipate, vanishing shortly after being loosed. If the arrows' flight is stopped by colliding with a target, they create a burst of lightning, damaging enemies in a cone behind the target"] = "射出三支转瞬即逝的电光箭矢，在离弦不久后消失。箭矢如果击中目标而停止飞行，则会爆发出闪电，对目标身后锥形区域内的敌人造成伤害",
	["Fire a trio of electrical arrows that quickly dissipate, vanishing shortly after being loosed. The arrows are fired with such force that they create a burst of lightning, damaging enemies in a cone in front of you."] = "射出三支转瞬即逝的电光箭矢，在离弦不久后消失。强劲的力量使箭矢爆发出闪电，对前方锥形区域内的敌人造成伤害。",
	["Fire an arrow that leaves a spore pod in its wake. The spore pod blooms, firing thorn arrows, which travel for a short time before dissipating. Modifiers that cause additional projectiles to be fired will only apply to the initial arrows, each of which leaves its own spore pod."] = "射出一支箭矢，在飞行轨迹上投下一个孢囊。孢囊会绽放并喷射荆棘之箭，飞行一小段时间后消失。产生额外投射物的词缀只可以影响最初的箭矢数量，每支箭矢都会投下一个孢囊。",
	["Fire an icy projectile that bursts on impact or when reaching the targeted area, dealing area damage and creating a chilling area that deals cold damage over time. This area will creep across the ground towards nearby enemies until its duration expires."] = "射出一个寒冰投射物, 在接触到敌人时会爆炸, 对该范围敌人造成伤害，使附近地面结冰并持续造成伤害.该区域会向周围的敌人蔓延，直到持续时间结束。",
	["Fire and Cold Damage"] = "火焰和冰霜伤害",
	["Fire arrows into the air that rain down around the targeted area, dealing area damage on impact and leaving the arrows stuck in the ground for a duration. If you move close to a stuck arrow, it will explode, dealing area damage and applying a fire damage over time debuff, as well as causing other stuck arrows in range to also explode."] = "向空中射出火焰箭矢，在目标区域降下箭雨，撞击时造成范围伤害，并且箭矢会残留在地面一段时间。若你靠近残留的箭矢，它将爆炸造成范围伤害，施加持续火焰伤害效果，并连锁引爆范围内其他残留的箭矢。",
	["Fire arrows into the air that rain down around the targeted area, dealing damage to enemies they hit and creating spore pods where they land. Each spore pod deals chaos damage over time to nearby enemies and slows their movement speed. The pods last for a duration before bursting, dealing area damage."] = "向天空射出一串箭矢，并洒向目标区域，对击中的敌人造成伤害，并在落地后创造孢囊。每个孢囊会对周围的敌人持续造成混沌伤害，并减低他们的移动速度。短时间后，孢囊会爆炸，造成范围伤害。",
	["Fire arrows into the air that rain down around the targeted area, dealing damage to enemies they hit and creating spore pods where they land. Each spore pod deals chaos damage over time to nearby enemies and withers them, causing them to take increased chaos damage. The pods last for a duration before bursting, dealing area damage."] = "向天空射出一串箭矢，并洒向目标区域，对击中的敌人造成伤害，并在落地后创造孢囊。每个孢囊会对周围的敌人持续造成混沌伤害并施加死亡凋零，使其受到的混沌伤害提高。短时间后，孢囊会爆炸，造成范围伤害。",
	["Fire arrows into the air that rain down around the targeted area, dealing damage to enemies they hit and creating spore pods where they land. Each spore pod slows the movement speed of nearby enemies. The pods last for a duration before bursting, dealing area damage."] = "向天空射出一串箭矢，并洒向目标区域，对击中的敌人造成伤害，并在落地后创造孢囊。每个孢囊都会减低周围敌人的移动速度。短时间后，孢囊会爆炸，造成范围伤害。",
	["Fire at most 1 Projectile"] = "最多发射 1 个投射物",
	["Fire icy projectiles around you in all directions."] = "向你周围所有方向发射寒冰投射物。",
	["Fire, AoE, Attack, Melee, Bow"] = "火焰, 效果区域, 攻击, 近战, 弓箭",
	["Fire, AoE, Support, Minion"] = "火焰, 效果区域, 辅助, 召唤生物",
	["Fire, Attack, AoE, Melee, Slam"] = "火焰, 攻击, 效果区域, 近战, 猛击",
	["Fire, Attack, AoE, Projectile, Bow"] = "火焰, 攻击, 效果区域, 投射物, 弓箭",
	["Fire, Attack, AoE, Projectile, Duration, Bow"] = "火焰, 攻击, 效果区域, 投射物, 持续时间, 弓箭",
	["Fire, Cold, or Lightning Resistance, up to a maximum of 450%"] = "上限为 450%",
	["Fire, Melee, Attack, AoE, Movement, Duration, Slam"] = "火焰, 近战, 攻击, 效果区域, 位移, 持续时间, 猛击",
	["Fire, Minion, Spell, Golem"] = "火焰, 召唤生物, 法术, 魔像",
	["Fire, Physical, Support"] = "火焰, 物理, 辅助",
	["Fire, Spell, AoE, Duration, Physical"] = "火焰, 法术, 效果区域, 持续时间, 物理",
	["Fire, Support"] = "火焰, 辅助",
	["Fire, Support, AoE"] = "火焰, 辅助, 效果区域",
	["Fire, Support, Melee, Attack"] = "火焰, 辅助, 近战, 攻击",
	["Fireball"] = "火球",
	["Fireball has +20% chance to Ignite"] = "火球造成点燃状态的几率 +20%",
	["Fireball has +30% chance to Ignite"] = "火球造成点燃状态的几率 +30%",
	["Fireborn"] = "炎域",
	["Firebreather Mead"] = "喷火者蜜酒",
	["Fires 1 Projectile"] = "发射 1 个投射物",
	["Fires Projectiles at each nearby Enemy"] = "朝周围每个敌人发射投射物",
	["Fires Projectiles every second"] = "每秒发射投射物",
	["Fires Projectiles in a circle"] = "环状发射投射物",
	["Fires Projectiles in random directions"] = "朝随机方向发射投射物",
	["Fires Projectiles sequentially"] = "连续发射投射物",
	["Fires a Payload Arrow into the air"] = "向空中发射一支负载箭矢",
	["Fires a Payload Arrow into the air\nProjectiles Fire from where the Payload Arrow lands"] = "向空中发射一支负载箭矢\n投射物在负载箭矢落地时发射",
	["Fires a burning arrow that deals fire damage and has a chance to ignite."] = "发射一枚燃烧箭矢造成火焰伤害，并有几率点燃敌人。",
	["Fires a chaining burst of ethereal blades."] = "发射一连串的虚空飞刀。此技能有短暂冷却时间。",
	["Fires a charged arrow which damages enemies by causing them to be struck by a bolt of lightning, which also damages a number of surrounding enemies."] = "射出一发充满闪电能量的箭矢，以闪电霹雳对敌人造成伤害，同时也对周围多个敌人造成伤害。",
	["Fires a charged arrow which damages enemies by causing them to be struck by a bolt of lightning. It sticks into the final target, causing them to be struck and damaged multiple times."] = "射出一发充满闪电能量的箭矢，以闪电霹雳对敌人造成伤害，并附着在最终目标处，使其遭受多次伤害。",
	["Fires a circle of knives outwards around the caster which deal physical damage."] = "向周围射出一圈匕首，对敌人造成物理伤害。",
	["Fires a piercing arrow that converts some physical damage to cold on its target and converts all physical damage to cold in two cones perpendicular to the target."] = "射出一支穿透箭矢，在击中目标时将部分物理伤害转化为冰霜伤害，并在目标背后形成两个垂直的锥形范围攻击其它敌人，此时所有物理伤害转化为冰霜伤害。",
	["Fires a piercing projectile that applies a damage over time debuff when it hits. You are healed for a portion of the debuff damage."] = "射出一个穿透投射物，击中后产生一个减益效果，造成持续伤害。其中一部分伤害会治疗你。",
	["Fires a piercing shot that travels until it reaches the targeted location. It will then fire projectiles out in all directions from that point, which will travel for a short time before disappearing."] = "射出一支箭矢，在抵达目标地点前一直穿透敌人。然后从抵达地点向所有方向发射投射物，飞行很短时间后消失。",
	["Fires a poisonous arrow which deals chaos damage in an area on impact."] = "射出一发剧毒箭矢，击中时对一片区域造成混沌伤害。",
	["Fires a poisonous projectile based on your weapon that will chain between enemies. Requires a Dagger or Claw."] = "基于你的武器，投出剧毒的投射物，连锁打击敌人。需要匕首或爪类发动。",
	["Fires a projectile from a Wand that causes a series of area explosions in a secondary radius around its point of impact, each damaging enemies."] = "从法杖中射出一个投射物，接触到物体或敌人时在周围一定范围内产生一系列爆破，每次爆破都会对敌人造成伤害。",
	["Fires a projectile that applies a damage over time debuff when it hits. You are healed for a portion of the debuff damage. The debuff is spread by Contagion."] = "射出一个投射物，击中后产生一个减益效果，造成持续伤害。其中一部分伤害会治疗你。该减益效果可由【瘟疫】传染。",
	["Fires a projectile that applies a damage over time debuff when it hits. You lose Life and Energy Shield equal to a portion of the debuff damage. The debuff is spread by Contagion."] = "射出一个投射物，击中后产生一个减益效果，造成持续伤害。你会失去相当于减益伤害一定比例的生命和能量护盾。该减益效果可由【瘟疫】传染。",
	["Fires a projectile that deals chaos damage to enemies it hits and leeches some of that damage as energy shield."] = "发射一个投射物，对击中的敌人造成混沌伤害，所造成的伤害会有一部分转化为能量护盾偷取。",
	["Fires a projectile that turns towards enemies in front of it, damaging and piercing through those it hits, and leeching some of that damage as energy shield. As the projectile travels, it repeatedly applies a short but powerful chaos damage over time debuff to each enemy in an area around it."] = "发射会在敌人面前转向他们的投射物，击中时造成伤害并穿透敌人，所造成的伤害会有一部分转化为能量护盾偷取。在飞行过程中，投射物会持续对周围一定范围内的敌人施加负面效果，造成短暂但强大的持续混沌伤害。",
	["Fires a projectile that turns towards enemies in front of it. The projectile does not hit enemies, but as it travels it applies a short physical damage over time debuff to each enemy in an area around it, stacking up to 3 times. The debuff also increases the damage over time they take from all sources."] = "发射一枚会转向前方敌人的投射物。该投射物不直接击中敌人，但在其飞行过程中，会对其周围范围内的每个敌人施加一个短时物理持续伤害减益，可叠加 3 层。该减益还会提高他们受到的所有来源的持续伤害。",
	["Fires a projectile that will pierce through enemies to impact the ground at the targeted location, creating a Bone Archer corpse where it lands."] = "发射一个能够穿透敌人的投射物，在目标地点着地后会创造一个骨弓手灵柩。",
	["Fires a projectile with a wand or bow that deals fire, cold and lightning damage. If the projectile hits an enemy, it will deal damage in an area around them."] = "使用法杖或弓发射一个投射物，造成火焰、冰霜和闪电伤害。若投射物击中敌人，则会在其周围造成伤害。",
	["Fires a returning projectile that can be caught. Caught projectiles spiral outwards when you use Whirling Blades and do not return. Requires a Dagger or Claw."] = "发射一个可以抓回的投射物。当你使用回旋之刃时，抓回的投射物向外盘旋飞出，并不再返回。限定爪类和匕首。",
	["Fires a series of projectiles in a spiral that turn towards enemies in front of them, damaging and piercing through those they hit, and leeching some of that damage as energy shield. As the projectiles travel, they repeatedly apply a short but powerful chaos damage over time debuff to each enemy in an area around them."] = "螺旋发射一串会在敌人面前转向他们的投射物，击中时造成伤害并穿透敌人，所造成的伤害会有一部分转化为能量护盾偷取。在飞行过程中，投射物会持续对周围一定范围内的敌人施加负面效果，造成短暂但强大的持续混沌伤害。",
	["Fires a single arrow up in the air, to rain down at a targeted location. The arrow deals area damage around where it lands, as well as releasing a wave of fire which will apply a burning debuff to enemies. The impact of the arrow will also inflict this debuff."] = "向空中射出单发箭矢，并在目标地点落下。箭矢在落下的位置造成范围伤害，同时释放火焰波浪，对敌人施加燃烧减益效果。箭矢落点范围也会施加减益效果。",
	["Fires a single eye projectile which cannot damage enemies. When the eye dissipates or collides with terrain, it releases a fast spiral of shards. The shards will deal cold damage to enemies they impact."] = "发射一枚无法造成伤害的眼球形投射物。眼球撞击地面或自然消散时，发射一圈快速的霰弹，霰弹对击中的敌人造成冰霜伤害。",
	["Fires a single eye projectile which constantly releases shard projectiles in a spiral. The shards will damage enemies they impact, dealing cold damage. The eye cannot damage enemies. When the eye dissipates or collides with terrain, it releases a faster spiral of extra shards."] = "发射一枚眼球形投射物，不断螺旋发射霰弹投射物。霰弹撞击敌人会造成冰霜伤害。眼球本身并不能伤害敌人。眼球撞击地面或自然消散时，会额外发射一圈更快速的霰弹。",
	["Fires a single eye projectile which releases a number shard projectiles in a spiral before dissipating. The shards will damage enemies they impact, dealing cold damage. The eye cannot damage enemies."] = "发射一枚眼球形投射物，螺旋发射出霰弹投射物并逐渐消散。霰弹对击中的敌人造成冰霜伤害。眼球无法对敌人造成伤害。",
	["Fires a single payload arrow into the air to land at a targeted location. It will then fire arrows out in all directions from that point."] = "向空中射出单发母箭，抵达目标地点后向所有方向发射箭矢。",
	["Fires a single projectile which moves in a spiral while damaging each enemy in an area around it repeatedly with bolts of lightning."] = "射出一个螺旋移动的天雷之珠，对周围的每个敌人反复施放闪电并造成伤害。",
	["Fires a slow-moving projectile that damages each enemy in an area around it repeatedly with bolts of lightning."] = "射出一个移动缓慢的天雷之珠，对周围的每个敌人反复施放闪电并造成伤害。",
	["Fires a slow-moving projectile that pierces through enemies, dealing cold damage."] = "发射出一个缓慢移动并可以穿透敌人的投射物, 造成冰霜伤害.",
	["Fires a slow-moving serpentine arrow which deals chaos damage while piercing enemies, and leaves a trail of caustic ground. Enemies standing on the caustic ground take chaos damage over time."] = "发射一支缓慢移动的蛇形箭，在刺穿敌人的同时造成混沌伤害，并在地面留下一道腐蚀之痕。站在腐蚀地面上的敌人会持续受到混沌伤害。",
	["Fires an additional Projectile for every 2 prior Mines in Detonation Sequence"] = "传爆序列中之前每 2 个地雷发射一个额外投射物",
	["Fires an additional Projectile for every 3 prior Mines in Detonation Sequence"] = "每 3 个按传爆序列引爆的地雷就发射一枚额外投射物",
	["Fires an arc of knives down into the ground in front of the caster which deal physical damage."] = "在前方依弧形掷下数支匕首，对敌人造成物理伤害。",
	["Fires an arc of knives outwards in front of the caster which deal physical damage."] = "向前方依弧形射出数支匕首，对敌人造成物理伤害。",
	["Fires an arrow at the target destination. When the arrow lands, a clone is summoned. The clone is a minion that uses your bow and quiver to fire arrows into the air to land around a target."] = "对目标地点射出一支箭，当箭到达时在目标地创造一个你的复制体。这个复制体使用跟你一样的弓与箭袋，会向空中射击并在一个目标周围倾泻箭矢。",
	["Fires an arrow at the target destination. When the arrow lands, a clone is summoned. The clone is a minion that uses your bow and quiver to fire random elemental arrows which convert all physical damage to the chosen element and deal no damage of other damage types."] = "对目标地点射出一支箭，当箭到达时在目标地创造一个你的复制体。这个复制体使用跟你一样的弓与箭袋，并射出随机元素之箭，将造成的所有物理伤害转化为选中的元素伤害，并且不造成其他类型的伤害。",
	["Fires an arrow at the target destination. When the arrow lands, a clone is summoned. The clone is a minion that uses your bow and quiver."] = "对目标地点射出一支箭, 当箭到达时在目标地创造一个你的复制体. 这个复制体使用跟你一样的弓与箭袋.",
	["Fires an arrow at the target destination. When the arrow lands, you are teleported to it and a clone is summoned at your old location. The clone is a minion that uses your bow and quiver to fire arrows into the air to land around a target."] = "对目标地点射出一支箭，当箭到达时将你传送至目标地，并在原地留下一个你的复制体。这个复制体使用跟你一样的弓与箭袋，会向空中射击并在一个目标周围倾泻箭矢。",
	["Fires an arrow at the target destination. When the arrow lands, you are teleported to it and a clone is summoned at your old location. The clone is a minion that uses your bow and quiver to fire random elemental arrows which convert all physical damage to the chosen element and deal no damage of other damage types."] = "对目标地点射出一支箭，当箭到达时将你传送至目标地，并在原地留下一个你的复制体。这个复制体使用跟你一样的弓与箭袋，并射出随机元素之箭，将造成的所有物理伤害转化为选中的元素伤害，并且不造成其他类型的伤害。",
	["Fires an arrow at the target destination. When the arrow lands, you are teleported to it and a clone is summoned at your old location. The clone is a minion that uses your bow and quiver."] = "对目标地点射出一支箭, 当箭到达时将你传送至目标地, 并在原地留下一个你的复制体. 这个复制体使用跟你一样的弓与箭袋.",
	["Fires an arrow into the air to land at a targeted location, dealing area damage. The arrow sticks in the ground where it lands, and periodically fires a beam of lightning to another arrow near it, dealing area damage between them."] = "朝天射出一支箭矢落在目标地点，造成区域伤害。箭矢会刺入大地，定期朝周围的其它箭矢发射一道闪电束，在彼此之间造成区域伤害。",
	["Fires an arrow into the air to land at a targeted location, dealing area damage. The arrow sticks in the ground where it lands, and periodically fires a beam of lightning to you, dealing area damage between the arrow and you."] = "朝天射出一支箭矢落在目标地点，造成区域伤害。箭矢会刺入大地，定期朝你发射一道闪电束，在箭矢和你之间造成区域伤害。",
	["Fires an arrow into the air to land at a targeted location. On impact, deals area damage and creates a thunderstorm which blinds enemies within it. Entering the thunderstorm will cause it to gain stages, and leaving it will cause it to dissipate. Leaving the storm while it is at maximum stages will cause it to explode, dealing damage and triggering Thunderburst. You must use this skill yourself, it cannot be used by Totems, Traps, Mines, or other objects that use skills for you."] = "向天空射箭在指定的地点落下。造成范围伤害，并且形成雷霆风暴，使敌人致盲。进入雷霆风暴范围时开始充能，离开时便会消散。当雷霆风暴等级达到最大值时，离开时会剧烈爆炸，造成范围伤害，并触发雷霆爆裂技能。这个技能必须由你手动施放，不能通过图腾、陷阱、地雷或其他物品来使用。",
	["Fires an arrow that converts some physical damage to cold on its target and converts all physical damage to cold in a cone behind that target."] = "射出一支箭矢，在击中目标时将部分物理伤害转化为冰霜伤害，并在目标背后形成锥形范围攻击其它敌人，此时所有物理伤害转化为冰霜伤害。",
	["Fires an arrow that converts some physical damage to cold on its target and converts all physical damage to cold in a cone behind that target. When you use this skill, it summons a squad of Mirage Sharpshooters for a duration. Cannot be used by Totems, Traps, or Mines."] = "发射一支箭矢，将目标身上的部分物理伤害转化为冰霜伤害，并将目标身后锥形区域内的所有物理伤害转化为冰霜伤害。当你使用这个技能时，它会召唤一支持续一段时间幻影游侠小队。无法用于图腾、陷阱或地雷。",
	["Fires an arrow that explodes, dealing fire damage to its target and other nearby enemies, with an increased chance of igniting them."] = "射出一发带有火焰能量的箭矢, 接触到敌人时会爆炸, 并对其与周围的敌人造成额外火焰伤害, 同时有较高的几率造成点燃.",
	["Fires an arrow that remains in the ground behind its final target, tethering that enemy to it. Ensnared enemies have less movement speed while trying to break the snare. The snare will break if they leave the area of effect."] = "射出一支箭矢，在击中最后的目标后留在地面，将其拘束在其中。被诱捕的敌人尝试挣脱时移动速度降低。一旦被捕猎的敌人离开效果区域，该圈套就被破坏。",
	["Fires an arrow that splits to hit different targets."] = "射出一支箭矢，分裂并击中多个目标。",
	["Fires an arrow which deals chaos damage in an area on impact, and spreads caustic ground. Enemies standing on the caustic ground take chaos damage over time."] = "射出一发带有腐蚀效果的箭矢, 对击中的敌人造成额外混沌伤害, 并且产生腐蚀地面。站在地面上的敌人将会持续的受到混沌伤害.",
	["Fires an arrow which decelerates to the target location, the arrow will then become unstable and explode dealing weapon damage in an area, converting half of the physical damage to cold damage."] = "射出一根箭矢并减速飞向目标。箭矢会在飞出后变得不稳定最后爆炸并在范围内造成武器伤害，将一般的物理伤害转化为冰霜伤害。",
	["Fires an arrow which will stick into an enemy or wall, and then explode, dealing area damage around it, either after a duration or when the maximum number of arrows stuck to that target is reached. If an enemy has multiple Explosive Arrows stuck in them, the first one to explode will consume the others, adding their damage to its explosion."] = "发射一支箭矢，射在一名敌人身上或墙上，持续一段时间后或目标身上的箭矢达到上限后会引发爆炸，对周围造成范围伤害。如果一个敌人身上有多个爆炸箭矢，则第一个箭矢爆炸时会引爆剩余箭矢，它们的伤害会计入爆炸总伤害。",
	["Fires arrows up in the air, to rain down in an area. Each arrow deals area damage around where it lands, and they will all overlap on the targeted location."] = "向天空射出箭矢，在一个区域降下箭雨。每一支箭矢落地时都造成范围伤害，并可以在目标地点叠加。",
	["Fires charged arrows, which repeatedly travel for a short time before changing direction. When they hit enemies, they are struck by a bolt of lightning which damages a number of surrounding enemies."] = "射出带电的箭矢，箭矢会重复飞行一小段时间再改变方向。当箭矢击中敌人时，会生产一道闪电击中敌人，并伤害周围的多个敌人。",
	["Fires multiple arrows at different targets."] = "对不同的目标射出多重箭矢.",
	["Fires multiple arrows into the air, to land in multiple sequences after a delay, each starting at the targeted location and spreading outwards in all directions. Each arrow deals damage in an area around it. Half of the arrows will land directly on targets if there are targets in their range."] = "向空中射出多支箭矢，飞行一段时间后陆续抵达，先发射至一个指定位置，抵达后向四面八方展开。每支箭矢会对其周围区域造成伤害。若范围内有目标，则一半数量的箭矢会直接飞向目标。",
	["Fires multiple arrows into the air, to land in sequence after a delay, starting at the targeted location and spreading outwards in all directions. Each arrow deals damage in an area around it. Half of the arrows will land directly on targets if there are targets in their range."] = "向空中射出多支箭矢，飞行一段时间后陆续抵达，先发射至一个指定位置，抵达后向四面八方展开。每支箭矢会对其周围区域造成伤害。若范围内有目标，则一半数量的箭矢会直接飞向目标。",
	["Fires multiple arrows into the air, to land in sequence after a delay, starting in front of you and proceeding in a line in the direction of the target. Each arrow deals damage in an area around it."] = "向空中射出多支箭矢，飞行一段时间后陆续抵达，从你面前开始朝目标方向蔓延。每支箭矢会对其周围区域造成伤害。",
	["Fires multiple arrows into the air, to slowly land in sequence after a delay, starting at the targeted location and spreading outwards in all directions. Each arrow deals damage in an area around it. Half of the arrows will land directly on targets if there are targets in their range."] = "向空中射出多支箭矢，飞行一段时间后陆续缓慢抵达，从目标位置向四面八方蔓延。每支箭矢会对其周围区域造成伤害。若范围内有目标，则一半数量的箭矢会直接飞向目标。",
	["Fires projectiles from the targeted location that move randomly and damage enemies they pierce through. They explode after a duration, dealing area damage."] = "从目标地点发射随机移动的投射物，穿透敌人并对其造成伤害。持续一段时间后，投射物会爆炸，造成范围伤害。",
	["Fires projectiles in all directions, converting all their physical damage to a random element, and grants a buff which makes you unaffected by curses for a duration. Removes curses on you when used."] = "向所有方向发射投射物，将它们的所有物理伤害转化成随机元素伤害，并获得一个增益效果，使你在一段时间内不受诅咒影响。同时使用时移除你身上的诅咒。",
	["Fires projectiles that move randomly and damage enemies they pierce through. They explode after a duration, dealing area damage."] = "发射随机移动的投射物，对穿透的敌人造成伤害。投射物在短暂飞行后爆炸，造成范围伤害。",
	["Fires projectiles which fly in an arc, dealing area damage on impact with either enemies or the ground near where you target. Targeting farther away causes the projectiles to spread out and land over a wider area."] = "发射弧线飞行的投射物，撞击敌人或目标地面时造成范围伤害。瞄准更远的目标会使投射物扩散，落在更宽阔的区域。",
	["Fires your wand simultaneously at all nearby enemies, culling those close to death and granting you a power charge for each. Cannot be supported by Volley."] = "挥动你的法杖同时攻击附近的所有敌人. 濒死的敌人将会被终结, 并产生同等数量的暴击球. 无法被齐射辅助。",
	["Fires your wand to fire a single projectile each at a number of nearby enemies, granting you a power charge if an enemy is killed by, or soon after, the hit."] = "挥动你的法杖，向周围一定数量的敌人各发射一个投射物。若敌人在被击中的短时间内被击败，则产生一个暴击球。",
