	["Icicles emerge from the ground in a series of small bursts, each damaging enemies caught in the area and knocking them back in the direction of the next burst."] = "从地面的一系列爆发中冒出冰结之刺，每一次都对该区域内的敌人造成伤害，并将它们击退到下一次爆发的距离。",
	["Icicles emerge from the ground in a series of small bursts, each damaging enemies caught in the area."] = "从地面的一系列爆发中冒出冰结之刺，每一次都对该区域内的敌人造成伤害。",
	["Icy"] = "结冰的",
	["Icy bolts rain down over the targeted area. They explode when landing, dealing damage to nearby enemies and chilling them, as well as causing patches of chilled ground. Skill damage is based on Intelligence."] = "冰箭如雨般洒落在目标区域. 落地时将会爆炸, 对周围敌人造成伤害并冰缓它们, 并造成冰结地面. 技能伤害以智慧数值为基础.",
	["If Amethyst Flask Charges are consumed, 37% of Physical Damage as Extra Chaos Damage"] = "如果消耗紫晶药剂充能次数，造成相当于物理伤害 37% 的额外混沌伤害",
	["If Bismuth Flask Charges are consumed, Penetrate 25% Elemental Resistances"] = "如果消耗灰岩药剂充能次数，穿透 25% 的元素抗性",
	["If Diamond Flask Charges are consumed, 250% increased Critical Strike Chance"] = "如果消耗宝钻药剂充能次数，暴击几率提高 250%",
	["If a curse expires instantly curse expiration is equivalent to curse replacement"] = "诅咒立即消退时，诅咒消退等同于诅咒被替换",
	["If a modifier chooses between just two elements, the full value can only be given as those two elements."] = "若词缀只在两种元素中选择，则完整数值只能分配给这两种元素。",
	["If a specific damage type is selected, that will be the only type used."] = "若选择了具体伤害类型，则仅使用该类型计算。",
	["If two Daggers are Equipped, each contributes 60% as much Added Damage"] = "两把匕首时各贡献 60% 作为附加伤害",
	["If two Wands are Equipped, each contributes half as much Added Damage"] = "装备两把法杖时各贡献一半作为附加伤害",
	["If updating while inside a build, please re-load the build after saving."] = "若在已打开构筑时更新，请先保存，再重新加载该构筑。",
	["If you Consumed a corpse Recently, you and nearby Allies Regenerate 5% of Life per second"] = "近期消耗灵柩使你和周围友军每秒再生 5% 生命",
	["If you have Blocked Recently, you and nearby Allies Regenerate 5% of Life per second"] = "近期格挡使你和周围友军每秒再生 5% 生命",
	["If you have a guaranteed source of Blind, the strongest one will apply."] = "若有必定施加致盲的来源，则采用最强效果。",
	["If you have a guaranteed source of Elusive, the strongest one will apply."] = "若有必定获得灵巧的来源，则采用最强效果。",
	["If you have a guaranteed source of Elusive, the strongest one will apply. \nYou can change this to see various buff values"] = "若有必定获得灵巧的来源，则采用最强效果。\n可修改此值以查看不同的增益数值",
	["If you have a guaranteed source of Sap,"] = "若有必定施加力竭的来源，",
	["If you have a guaranteed source of Sap,\nthe strongest one will apply instead unless this option would apply a stronger Sap."] = "若有必定施加力竭的来源，\n应用其中最强的效果，除非此选项施加的力竭效果更强。",
	["If you have a guaranteed source of Shock,"] = "若有必定施加感电的来源，",
	["If you have a guaranteed source of Shock,\nthe strongest one will apply instead unless this option would apply a stronger Shock."] = "若有必定施加感电的来源，\n应用其中最强的效果，除非此选项施加的感电效果更强。",
	["If you have no Steel Shards, Projectile counts as already having Split"] = "若你没有钢刃碎片，则投射物视为已分裂",
	["If you have no Steel Shards, only Fires 1 Projectile"] = "若你没有钢刃碎片，则只能发射 1 枚投射物",
	["If you've Attacked Recently, you and nearby Allies have +(4-5)% Chance to Block Attack Damage"] = "若你近期内有进行攻击，你和周围友军攻击伤害格挡几率 +(4-5)%",
	["If you've Attacked Recently, you and nearby Allies have +(6-8)% Chance to Block Attack Damage"] = "若你近期内有进行攻击，你和周围友军攻击伤害格挡几率 +(6-8)%",
