	["Info:^7 You are trying to load a build created for a version of Path of Exile that is\nnot supported by us. You will have to convert it to the current game version to load it.\nTo use a build newer than the current supported game version, you may have to update.\nTo use a build older than the current supported game version, we recommend loading it\nin an older version of Path of Building Community instead.\n"] = "提示：^7你正在加载的构筑使用了当前程序不支持的游戏版本。\n需要先转换为当前游戏版本，才能加载。\n若构筑使用的版本比当前支持的版本更新，可能需要更新程序。\n若构筑使用的版本更旧，建议使用较早版本的 PoB 社区版打开。\n",
	["Infractem"] = "穿云",
	["Infuse your weapon with holy energy and swing. Successfully hitting an enemy will summon forth a copy of your Main Hand weapon as a Holy Armament. These Holy Armaments are undamageable minions, and will attack the enemies you target with Holy Strike. Requires a Mace, Sceptre or Staff."] = "为你的武器注入神圣能量并挥击。成功击中敌人将召唤出一把主手武器的复制品，作为神圣武装。这些神圣武装是无法被伤害的召唤物，会攻击你使用神圣打击技能所瞄准的敌人。需要装备锤、短杖或长杖。",
	["Infused"] = "灌注",
	["Infused Channelling"] = "灌能吟唱(辅)",
	["Infused Channelling Support"] = "灌能吟唱(辅)",
	["Infused Flesh"] = "血肉灌注",
	["Infused Toxins"] = "灌注毒素",
	["Infuses your melee weapon with electrical energies as you swing. In addition to converting some of your physical damage to lightning damage, the stored energy becomes an orb attached to the enemy you hit, or the ground if you don't hit an enemy. The orb will periodically fire projectiles at other nearby enemies for a duration, which will also damage the enemy the orb is attached to."] = "凝聚闪电之力, 转换一部分的物理伤害为闪电伤害以重击目标. 闪电之力在击中敌人后会在其身旁形成电球，若未击中敌人则在地面生成电球。电球会持续向其他周围的敌人发射投射物，也会对附加电球的敌人造成伤害。",
	["Infuses your melee weapon with electrical energies as you swing. In addition to converting some of your physical damage to lightning damage, the stored energy is released from the weapon as a projectile as you strike, flying out to hit farther-away enemies and chain between them. The projectile cannot miss if the melee attack hit a target."] = "凝聚闪电之力，将近战武器的部分物理伤害转化为闪电伤害重击敌人。充盈的闪电之力在击中后会穿透并分裂成一道投射物，袭击更远处的敌人并连锁弹射。若该近战攻击没有失手，则后续的闪电投射物无法被躲避。",
	["Infuses your melee weapon with electrical energies as you swing. In addition to converting some of your physical damage to lightning damage, the stored energy is released from the weapon as projectiles as you strike, flying out to hit farther-away enemies. The projectiles cannot miss if the melee attack hit a target."] = "凝聚闪电之力，将近战武器的部分物理伤害转化为闪电伤害重击敌人。充盈的闪电之力在击中后会穿透并分裂成数道投射物，袭击更远处的敌人。若该近战攻击没有失手，则后续的闪电投射物无法被躲避。",
	["Infuses your melee weapon with molten energies to attack with physical and fire damage. This attack causes balls of molten magma to launch forth causing area attack damage to enemies where they land."] = "给武器灌注熔岩之力，对敌人造成物理及火焰伤害。此攻击会向前发射熔岩火球，着地时对敌人造成范围伤害。",
	["Infuses your melee weapon with molten energies to attack with physical and fire damage. This attack causes balls of molten magma to launch forth from the enemies you hit, divided amongst all enemies hit by the strike. These will deal area attack damage to enemies where they land."] = "给武器灌注熔岩之力，对敌人造成物理及火焰伤害，并从击中的敌人身上发射出熔岩球，射向该攻击击中的所有敌人。这些熔岩球着地时对敌人造成范围伤害。",
	["Infuses your staff with arcane energy, lowering your mana costs and increasing your chance to block. When you block, you release an arcane wave, damaging enemies in a ring-shaped area over a duration."] = "为你的长杖灌注奥术能量，降低魔力消耗并提高格挡几率。当你格挡时，释放一道奥术脉冲，在一段时间内对环形范围内的敌人造成伤害。",
	["Infuses your two-handed melee weapon with molten energies to attack with physical and fire damage. This attack causes balls of molten magma to launch forth from the enemies you hit, divided amongst all enemies hit by the strike. These will deal area attack damage to enemies where they land. Every fifth time you attack with this skill it fires more, high-damage projectiles."] = "给双手武器灌注熔岩之力，对敌人造成物理及火焰伤害，并从击中的敌人身上发射出熔岩球，射向该攻击击中的所有敌人。这些熔岩球着地时对敌人造成范围伤害。该技能的每第五次攻击会射出更多高伤害投射物。",
