	["Laughter echoes from\nthe darkest depths\nof your mind."] = "笑声回荡\n源自你意识深处的\n至暗深渊。",
	["Launch molten projectiles from the point of impact, causing AoE attack damage to enemies where they land."] = "对目标造成物理及火焰伤害, 并在挥击的途中从武器弹射出熔岩球. 这些熔岩球在着地时会爆炸, 并对附近的敌人造成伤害.",
	["Launches a fiery projectile high into the air, to drop on a target and deal area damage where it lands."] = "向空中发射一束燃烧的投射物，落地时击中目标并造成范围伤害。",
	["Launches a series of fireballs in a spiral around the caster."] = "以施法者为中心，螺旋发射一连串火球。",
	["Launches a shard of ice that splits on hitting terrain or enemies. After splitting, the projectiles are in second form, which moves much faster and pierces through enemies."] = "射出击中地形或敌人时分裂的寒冰碎片。分裂后投射物变为第二形态，加快飞行速度并能穿透敌人。",
	["Launches a spinning blade that deals weapon damage to enemies. If firing multiple projectiles, they will be fired in a circle."] = "发射一枚螺旋前进的刀刃，对敌人造成武器伤害。它还会以环形方式发射多个投射物。",
	["Launches an unpredictable, piercing twister projectile that moves randomly for a duration, repeatedly dealing damage to enemies it intersects."] = "发出一道无法预测的旋风，它会随机移动一段时间，并反复对接触的敌人造成伤害。",
	["Launches shards of ice in rapid succession. After travelling a short distance they change to a second form, which moves much faster and pierces through enemies."] = "凝聚冰之碎片为矛并向前射出, 此冰矛将会穿透附近的敌人, 并对一定距离以外的敌人具有较高的暴击率.",
	["Launches unpredictable sparks in all directions that move randomly until they hit an enemy or expire."] = "朝四面八方施放出多颗变幻莫测的电球，这些电球将会随机移动，直到撞到敌人或自然消失。",
	["Launches unpredictable sparks that move randomly until they hit an enemy or expire."] = "施放出多颗变幻莫测的电球，这些电球将会随机移动直到撞到敌人或是自然消失.",
	["Launches unpredictable sparks with that move randomly with large differences in speed and distance until they hit an enemy or expire."] = "施放出多颗变幻莫测的电球，这些电球将会随机移动，移动速度和距离各有不同，直到撞到敌人或是自然消失。",
