	["On Killing a Poisoned Enemy, Enemies within 3 metres are Poisoned, and you and"] = "击杀中毒的敌人时，3 米内的敌人陷入中毒，且在这个中毒持续期间，如果你和",
	["On Killing a Poisoned Enemy, Enemies within 3 metres are Poisoned, and you and\nAllies Regenerate 400 Life per second for the Poison's duration if within 3 metres"] = "击杀中毒的敌人时，3 米内的敌人陷入中毒，且在这个中毒持续期间，如果你和\n友军在此 3 米范围内，则每秒回复 400 点生命",
