	["On non-channelling Attack, set a Life Flask with greater than 50% of maximum Charges remaining to 50%"] = "进行非吟唱攻击时，将一瓶剩余充能超过其最大充能 50% 的生命药剂充能量设为 50%",
	["On non-channelling Attack, set a Life Flask with greater than 50% of maximum Charges remaining to 50%\nFor each Charge removed this way, that Attack gains +2% to Damage over time Multiplier"] = "进行非吟唱攻击时，将一瓶剩余充能超过其最大充能 50% 的生命药剂充能量设为 50%\n以此方式每移除一层充能，该攻击的持续伤害加成 +2%",
	["Once activated, continuously spends mana to cause volleys of ethereal weapons rain from the sky around you, dealing damage to enemies they impact. Each Blade will target a separate enemy in the volley area if possible. Each enemy can only be hit once by each volley, even if multiple blades land near them. This skill cannot be triggered or used by Totems, Traps, or Mines."] = "激活后持续消耗魔力，在你周围召唤出从天空降下的虚空武器，对命中的敌人造成伤害。每把刀刃会尽量攻击箭雨区域内的不同敌人。每个敌人每次箭雨攻击只会被命中一次，无论多少武器落在附近。该技能无法被触发，也不能由图腾、陷阱、地雷使用。",
	["Once per second, raise a nearby corpse as a shambling undead. This minion will follow you and attack your enemies with melee strikes, but quickly falls apart. These minions have significantly increased attack speed while on low life."] = "每秒一次，将附近的一具灵柩复活为一名蹒跚的不死生物。该召唤生物会跟随你并以近战打击攻击你的敌人，但会很快崩解。当这些召唤生物处于低生命时，攻击速度显著提高。",
