	["Release a beam which deals lightning damage to enemies in a long area in front of you, and has several smaller beams branch off from it at an angle, hitting more enemies to the sides."] = "发射波束，对你前方长形范围内的敌人造成闪电伤害，并呈一定角度分裂出一些小型波束，击中两侧其它敌人。",
	["Release a concentrated beam which deals lightning damage to enemies in a long area in front of you."] = "发射汇聚波束，对你前方长形范围内的敌人造成闪电伤害。",
	["Release a lightning charged spinning copy of your weapon or its projectiles that rotates around a point, damaging enemies in an area."] = "复制并释放出一个你所使用的武器或其投射物, 并带有闪电在一个定点旋转, 对区域中的敌人造成伤害. 有 10 秒冷却时间.",
	["Release an arc of force from your weapon or fists, damaging enemies in front of you."] = "对你面前的敌人们造成普通攻击的伤害. 此技能有短暂冷却时间.",
	["Releases a circle of projectiles based on your weapon, leaving chilled ground in their wake."] = "基于你的武器，发射一圈投射物，在它们的路径上留下冰缓地面。",
	["Releases a nova of fire around you, damaging nearby enemies."] = "释放一个火焰的新星, 有短暂冷却时间.",
	["Releases a tendril of blood from your character, which will target an enemy in front of you, then chain to other enemies. The tendril deals physical damage and inflicts a physical damage over time debuff to enemies, which can stack up to 3 times."] = "以你前方的敌人为目标，施放出一道赤色光束，随后连锁弹射至其他敌人，造成物理伤害并施加一个持续物理伤害的减益效果，可以叠加三次。",
	["Releases an Arcane Wave on Block no more than once every second"] = "格挡时释放奥术波，每秒最多一次",
	["Releases several tendrils of blood from your character, targeting enemies in a narrow angle in front of you. The beams deal physical damage and inflict a physical damage over time debuff to enemies, which can stack up to 3 times. Effects which allow skills to chain can apply to these tendrils."] = "以你前方狭小角度内的敌人为目标，施放出数道赤色光束，造成物理伤害并施加一个物理伤害的减益效果，它可以叠加三次。光束可以附加连锁效果。",
