	["Reserves mana based on the supported warcries to cause those warcries to be repeatedly triggered."] = "根据被辅助的战吼保留魔力，使战吼反复触发。",
	["Reserves mana to apply a buff and leave afterimages of your recent past. Cast the spell again to return to the oldest afterimage, teleporting to that location as well as resetting your Life, Mana and Energy Shield to the values they had then."] = "通过保留魔力来施加一个增益效果，给你的当前状态施加一个快照。再次施放该法术则让你回到快照时的所有状态，包括快照时的位置、生命、能量护盾等等。",
	["Reserves some of your life to cause bleeding you inflict to be stronger, and grant life regeneration based on the number bleeding enemies nearby."] = "保留部分生命，让你施加的流血效果更强，并根据周围被施加了流血的敌人数量提供生命再生。",
