	["Retaliate against a blocked hit by calling forth a huge armoured fist to slam into the ground in front of you as you do the same, dealing weapon damage in an area."] = "格挡击中时发起反击，挥出装甲重拳猛击前方的地面，在范围内造成武器伤害。",
	["Retaliate against a blocked hit with a hail of blades that rains down in front of you, repeatedly dealing the damage of both your weapons combined. Requires Dual Wielding Melee Weapons."] = "格挡击中时发起反击，使一阵利刃从天而降，落在你的面前。反复造成两把武器合计的伤害。限定双持近战武器。",
	["Retaliate against a blocked hit with a surge of divine power, causing multiple waves of lightning bursts to expand outward from a targeted location. This skill cannot be Triggered or used by Totems, Traps, or Mines."] = "格挡击中时发起反击，迸发出一股神圣能量，产生数道闪电波，从目标位置向外扩散。该技能无法被触发，也不能由图腾、陷阱或地雷使用。",
	["Retaliate against a blocked hit with a sweep of your Shield, unleashing a wave of ice in a cone in front of you."] = "格挡击中时发起反击，用盾牌横扫身前，向前方锥形范围击出一股冰霜波。",
	["Retaliate against a blocked hit with a sweep of your Shield, unleashing a wave of light in a cone in front of you. Additional waves will also emanate from allies in a radius around the first target struck, towards that target."] = "在成功格挡一次攻击后进行反击，以盾牌横扫，并在你前方的锥形区域释放一道光波。额外的光波也会从首个被命中的目标周围一定范围内的友军处向目标释放。",
	["Retaliate against a blocked hit with an arcing slash that releases two waves of force. Enemies close in front of you can be hit by both waves. Requires a Sword or Axe and a Shield."] = "格挡击中时发起反击，挥出一道圆弧形的斩击，并释放出两道冲击波。你面前的敌人可以被两道冲击波击中。限定剑类或斧类，以及一面盾牌。",
	["Retaliate against a savage hit with a warcry, taunting all nearby enemies to attack the user. The user and nearby allies gain a buff which grants rage and prevents rage from being lost. Minions cannot gain rage."] = "受到残暴打击后发起战吼反击，嘲讽周围敌人，吸引他们的进攻，并使自身和周围友军获得一个增益，提高怒火并防止怒火损失。召唤生物无法获得怒火。",
