	["Set and Forget"] = "高枕无忧",
	["Set the default level of your builds. If this is higher than 1, manual level mode will be enabled by default in new builds."] = "设置新构筑的默认等级。若高于 1，新构筑默认启用手动等级模式。",
	["Set the default quality that can be overwritten by build-related quality settings in the skill panel."] = "设置默认宝石品质；技能面板中构筑专属的品质设置可覆盖此值。",
	["Sets a marker at a location. After a short duration, a bolt strikes the marker, dealing physical damage around it and causing bolts to strike at any other markers you've cast. Bolt impacts will leave behind a pool of boiling blood, which deals physical damage over time to enemies within it for a secondary duration."] = "在目标区域设置一个标记。经过一小段时间后，闪电会攻击那个标记，对其周围造成物理伤害，同时使闪电攻击你施放的其他标记。闪电的冲击留下一片沸血，在一定时间内对其中的敌人持续造成物理伤害。",
	["Sets a marker at a location. After a short duration, lightning strikes the marker, dealing damage around it and causing lightning strikes at any other markers you've cast."] = "在目标区域设置一个标记。经过一小段时间后，闪电会攻击那个标记，对其周围造成伤害，同时使闪电攻击你施放的其他标记。",
	["Sets a marker at a location. Lightning strikes random enemies around the marker repeatedly over the skill's duration, dealing damage in an area around the strike. Modifiers to the skill's duration will also affect the delay between these strikes. When the duration ends, a large bolt of lightning strikes the marker, dealing damage around it."] = "在目标区域设置一个标记. 当标记存在时, 闪电将会随机攻击标记附近的敌人, 对其造成伤害. 该技能的持续时间也会影响闪电发射的间隔。经过一小段时间后, 强力的闪电会攻击那个标记, 并对该标记周围的敌人造成伤害, 同时其他的标记也会陆续受到闪电攻击.",
	["Sets current number of Bleeds on the enemy if using the Crimson Dance keystone."] = "使用绯红舞蹈核心天赋时，设置敌人身上的当前流血层数。",
	["Sets current number of Bleeds on the enemy if using the Crimson Dance keystone.\nThis also implies that the enemy is Bleeding."] = "使用绯红舞蹈核心天赋时，设置敌人身上的当前流血层数。\n这也表示敌人正在流血。",
	["Sets the EHP calc to not apply gain on block, suppress or Defiance of Destiny effects"] = "有效生命计算不应用格挡／压制时的获取效果，也不应用命运之抗争的效果",
	["Sets the EHP calc to pretend its unlucky and reduce the effects of random events such as"] = "让有效生命计算按不幸情形处理，降低以下随机事件的效果：",
