	["Summon Visiting Harbinger of Focus"] = "召唤降世不屈先驱者",
	["Summon Visiting Harbinger of Time"] = "召唤降世时空先驱者",
	["Summon Visiting Harbinger of the Arcane"] = "召唤降世秘法先驱者",
	["Summon Void Spawn"] = "召唤虚空造物",
	["Summon Volatile Anomaly"] = "召唤异动奇点",
	["Summon a Chilling Skitterbot and a Shocking Skitterbot, which will trigger your traps and detonate your mines. Mines detonated by Skitterbots will re-arm and can then be detonated again. The Skitterbots grant you more trap and mine damage, and cannot be targeted or damaged."] = "召唤一个冰缓飞掠者和感电飞掠者。它们会触发陷阱，引爆地雷。被飞掠者引爆的地雷会重新部署，接着可以再次引爆。飞掠者会使你的陷阱和地雷造成更多伤害，并且不会被瞄准和受伤。",
	["Summon a Holy Relic that stays near you. When you hit an enemy with an attack, the Holy Relic triggers a nova spell with a short cooldown, that deals physical damage to enemies and grants life regeneration to allies in an area around it. This life regeneration is higher when applied to minions."] = "召唤一个停留在你身旁的圣物。当你使用攻击击中敌人，圣物会触发一个新星法术，对敌人造成物理伤害并为周围友军提供生命再生。召唤生物受到的生命再生效果更高。圣物的新星法术冷却时间很短。",
	["Summon a Holy Relic that stays near you. When you hit an enemy with an attack, the Holy Relic triggers a spell with a short cooldown, that deals physical damage to enemies in an area around a nearby enemy."] = "召唤一个停留在你身旁的圣物。当你使用攻击击中敌人，圣物会触发一个法术，对附近一名敌人周围的所有敌人造成物理伤害。圣物的法术冷却时间很短。",
	["Summon a Sentinel of Purity when you Kill an Enemy"] = "你击败 1 名敌人时召唤 1 名净化哨兵",
	["Summon a Void Spawn minion, which casts a lightning projectile spell with a chance to shock enemies."] = "召唤虚空造物仆从，施放闪电投射物法术，有几率使敌人感电。",
	["Summon two Bone Feeders which follow you around. Bone Feeders consume corpses they walk over, creating a temporary Aura after consuming 10 corpses. One Bone Feeder creates a Curse Aura of either Temporal Chains, Enfeeble or Punishment that ignores Curse Limits. The other Bone Feeder creates an Aura that causes Enemy Damage with Hits to be Unlucky."] = "召唤两个跟随你的食骨者。食骨者会吞噬它们途经的灵柩，在吞噬 10 具灵柩后创建一个临时光环。其中一个食骨者会创建诅咒光环，如时空锁链、衰弱或惩戒，且无视诅咒上限；另一个食骨者会创建光环，使敌人的击中伤害变得不幸。",
	["Summoned Agony Crawler fires 2 additional Projectiles"] = "召唤的苦痛爬行者额外发射 2 的投射物",
	["Summoned Arbalist"] = "召唤劲弩",
	["Summoned Carrion Golems deal 25% increased Damage"] = "召唤的腐化魔像造成的伤害提高 25%",
	["Summoned Carrion Golems deal 40% increased Damage"] = "召唤的腐化魔像造成的伤害提高 40%",
	["Summoned Carrion Golems have +24% to all Elemental Resistances"] = "召唤的腐化魔像获得 +24% 所有元素抗性",
	["Summoned Carrion Golems have +36% to all Elemental Resistances"] = "召唤的腐化魔像获得 +36% 所有元素抗性",
	["Summoned Cobra"] = "被召唤的眼镜蛇",
	["Summoned Golem in past 10 Seconds?"] = "过去 10 秒内是否召唤过魔像？",
	["Summoned Golem in past 8 Seconds?"] = "过去 8 秒内是否召唤过魔像？",
	["Summoned Golems Regenerate 2% of their Life per second"] = "召唤的魔像每秒再生 2% 生命",
	["Summoned Golems are Aggressive"] = "召唤的魔像转为侵略",
	["Summoned Golems are Immune to Elemental Damage"] = "召唤的魔像免疫元素伤害",
	["Summoned Golems are Resummoned 4 seconds after being Killed"] = "召唤的魔像被击败 4 秒后会被重新召唤",
	["Summoned Golems have (10-15)% increased Cooldown Recovery Rate"] = "召唤魔像时，它们的冷却回复率提高 (10-15)%",
	["Summoned Golems have (30-45)% increased Cooldown Recovery Rate"] = "召唤魔像时，它们的冷却回复率提高 (30-45)%",
	["Summoned Holy Relics deal 25% increased Damage"] = "召唤圣物的伤害提高 25%",
	["Summoned Holy Relics deal 40% increased Damage"] = "召唤圣物的伤害提高 40%",
	["Summoned Holy Relics have (20-25)% reduced Cooldown Recovery Rate"] = "召唤圣物的冷却恢复速度减慢 (20-25)%",
	["Summoned Holy Relics have 16% increased Area of Effect"] = "召唤圣物的效果区域扩大 16%",
	["Summoned Holy Relics have 24% increased Area of Effect"] = "召唤圣物的效果区域扩大 24%",
	["Summoned Holy Relics have 40% increased Buff Effect"] = "召唤的圣物的增益效果提高 40%",
	["Summoned Holy Relics have 60% increased Buff Effect"] = "召唤的圣物的增益效果提高 60%",
	["Summoned Phantasm"] = "异界凶灵",
	["Summoned Phantasms have 10% chance to refresh their Duration when they Hit a Rare or Unique Enemy"] = "召唤的幻灵击中稀有或传奇敌人时有 10% 的几率刷新持续时间",
	["Summoned Phantasms have 10% chance to refresh their Duration when they Hit a Rare or Unique Enemy\nSummoned Raging Spirits have 10% chance to refresh their Duration when they Hit a Rare or Unique Enemy"] = "召唤的幻灵击中稀有或传奇敌人时有 10% 的几率刷新持续时间\n召唤的愤怒狂灵击中稀有或传奇敌人时有 10% 的几率刷新持续时间",
	["Summoned Phantasms have 5% chance to refresh their Duration when they Hit a Rare or Unique Enemy"] = "召唤的幻灵击中稀有或传奇敌人时有 5% 的几率刷新持续时间",
	["Summoned Phantasms have 5% chance to refresh their Duration when they Hit a Rare or Unique Enemy\nSummoned Raging Spirits have 5% chance to refresh their Duration when they Hit a Rare or Unique Enemy"] = "召唤的幻灵击中稀有或传奇敌人时有 5% 的几率刷新持续时间\n召唤的愤怒狂灵击中稀有或传奇敌人时有 5% 的几率刷新持续时间",
	["Summoned Raging Spirits deal (130-150)% increased Damage"] = "召唤愤怒狂灵的伤害提高 (130-150)%",
	["Summoned Raging Spirits deal (175-250)% increased Damage"] = "召唤愤怒狂灵的伤害提高 (175-250)%",
	["Summoned Raging Spirits deal (25-40)% increased Damage"] = "召唤愤怒狂灵的伤害提高 (25-40)%",
	["Summoned Raging Spirits deal (60-80)% increased Damage"] = "召唤愤怒狂灵的伤害提高 (60-80)%",
	["Summoned Raging Spirits deal 25% increased Damage"] = "召唤愤怒狂灵的伤害提高 25%",
	["Summoned Raging Spirits deal 40% increased Damage"] = "召唤愤怒狂灵的伤害提高 40%",
	["Summoned Raging Spirits have (25-40)% increased maximum Life"] = "愤怒狂灵的最大生命提高 (25-40)%",
	["Summoned Raging Spirits have (80-100)% increased maximum Life"] = "愤怒狂灵的最大生命提高 (80-100)%",
	["Summoned Raging Spirits have 10% chance to refresh their Duration when they Hit a Rare or Unique Enemy"] = "召唤的愤怒狂灵击中稀有或传奇敌人时有 10% 的几率刷新持续时间",
	["Summoned Raging Spirits have 5% chance to refresh their Duration when they Hit a Rare or Unique Enemy"] = "召唤的愤怒狂灵击中稀有或传奇敌人时有 5% 的几率刷新持续时间",
	["Summoned Raging Spirits take 20% of their Maximum Life per second as Chaos Damage"] = "愤怒狂灵每秒受到等同于最大生命 20% 的混沌伤害",
	["Summoned Raging Spirits' Hits always Ignite"] = "愤怒狂灵击中后必定造成点燃",
	["Summoned Raging Spirits' Melee Strikes deal Fire-only Splash\nDamage to Surrounding Targets"] = "召唤的愤怒狂灵其近战打击对周围目标造成火焰限定溅射伤害",
	["Summoned Reaper deals 25% increased Damage"] = "召唤追命死灵的伤害提高 25%",
	["Summoned Reaper deals 40% increased Damage"] = "召唤追命死灵的伤害提高 40%",
	["Summoned Reaper has +12% to Physical Damage over Time Multiplier"] = "召唤追命死灵的持续物理伤害加成 +12%",
	["Summoned Reaper has +20% to Physical Damage over Time Multiplier"] = "召唤追命死灵的持续物理伤害加成 +20%",
	["Summoned Rhoa"] = "召唤的兽化恐喙鸟",
	["Summoned Sentinels have 25% increased Cooldown Recovery Rate"] = "召唤的纯净哨兵冷却回复速度加快 25%",
	["Summoned Sentinels of Absolution have 16% increased Area of Effect"] = "赦罪召唤的哨兵效果区域扩大 16%",
	["Summoned Sentinels of Absolution have 24% increased Area of Effect"] = "赦罪召唤的哨兵效果区域扩大 24%",
	["Summoned Skeleton"] = "异灵魔侍",
	["Summoned Skeleton Archer"] = "异灵魔侍弓箭手",
	["Summoned Skeleton Caster"] = "异灵魔侍术者",
	["Summoned Skeleton Soldier"] = "异灵魔侍兵",
	["Summoned Skeleton Warriors and Soldiers deal Triple Damage with this"] = "如果你最近使用这把武器击中过，",
	["Summoned Skeleton Warriors and Soldiers deal Triple Damage with this\nWeapon if you've Hit with this Weapon Recently"] = "如果你最近使用这把武器击中过，\n召唤的魔侍武士和魔侍兵使用该武器造成三倍伤害",
	["Summoned Skeleton Warriors and Soldiers wield this Weapon while in your Main Hand"] = "装备于你的主手时，召唤的魔侍武士和魔侍兵持有该武器",
	["Summoned Skeleton Warriors are Permanent and Follow you"] = "召唤的魔侍武士将会一直跟着你",
	["Summoned Skeleton Warriors are Permanent and Follow you\nSummon Skeletons cannot Summon more than 1 Skeleton Warrior"] = "召唤的魔侍武士将会一直跟着你\n召唤魔侍所召唤的魔侍武士数量不多于 1 个",
	["Summoned Skeletons Cover Enemies in Ash on Hit"] = "召唤的魔侍击中时使敌人被灰烬缠身",
	["Summoned Skeletons have 10% chance to Wither Enemies for 2 seconds on Hit"] = "召唤的魔侍有 10% 的几率在击中时使敌人陷入死亡凋零状态 2 秒",
	["Summoned Skeletons have 30% of Physical Damage Converted to Chaos Damage"] = "召唤的魔侍将 30% 的物理伤害转化为混沌伤害",
	["Summoned Skeletons have Avatar of Fire"] = "召唤的魔侍获得火之化身",
	["Summoned Skeletons take (15-30)% of their Maximum Life per second as Fire Damage"] = "召唤的魔侍每秒承受其生命上限 (15-30)% 的火焰伤害",
	["Summoned Skitterbots have 60% increased Area of Effect"] = "召唤的飞掠者效果区域提高 60%",
	["Summoned Skitterbots have 90% increased Area of Effect"] = "召唤的飞掠者效果区域提高 90%",
	["Summoned Skitterbots' Auras affect you as well as Enemies"] = "召唤飞掠者的光环效果同时影响你和敌人",
	["Summoned Spectre in past 8 Seconds?"] = "过去 8 秒内是否召唤过灵体？",
	["Summoned Ursa"] = "召唤之爪",
	["Summoned Zombie in past 8 Seconds?"] = "过去 8 秒内是否召唤过魔卫？",
	["Summoning Tulgraft"] = "召唤的托沃之嫁接",
	["Summons 1 Living Lightning Minion"] = "召唤 1 个活体闪电召唤生物",
	["Summons 1 Skeleton General"] = "召唤 1 个魔侍将军",
	["Summons 1 Skeleton Mage"] = "召唤 1 个魔侍法师",
	["Summons Arbalist minions which use projectile attacks."] = "召唤发射投射物的劲弩。",
	["Summons Living Lightning Minions, which target nearby enemies with a number of Melee Chaining Attacks before dissipating. Enemies will not directly engage these Minions, and can pass through them."] = "召唤活体闪电仆从，向附近敌人发动数次连锁攻击后消散。敌人将不会直接攻击这些召唤生物，且可穿过它们。",
	["Summons a Ballista Totem which uses this Skill"] = "召唤一个使用该技能的弩炮图腾",
	["Summons a Bestial Rhoa. In addition to its melee attack, the Bestial Rhoa uses a charge and has an aura that intimidates enemies. Enemies will not engage this minion directly, and they are immune to damage."] = "召唤一个兽化恐喙鸟。兽化恐喙鸟能进行近战攻击并拥有冲锋技能，而且附带能威吓敌人的光环。兽化恐喙鸟的攻击无法被闪避。敌人将不会直接攻击该召唤生物，并且它们对伤害免疫。",
	["Summons a Bestial Snake. The Bestial Snake fires powerful chaos projectile attacks. Enemies will not engage this minion directly, and they are immune to damage."] = "召唤一个兽化巨蛇。兽化巨蛇的攻击能射出强大的混沌投射物。敌人将不会直接攻击该召唤生物，并且它们对伤害免疫。",
	["Summons a Bestial Ursa. In addition to its melee attack, the Bestial Ursa uses a powerful Ground Slam and Rallying Cry. Enemies will not engage this minion directly, and they are immune to damage."] = "召唤一个兽化之爪。兽化之爪能进行近战攻击并拥有裂地之击技能，而且附带激励战吼。敌人将不会直接攻击该召唤生物，并且它们对伤害免疫。",
	["Summons a Carrion Golem that grants added physical damage for your non-golem minions. The Carrion Golem attacks with a series of slashes that increase in speed and damage, as well as a cascade of bone spikes, and deals more damage for each of your non-golem minions near it."] = "召唤一个腐化魔像，给非魔像召唤生物附加物理伤害。这种魔像可以挥出伤害递增，速度越来越快的破空斩，还可以发出骸骨突刺。并使它附近每个非魔像召唤生物造成更多伤害。",
	["Summons a Carrion Golem. The Carrion Golem attacks with a series of slashes that increase in speed and damage, as well as a cascade of bone spikes."] = "召唤一个腐化魔像。腐化魔像可以挥出伤害递增，速度越来越快的破空斩，还可以发出骸骨突刺。",
	["Summons a Carrion Golem. The Carrion Golem attacks with a series of slashes that increase in speed and damage, can consume corpses to heal itself and gain the ability to unleash a devastating cascade of bone spikes, and deals more damage for each of your non-golem minions near it."] = "召唤一个腐化魔像。腐化魔像可以挥出伤害递增，速度越来越快的破空斩，可以消耗灵柩来治疗自己，并获得发出毁灭性骸骨突刺的能力。附近每个非魔像召唤生物可以使它造成更多伤害。",
	["Summons a Chaos Golem that grants you damage over time and chaos resistance. The Chaos Golem can cast a damage over time Chaos aura and a cascade of Chaos spikes in addition to its melee attack."] = "召唤一个混沌魔像，启动时使你获得持续伤害和混沌抗性。除了一般的近战攻击外，混沌魔像会施放一个造成持续伤害的混沌光环和混沌之刺。",
	["Summons a Chaos Golem. The Chaos Golem can cast a damage over time Chaos aura and a cascade of Chaos spikes in addition to its melee attack."] = "召唤一个混沌魔像。除了一般的近战攻击外，混沌魔像会施放一个造成持续伤害的混沌光环和混沌之刺。",
	["Summons a Chaos Golem. The Chaos Golem can cast a powerful damage over time Chaos aura that Withers enemies in addition to its melee attack."] = "召唤一个混沌魔像。除了一般的近战攻击外，混沌魔像会施放一个造成高额持续伤害并施加死亡凋零的混沌光环。",
	["Summons a Flame Golem that grants you increased Damage and Area of Effect. The Flame Golem can cast a fire spray, a wave of fire damage, and an explosive arcing projectile."] = "召唤一个烈焰魔像，启动时会提高你的伤害和效果区域。烈焰魔像会施放火焰放射，火焰波浪，还会射出会爆炸的弧状移动投射物。",
	["Summons a Flame Golem. The Flame Golem can cast a fire spray, a wave of fire damage, and an explosive arcing projectile."] = "召唤一个烈焰魔像。烈焰魔像会施放火焰放射，火焰波浪，还会射出会爆炸的弧状移动投射物。",
	["Summons a Flame Golem. When summoned, the Flame Golem attacks by falling from the sky, dealing fire damage in an area and leaving burning ground around the impact. After landing, it can cast a fire spray and a wave of fire damage."] = "召唤一个烈焰魔像。烈焰魔像被召唤时从天而降，撞击时造成范围伤害并留下燃烧地面。落地后会施放火焰放射和火焰波浪。",
	["Summons a Lightning Golem that grants you increased attack and cast speed, and mana regeneration. The Lightning Golem fires a projectile spell, creates orbs of Lightning that zap nearby enemies, and casts a temporary aura that grants added Lightning Damage to spells and attacks used by the Golem and its nearby allies."] = "召唤一个闪电魔像，给予你额外的攻击、施法速度和魔力再生。魔像会对敌人进行雷击，召唤会电击敌人的闪电球，并施放一个为魔像及其周围友军的法术和攻击附加闪电伤害的临时光环。",
	["Summons a Lightning Golem. The Lightning Golem fires a projectile spell, creates orbs of Lightning that zap nearby enemies, and casts a temporary aura that grants added Lightning Damage to spells and attacks used by the Golem and its nearby allies."] = "召唤一个闪电魔像。魔像会射出投射物法术，召唤会电击敌人的闪电球，并施放一个为魔像及其周围友军的法术和攻击附加闪电伤害的临时光环。",
	["Summons a Phantasm minion, which uses a piercing projectile spell that deals physical damage."] = "召唤一个幻灵，它会使用造成物理伤害的穿透投射物法术。",
	["Summons a Reaper which uses a variety of slashing area attacks. The presence of any Reapers weakens your other non-Reaper minions, and Reapers will consume them to temporarily empower and heal themselves."] = "召唤一个追命死灵，它会施放多种区域攻击。追命死灵会削弱你的其它非追命死灵的召唤生物，还会消耗它们以治疗并暂时强化自己。",
	["Summons a Relic of a random element that stays near you. Depending on the element chosen, the relic minion will have an Anger, Hatred, or Wrath aura. These relics explode when they die, dealing elemental damage to enemies around them. If you already have a relic of the chosen element, its duration will be refreshed instead of summoning a new one."] = "在你身旁召唤一个随机元素的遗物。根据选择的元素，遗物召唤生物会具有愤怒、憎恨或雷霆光环。遗物被击败时爆炸，对周围的敌人造成元素伤害。如果你已拥有该元素的遗物，则会刷新它的持续时间，而非召唤一个新的遗物。",
	["Summons a Sentinel of Radiance which follows you and attacks enemies in melee, while burning enemies around it and taking a portion of damage from hits for you. You can only have one Sentinel of Radiance."] = "召唤一个跟随你的光辉哨兵，它会攻击近战范围内的敌人，使周围的敌人燃烧，并替你承受一定比例的击中伤害。你只能拥有一个光辉哨兵。",
	["Summons a Spectral Tiger Companion that attacks nearby enemies and dies after a duration. Each Spectral Tiger grants you a buff that increases Critical Strike Chance, and increases Attack and Cast Speed. If you have the maximum number of them, refreshes the duration and life of an existing one instead."] = "召唤一头幽虎同伴攻击周围的敌人，持续一段时间后消失。每头幽虎都会给你提供增益效果，可以增加暴击几率，并提升攻击和施法速度。达到召唤上限时使用会刷新其中一头幽虎的生命和持续时间。",
	["Summons a Stone Golem that grants you life regeneration and defences. In addition to its melee attack, the Stone Golem uses a rolling charge and a powerful slam that can taunt enemies."] = "召唤一个为你提供额外生命回复和防御的巨石魔像。除了一般的近战攻击外，巨石魔像会使用滚动冲撞，还有沉重的冲击波来嘲讽附近的敌人。",
	["Summons a Stone Golem that takes a portion of the melee damage you recieve from enemy hits from its life before yours. In addition to its melee attack, the Stone Golem uses a rolling charge and a powerful slam that can taunt enemies."] = "召唤一个巨石魔像，你受到敌人击中物理伤害的一定比例由其生命承担。除了一般的近战攻击外，巨石魔像会使用滚动冲撞，还有沉重的猛击来嘲讽附近的敌人。",
	["Summons a Stone Golem. In addition to its melee attack, the Stone Golem uses a rolling charge and a powerful slam that can taunt enemies."] = "召唤一个巨石魔像。除了一般的近战攻击外，巨石魔像会使用滚动冲撞，还有沉重的猛击来嘲讽附近的敌人。",
	["Summons a Taunting Contraption that taunts nearby enemies to attack it."] = "召唤一个嘲讽装置，嘲讽周围的敌人。",
	["Summons a Totem which uses this Skill"] = "召唤一个使用该技能的图腾",
	["Summons a ballista totem that attacks with forking arrows."] = "召唤一个发射分叉箭矢的弩炮图腾。",
	["Summons a ballista totem that attacks with piercing arrows. Requires a Bow."] = "召唤一个发射穿刺箭矢的弩炮图腾。需要弓类武器。",
	["Summons a ballista totem that consumes your Steel Shards to fire multiple arrows with extreme force, breaking them apart into shrapnel. Enemies can be hit by multiple arrows from the same attack. Requires a Bow. Steel Shards are gained with the Call of Steel Skill."] = "召唤一个弩炮图腾，消耗钢刃碎片以发射多重箭矢，在巨力作用下分裂成散弹。敌人可以同时被多重箭矢击中。需要弓类武器。钢刃碎片由【钢铁呼唤】提供。",
	["Summons a ballista totem that fires multiple arrows with extreme force, breaking them apart into shrapnel. Enemies can be hit by multiple arrows from the same attack. Requires a Bow."] = "召唤一个弩炮图腾，发射多重箭矢，在巨力作用下分裂成散弹。敌人可以同时被多重箭矢击中。需要弓类武器。",
	["Summons a ballista totem that propels a number of fiery arrows into the air, each targeting a specific enemy. Arrows deal area damage to enemies around it on landing. Requires a Bow."] = "召唤一个弩炮图腾，朝空中猛烈发射多支箭矢，每支以一个敌人为目标。箭矢落地时对周围的敌人造成范围伤害。需要弓类武器。",
	["Summons a ballista totem that propels a sequence of fiery arrows into the air. The arrows impact the ground in a line, each dealing area damage to enemies around it. Requires a Bow."] = "召唤一个弩炮图腾，朝空中猛烈发射一连串箭矢。这些箭矢以一条直线击中地面，每一支都对周围的敌人造成范围伤害。需要弓类武器。",
	["Summons a ballista totem that propels a sequence of fiery arrows into the air. The arrows impact the ground in two perpendicular lines, each dealing area damage to enemies around it. Requires a Bow."] = "召唤一个弩炮图腾，朝空中猛烈发射一连串箭矢。这些箭矢沿两条垂直线条击中地面，每一支都对周围的敌人造成范围伤害。需要弓类武器。",
	["Summons a horde of Hiveborn Breach monsters to do your bidding. These summoned monsters have all their physical damage converted to cold."] = "召唤一支裂隙虫群怪物大军为你作战。这些被召唤的怪物会将其全部物理伤害转化为冰霜伤害。",
	["Summons a powerful Reaper which passively follows you without attacking enemies. The Reaper's presence weakens your other minions, and it will consume them to temporarily empower and heal itself. Using this skill while the Reaper is already summoned causes it to dash to the targeted location and perform a powerful attack. Cannot be triggered, supported by Spell Echo or Unleash, or used by Totems, Traps, or Mines."] = "召唤一个强力的追命死灵，它会被动地跟随你，不会攻击敌人。追命死灵会削弱你的其它召唤生物，还会消耗它们以治疗并暂时强化自己。召唤追命死灵后再施放该技能可以让它冲向目标地点施放一次强力攻击。不能被触发或受“施法回响”和“释出”辅助，不能由图腾、陷阱、地雷使用。",
	["Summons a powerful Reaper which uses a variety of slashing area attacks. The Reaper's presence weakens your other minions, and it will consume them to temporarily empower and heal itself. Using this skill while the Reaper is already summoned causes it to dash to the targeted location and perform a powerful attack."] = "召唤一个强力的追命死灵，它会施放凌厉的区域攻击。追命死灵会削弱你的其它召唤生物，偶尔还会消耗它们来强化自己，并给自己回血。召唤追命死灵后再施放该技能可以让它冲向目标地点施放一次强力攻击。",
	["Summons a ring of ballista totems around a targeted location. These ballistae fire once at the targeted location and then expire. Requires a Bow."] = "在目标地点周围召唤一圈弩炮图腾。这些弩炮会向目标地点射击一次后消失。需要弓类武器。",
	["Summons a short-lived flaming skull that rushes at nearby enemies and attacks them rapidly, converting all its physical damage to fire. Enemies will not directly engage these spirits, and can pass through them."] = "召唤只能存在极短时间的愤怒狂灵，这些火焰魔侍将会冲至敌人身边并快速的进行攻击，并将其造成的所有物理伤害转化为火焰伤害。敌方生物将不会主动攻击这些狂灵，并可以穿越它们。",
	["Summons a spectral wolf companion that attacks nearby enemies and dies after a duration. Each spectral wolf grants you a buff that adds damage to your attacks. If you have the maximum number of them, refreshes the duration and life of an existing one instead."] = "召唤一头幽狼伙伴攻击周围的敌人，持续一段时间后消失。每头幽狼都会给你提供增加攻击伤害的增益效果。达到召唤上限时使用会刷新其中一头的生命和持续时间。",
	["Summons a totem that can consume nearby corpses. If you are hurt, it will destroy a corpse to leech life to you."] = "召唤一个图腾, 它会吞噬附近的灵柩并为你回复生命.",
	["Summons a totem that casts a beam of fire at you and each other totem you control, dealing burning damage to enemies caught in the beam. Enemies near either end of a beam also suffer burning damage."] = "召唤一个图腾, 它会与你和你所操控的所有图腾之间产生火焰连接, 经过火焰连接或是靠近火焰连接尾端的敌人将会受到燃烧伤害.",
	["Summons a totem that casts a beam of fire at you and each other totem you control, dealing burning damage to enemies caught in the beam. Enemies near either end of a beam also suffer burning damage. Reaching maximum active totem count will cause all totems from this skill to detonate, applying the same burning damage for a duration."] = "召唤一个图腾，向你和你操控的其他图腾发射一道火焰光束，使被光束击中的敌人受到燃烧伤害。光束两端附近的敌人也会受到燃烧伤害。达到最大激活图腾数量时，该技能召唤的所有图腾将引爆，并在一段时间内对敌人施加相同的燃烧伤害。",
	["Summons a totem that channels to fire a stream of flame at nearby enemies, and creates an area of consecrated ground around the totem."] = "召唤一个图腾，它会持续对附近的敌人喷射火焰，并在图腾周围创造一片奉献地面。",
	["Summons a totem that has an aura which regenerates life for you and your nearby allies."] = "召唤一个带有光环的图腾，为你和周围的友军提供生命再生。",
	["Summons a totem that has an aura which regenerates life for you and your nearby allies. When things affected by the aura are hit, the totem's life is removed instead for some of the damage."] = "召唤一个带有光环的图腾，为你和周围的友军提供生命再生。受光环影响的对象被击中时，图腾会损失生命来承担部分伤害。",
	["Summons a totem that shakes the earth around it, knocking back and damaging nearby enemies"] = "召唤一个图腾, 它会持续的震动附近的地面, 击退附近的敌人并造成伤害.",
	["Summons a totem that shakes the earth around you, damaging enemies."] = "召唤一个图腾，它会持续震动附近的地面，对敌人造成伤害。",
	["Summons a totem that taunts nearby monsters to attack it."] = "召唤一个图腾，它会持续的嘲讽周围的敌人对其进行攻击.",
	["Summons an Ice Golem that grants you increased Critical Strike Chance and Accuracy. The Ice Golem can use an icy barrage spell and a chilling spinning attack in addition to its melee attack."] = "召唤一个寒冰魔像，启动时会提高你的暴击和命中。除了一般的近战攻击外，寒冰魔像会施放寒冰弹幕和冰缓回旋攻击。",
	["Summons an Ice Golem. The Ice Golem can use an icy barrage spell and a chilling spinning attack in addition to its melee attack."] = "召唤一个寒冰魔像。除了一般的近战攻击外，寒冰魔像会施放寒冰弹幕和冰缓回旋攻击。",
	["Summons an Ice Golem. The Ice Golem can use an icy barrage spell and a chilling spinning attack in addition to its melee attack. If reduced to low life it will trigger a spell that destroys itself to deal area damage and fire icy projectiles in a circle."] = "召唤一个寒冰魔像。除了一般的近战攻击外，寒冰魔像会施放寒冰弹幕和冰缓回旋攻击。它会在低血时触发一个自毁法术，造成范围伤害并发射环形的冰霜投射物。",
	["Summons an army of skeletal soldiers, archers and mages, led by a powerful general."] = "召唤一支由强大的魔侍将军所统率，由魔侍兵，魔侍弓箭手与魔侍法师所组成的魔侍大军。",
	["Summons an effigy of Doedre, which will project auras of all the curse skill gems socketed in Doedre's Skin. These curses have less effectiveness."] = "召唤一个德瑞的雕像，该雕像会在一个范围内投射插在德瑞之肤上的所有诅咒技能。这些诅咒的效能较弱。",
	["Summons an immortal Harbinger minion. The minion has two buff spells it will cast on you: Arcane Surge, granting increased Cast Speed and Mana Regeneration, and a buff that grants Chance to Shock and Lightning Penetration."] = "召唤一个不朽的先驱者。它会偶尔对你施放两个下列增益法术：秘术增强，加快施法速度并提高魔力再生率，以及一个有几率导致感电并穿透闪电抗性的增益效果。",
	["Summons an immortal Harbinger minion. The minion will cast a random buff on you that grants one or all of the following: 1 additional Projectile, +1 Chain, Pierce 1 additional Target, or Projectiles Fork."] = "召唤一个不死的先驱者。它会对你施放随机增益，附加以下任意一个或全部效果：发射 1 个额外投射物，连锁 +1，投射物穿透 1 个额外目标，或者投射物分裂时额外分裂一次。",
	["Summons an immortal Harbinger minion. The minion will cast a random buff on you that grants one or all of the following: Fire 2 additional Projectiles, Chain 2 additional times, Projectiles Pierce 2 additional targets, or Projectiles Fork then Fork an additional time."] = "召唤一个不死的先驱者。它会对你施放随机增益，附加以下任意一个或全部效果：发射 2 个额外投射物，额外连锁 2 次，投射物穿透 2 个额外目标，或者投射物分裂时额外分裂一次。",
	["Summons an immortal Harbinger minion. The minion will occasionally apply a Chill or Shock to an enemy that chains to other nearby enemies."] = "召唤一个不死的冰雷先驱者. 先驱者偶尔会冰缓或感电敌人并连锁到附近的敌人.",
	["Summons an immortal Harbinger minion. The minion will occasionally apply a Chill or Shock with increased effect to an enemy that chains to other nearby enemies."] = "召唤一个不死的先驱者。它会偶尔对敌人施加提高效果的冰缓或感电效果，并连锁给周围其它敌人。",
	["Summons an immortal Harbinger minion. The minion will occasionally cast Arcane Surge on you, granting increased Cast Speed and Mana Regeneration."] = "召唤一个不朽的先驱者。它会偶尔对你施放秘术增强，提高施法速度和魔力再生率。",
	["Summons an immortal Harbinger minion. The minion will occasionally create an aura on you that increases the Action Speed of you and all allies near you."] = "召唤一个不死的先驱者。它会偶尔对你施放光环，增加你和你周围所有队友的行动速度。",
	["Summons an immortal Harbinger minion. The minion will occasionally create an aura on you that increases the Action Speed of you, and all allies and enemies near you."] = "召唤一个不死的先驱者。它会偶尔对你施放光环，增加你和你周围所有敌我单位的行动速度。",
	["Summons an immortal Harbinger minion. When you are near a rare or unique enemy, the minion will occasionally grant you a buff giving significantly increased Damage, Attack Speed, and Movement Speed, and reducing the Damage you take."] = "召唤一个不死的先驱者。当你周围有稀有或传奇敌人时，它会偶尔给你提供一个增益效果，大幅提高伤害、攻击速度和移动速度，并降低你受到的伤害。",
	["Summons an immortal Harbinger minion. When you are near a rare or unique enemy, the minion will occasionally grant you a buff giving significantly increased Damage, Attack Speed, and Movement Speed, reducing the Damage you take, and causing Bleeding Enemies that you Kill to Explode, dealing 10% of their maximum Life as Physical Damage."] = "召唤一个不死的先驱者。当你周围有稀有或传奇敌人时，它会偶尔给你提供一个增益效果，大幅提高伤害、攻击速度和移动速度，降低你受到的伤害。并使被你击败的敌人爆炸，造成其生命上限 10% 的物理伤害。",
	["Summons an immortal Harbinger minion. While you are channelling, the minion will occasionally cast a buff on you that reduces the Damage you take, and makes you avoid all Stuns and Elemental Ailments."] = "召唤一个不死的不屈先驱者。在你持续吟唱时, 先驱者偶尔会对你施放一个增益, 减少你受到的伤害, 使你免疫所有晕眩和元素异常状态。",
	["Summons an immortal Harbinger minion. While you are channelling, the minion will occasionally cast a buff on you that reduces the Damage you take, makes you avoid all Stuns and Elemental Ailments, and prevents Curses affecting you."] = "召唤一个不死的先驱者。它会在你持续吟唱时偶尔会对你施放一个增益效果，减少你受到的伤害，使你避免所有晕眩和元素异常状态，并免受诅咒影响。",
	["Summons an immortal chieftain minion of the Arohongui tribe to fight alongside you for a duration. This minion grants you a buff which makes travel skills recover cooldowns faster. Shares a Cooldown with other Spirit Chieftain Skills."] = "召唤一个不死的亚欧红古部落酋长，与你并肩作战一段时间。该召唤生物会给你提供一个增益效果，提升旅行技能的冷却回复速度。与其他酋长之魂技能共用冷却时间。",
	["Summons an immortal chieftain minion of the Hinekora tribe to fight alongside you for a duration. This minion grants you a buff which regenerates mana. Shares a Cooldown with other Spirit Chieftain Skills."] = "召唤一个不死的辛格拉部落酋长，与你并肩作战一段时间。该召唤生物会给你提供一个增益效果，使你获得魔力再生。与其他酋长之魂技能共用冷却时间。",
	["Summons an immortal chieftain minion of the Kitava tribe to fight alongside you for a duration. This minion grants you a buff which makes a percentage of your leech recover instantly. Shares a Cooldown with other Spirit Chieftain Skills."] = "召唤一个不死的奇塔弗部落酋长，与你并肩作战一段时间。该召唤生物会给你提供一个增益效果，使一定比例的生命偷取立即生效。与其他酋长之魂技能共用冷却时间。",
	["Summons an immortal chieftain minion of the Ngamahu tribe to fight alongside you for a duration. This minion grants you a buff which allows totems to take some damage from hits for you. Shares a Cooldown with other Spirit Chieftain Skills."] = "召唤一个不死的努葛玛呼部落酋长，与你并肩作战一段时间。该召唤生物会给你提供一个增益效果，让图腾替你承受部分击中伤害。与其他酋长之魂技能共用冷却时间。",
	["Summons an immortal chieftain minion of the Ramako tribe to fight alongside you for a duration. This minion grants you a buff which prevents additional damage from suppressed spells. Shares a Cooldown with other Spirit Chieftain Skills."] = "召唤一个不死的雷默科部落酋长，与你并肩作战一段时间。该召唤生物会给你提供一个增益效果，压制法术时能阻挡更多伤害。与其他酋长之魂技能共用冷却时间。",
	["Summons an immortal chieftain minion of the Rongokurai tribe to fight alongside you for a duration. This minion grants you a buff which lets a percentage of your armour protect against all damage types. Shares a Cooldown with other Spirit Chieftain Skills."] = "召唤一个不死的隆戈库莱部落酋长，与你并肩作战一段时间。该召唤生物会给你提供一个增益效果，让你的部分护甲值能够抵御所有伤害类型。与其他酋长之魂技能共用冷却时间。",
	["Summons an immortal chieftain minion of the Tasalio tribe to fight alongside you for a duration. This minion grants you a buff which prevents your action speed being lowered. Shares a Cooldown with other Spirit Chieftain Skills."] = "召唤一个不死的塔萨里奥部落酋长，与你并肩作战一段时间。该召唤生物会给你提供一个增益效果，使你的行动速度无法被降低。与其他酋长之魂技能共用冷却时间。",
	["Summons an immortal chieftain minion of the Tawhoa tribe to fight alongside you for a duration. This minion grants you a buff which refills flasks. Shares a Cooldown with other Spirit Chieftain Skills."] = "召唤一个不死的塔赫亚部落酋长，与你并肩作战一段时间。该召唤生物会给你提供一个增益效果，补充你的药剂。与其他酋长之魂技能共用冷却时间。",
	["Summons an immortal chieftain minion of the Tukohama tribe to fight alongside you for a duration. This minion grants you a buff which regenerates rage. Shares a Cooldown with other Spirit Chieftain Skills."] = "召唤一个不死的图克哈玛部落酋长，与你并肩作战一段时间。该召唤生物会给你提供一个增益效果，使你获得怒火再生。与其他酋长之魂技能共用冷却时间。",
	["Summons an immortal chieftain minion of the Valako tribe to fight alongside you for a duration. This minion grants you a buff which recovers life, mana and energy shield when you block. Shares a Cooldown with other Spirit Chieftain Skills."] = "召唤一个不死的瓦拉克部落酋长，与你并肩作战一段时间。该召唤生物会给你提供一个增益效果，在你格挡时回复生命、魔力和能量护盾。与其他酋长之魂技能共用冷却时间。",
	["Summons forth a field of grasping hands, each of which clutches an orb of lightning. When an enemy is near a hand, the orb it clutches will detonate to deal lightning spell damage."] = "召唤出一片由抓握之手组成的领域，每只手都握着一枚会削弱敌人的雷电法球。当敌人靠近一只手时，其所握的法球会爆炸，造成闪电伤害。",
	["Summons three icy skull minions that explode at the end of their duration."] = "召唤一个寒冰的颅骨，在持续时间结束时爆炸。此技能有短暂冷却时间。",
	["Summons three invulnerable spectral skulls that rush at nearby enemies and attack them rapidly. Enemies will not engage these spirits, and can pass through them."] = "召唤三个不会受到伤害的幽鬼之灵快速冲向并攻击附近的敌人. 敌人无法解除幽鬼之灵, 并且可以穿过幽鬼之灵.",
	["Sun Leather"] = "日光皮甲",
	["Sun Plate"] = "日光之铠",
	["Sunblast"] = "日炎",
	["Sundance"] = "日耀",
	["Sunder"] = "大地震击",
	["Sunder has 15% reduced delay between Areas in the Wave"] = "大地震击的冲击波区域间隔延迟减慢 15%",
	["Sunder has 16% increased Area of Effect"] = "大地震击的效果区域扩大 16%",
	["Sunder has 20% reduced delay between Areas in the Wave"] = "大地震击的冲击波区域间隔延迟减慢 20%",
	["Sunder has 24% increased Area of Effect"] = "大地震击的效果区域扩大 24%",
	["Sunder has 25% increased Damage"] = "大地震击的伤害提高 25%",
