	["Supported Skills fire a Payload Arrow into the air\nProjectiles from the Supported Skill Fire from where the Payload Arrow lands"] = "被辅助技能向空中发射一支负载箭矢\n被辅助技能的投射物在负载箭矢落地时发射",
