	["Supported Skills ignore Enemy Lightning and Chaos Resistance while each Unholy Resonance is at least 25"] = "每种不洁共鸣都至少有 25 点时，被辅助技能无视敌人的闪电和混沌抗性",
	["Supported Skills ignore Enemy Physical Damage Reduction while each Unholy Resonance is at least 25"] = "每种不洁共鸣都至少有 25 点时，被辅助技能无视敌人的物理伤害减免",
