	["Supported Skills will Trigger Prismatic Burst on Hit"] = "被辅助的技能击中时触发棱光魔爆",
	["Supported Skills will Trigger Shockwave on Melee Hit"] = "被辅助技能在近战范围击中时会触发震波",
	["Supported Skills will Trigger Summon Sacred Wisps on Hit"] = "被辅助技能击中时触发召唤圣洁鬼灵",
	["Supported Skills will summon a Ballista Totem which uses that Skill"] = "被辅助技能召唤一个使用该技能的弩炮图腾",
	["Supported Skills will summon a Totem which uses that Skill"] = "被辅助技能召唤一个使用该技能的图腾",
	["Supported Skills' Projectile Attack Hits deal up to 30% more Damage to targets at the start of their movement, dealing less Damage to targets as the projectile travels farther"] = "被辅助技能的投射物刚射出时攻击击中造成的伤害总增最多 30% ，随着射出距离越远，投射物造成伤害越少",
	["Supported Spells are Triggered by Attacks Exerted by Battlemage's Cry"] = "被辅助法术是由魔武战号增助的攻击所触发",
	["Supported Spells are Triggered by Intuitive Link"] = "被辅助法术由直觉羁绊触发",
	["Supported Spells are Triggered when their Cooldowns are over"] = "被辅助法术的冷却时间结束时触发",
	["Supported Spells are Unsealed when cast, and their effects Reoccur for each Seal lost"] = "被辅助法术施放时会解除封印，每失去一个封印，该法术的效果便重复一次",
	["Supported Spells gain Intensity when you Cast them, to a maximum of 3"] = "施放被辅助法术可以获得凝聚，最大 3 层",
	["Supported Spells gain Intensity when you Cast them, to a maximum of 3\nSupported Skills fire 1 fewer Projectile per Intensity"] = "施放被辅助法术可以获得凝聚，最大 3 层\n每层凝聚使被辅助法术减少 1 枚投射物",
	["Supported Spells lose 1 Intensity every 0.5 seconds while moving, or immediately if you teleport"] = "被辅助法术在移动时每隔 0.5 秒失去 1 层凝聚，传送时会立刻失去",
	["Supported Strike Skills cannot target additional Enemies"] = "被辅助的打击技能无法以额外的敌人为目标",
	["Supported Warcries Trigger Seize the Flesh on use"] = "被辅助战吼在使用时触发攫取血肉",
	["Supported Warcries are Triggered when their Cooldowns are over"] = "被辅助战吼的冷却时间结束时触发",
	["Supported Warcries do not grant Buffs or Charges to You or Allies"] = "被辅助战吼不为你或友军提供增益或能量球",
	["Supported Warcries inflict Corrupted Blood on the first\nenemy Hit by each Attack they Exert"] = "被辅助的战吼会使其增助的每次攻击，对击中的第一个敌人施加腐化之血",
	["Supported Warcries will Trigger when their Cooldown is over"] = "被辅助战吼的冷却时间结束时触发",
	["Supported Warcries will Trigger when their Cooldown is over\nThis Skill's Mana Reservation is the total of the Mana Reservations of Supported Skills, and cannot be further modified"] = "被辅助战吼的冷却时间结束时触发\n该技能的魔力保留为被辅助技能的魔力保留的总和，并且无法被进一步修改",
	["Supported: No"] = "支持状态：否",
	["Supported: Yes"] = "支持状态：是",
	["Supports Attack Skills, causing them to trigger Windburst on hit after you've travelled a certain distance. Cannot support triggered skills or skills used by things other than you. Cannot modify the skills of minions."] = "辅助攻击类技能，使你在移动一定距离后，攻击命中时触发风爆术。无法辅助已被触发的技能，或由你之外的其他单位使用的技能。无法修改召唤物的技能。",
	["Supports Herald skills causing them to have higher critical strike chance but no buff effect."] = "辅助捷技能，使其获得更高的暴击率，但失去增益效果。",
	["Supports Projectile Spells you cast yourself. Cannot support orb skills, triggered skills, brand skills, Vaal skills, channelling skills, skills with a reservation, or skills used by things other than you."] = "辅助你亲自施放的投射物法术。无法辅助法球技能、触发类技能、烙印技能、瓦尔技能、持续吟唱技能、带保留效果的技能，或非你亲自使用的技能。",
	["Supports Skills which cause Damaging Hits, causing them to trigger Summon Living Lightning when dealing lightning damage. Cannot support skills used by totems, traps, or mines. Cannot modify the skills of Minions."] = "辅助可造成伤害击中的技能，使其在造成闪电伤害时触发召唤活体闪电。无法辅助图腾、陷阱或地雷使用的技能。不能修改召唤物的技能。",
	["Supports Slam skills. Cannot support triggered skills or skills used by things other than you."] = "辅助猛击技能。无法辅助触发技能或由除你之外的来源使用的技能。",
	["Supports Vaal skills."] = "辅助瓦尔技能。",
	["Supports Vaal spell skills, making them repeat when cast at the cost of your life and energy shield. Cannot support totem skills, channelling skills, triggered skills, instant skills, retaliation skills, blink skills, or skills with a reservation."] = "辅助瓦尔法术技能，使其在施放时重复，但代价是消耗你的生命与能量护盾。无法辅助图腾技能、持续吟唱技能、触发类技能、瞬发技能、反击技能、闪现技能或带有保留效果的技能。",
	["Supports Wand Attacks, granting them a chance to trigger Kinetic Flux on critical strike. Cannot support triggered skills or skills used by things other than you. Cannot modify the skills of minions."] = "辅助法杖攻击，使其在暴击时有一定几率触发念动紊流。无法辅助触发技能或非你本人使用的技能。无法影响召唤生物的技能。",
	["Supports Wand Attacks, granting them a chance to trigger Kinetic Flux on kill. Cannot support triggered skills or skills used by things other than you. Cannot modify the skills of minions."] = "辅助法杖攻击，使其在击败时有几率触发念动紊流。无法辅助触发类技能或非你本人使用的技能。无法影响召唤物的技能。",
	["Supports Warcries that are not triggered. Supported Warcries create Consecrated Ground, but have lowered area of effect and cooldown recovery."] = "辅助非触发的战吼技能。被辅助的战吼将生成奉献地面，但会降低效果范围与冷却回复速度。",
	["Supports any bow or wand attack skill, causing it to summon a ballista totem that uses the skill for you."] = "辅助任意弓类或法杖技能，改为召唤一个弩炮图腾，替你施放该技能。",
	["Supports any channelling skill, protecting you from damage while you channel it. Cannot modify the skills of minions."] = "辅助任何吟唱技能，在你持续吟唱时保护你。无法影响召唤生物的技能。",
	["Supports any non-blessing skill with a reservation."] = "辅助具有保留效果的非祝福技能。",
	["Supports any non-blessing skill. Minions cannot gain the Lifetap buff."] = "辅助任意非祝福技能。召唤生物不能获得赤炼效果。",
	["Supports any skill gem."] = "辅助所有技能宝石。",
	["Supports any skill gem. Once this gem reaches level 2 or above, will apply a cost & reservation multiplier to supported gems. Cannot support skills that don't come from gems."] = "辅助任意技能，当该宝石达到 2 级或以上时，对被辅助技能施加消耗和保留加成。无法辅助非技能宝石带来的技能。",
	["Supports any skill gem. Once this gem reaches level 2 or above, will raise the level of supported gems. Cannot support skills that don't come from gems."] = "辅助任意技能，当该宝石达到 2 级或以上时，提升被辅助技能的等级。无法辅助非技能宝石带来的技能。",
	["Supports any skill gem. Once this gem reaches level 2 or above, will raise the quality of supported gems. Cannot support skills that don't come from gems."] = "辅助任意技能，当该宝石达到 2 级或以上时，提升被辅助技能的品质。无法辅助非技能宝石带来的技能。",
	["Supports any skill that can chill enemies or create chilling areas."] = "辅助可使敌人冰缓或产生冰缓区域的技能。",
	["Supports any skill that can kill enemies."] = "辅助任意能击败敌人的技能。",
	["Supports any skill that deals damage or has a duration."] = "辅助任意能造成伤害或有持续时间的技能。",
	["Supports any skill that deals damage."] = "辅助任意造成伤害的技能。",
	["Supports any skill that has a duration, or can hit enemies to inflict ailments on them."] = "辅助任意有持续时间或能通过击中造成异常状态的技能。",
	["Supports any skill that has a duration."] = "辅助任意有持续时间的技能。",
	["Supports any skill that hits enemies or inflicts ailments"] = "辅助任意可以击中敌人或施加异常状态的技能",
	["Supports any skill that hits enemies, causing those hits to leech energy shield based on damage dealt."] = "辅助任意击中敌人的技能，基于击中造成的伤害偷取能量护盾。",
	["Supports any skill that hits enemies, causing those hits to leech life based on damage dealt."] = "辅助任意击中敌人的技能，基于击中造成的伤害偷取生命。",
	["Supports any skill that hits enemies, making it easier to stun enemies with those skills."] = "辅助任意击中敌人的技能，使被辅助技能更容易眩晕敌人。",
	["Supports any skill that hits enemies, making those hits penetrate enemy cold resistance."] = "辅助任意击中敌人的技能，使击中能穿透敌人的冰霜抗性。",
	["Supports any skill that hits enemies, making those hits penetrate enemy elemental resistances."] = "辅助任意击中敌人的技能，使击中能穿透敌人的元素抗性。",
	["Supports any skill that hits enemies, making those hits penetrate enemy fire resistance."] = "辅助任意击中敌人的技能，使击中能穿透敌人的火焰抗性。",
	["Supports any skill that hits enemies, making those hits penetrate enemy lightning resistance."] = "辅助任意击中敌人的技能，使击中能穿透敌人的闪电抗性。",
	["Supports any skill that hits enemies, or can deal burning damage directly."] = "辅助任意击中敌人的技能，或能直接造成燃烧伤害的技能。",
	["Supports any skill that hits enemies, or could otherwise apply elemental ailments."] = "辅助任意能击中敌人或对敌人造成元素异常状态的技能。",
	["Supports any skill that hits enemies."] = "辅助可击中敌人的技能。",
	["Supports any skill that hits enemies. If enemies are left below 10% of maximum life after being hit by these skills, they will be killed."] = "辅助任意击中敌人的技能，如果敌人在被击中后低于 10% 生命上限值则会被立即击败。",
	["Supports any skill that hits enemies. If normal or magic enemies are left below a percentage of maximum life after being hit by these skills, they will be killed."] = "辅助任何能击中敌人的技能。若普通或魔法怪物被这些技能击中后，其剩余生命值低于一定百分比，则会被直接斩杀。",
	["Supports any skill that hits enemies. Minions cannot gain Cruelty."] = "辅助任意击中敌人的技能。召唤生物无法获得凌厉。",
	["Supports any skill that hits or burns enemies, or inflicts elemental ailments."] = "辅助能击中或燃烧敌人的技能，以及能施加元素异常状态的技能。",
	["Supports any skill with a duration."] = "辅助任意有持续时间的技能。",
	["Supports any skill with an area of effect, regardless of whether that skill deals damage."] = "辅助任意有范围效果的技能，不论该技能是否造成伤害。",
	["Supports any skill with an area of effect."] = "辅助任意有范围效果的技能。",
	["Supports any skill you use to hit enemies yourself. Cannot support skills used by totems, traps, or mines."] = "辅助任意你用来击中敌人的技能。无法辅助图腾，陷阱和地雷所施放的技能。",
	["Supports any skill. Minions, Totems, Traps and Mines cannot gain Inspiration Charges."] = "辅助任意技能。召唤生物、图腾、陷阱、地雷无法获得启迪球。",
	["Supports attack skills that aren't triggered."] = "辅助并非被触发施放的攻击技能。",
	["Supports attack skills that can be used with Wands. Cannot support Vaal skills, minion skills, movement skills, or skills used by totems, traps, or mines."] = "辅助法杖可以使用的攻击技能。无法辅助瓦尔技能，召唤生物技能，位移技能或图腾，陷阱和地雷使用的技能。",
	["Supports attack skills that can be used with bows. Supported skills can only be used with bows. Cannot support Vaal skills, minion skills, movement skills, or skills used by totems, traps, or mines."] = "辅助弓类可以使用的攻击技能。被辅助的技能只能用弓才能生效。无法辅助瓦尔技能，召唤生物技能，位移技能或图腾，陷阱和地雷使用的技能。",
	["Supports attack skills that fire projectiles, making the increase to physical melee damage from strength also increase their physical projectile damage."] = "辅助发射投射物的攻击技能，使力量属性也会像提高近战物理伤害一样提高投射物物理伤害。",
	["Supports attack skills that hit enemies, causing those hits to leech mana based on damage dealt."] = "辅助击中敌人的攻击技能，基于击中造成的伤害偷取魔力。",
	["Supports attack skills that use bows or wands and fire projectiles ahead. Instead of using that skill, you will throw mines that will use the skill for you when you detonate them, targeting your location. Mines cannot use channelling skills."] = "辅助使用弓类或法杖发射投射物的攻击技能。你不再使用被辅助的技能，而是投掷地雷。引爆地雷时，地雷会对你所在的位置使用该技能。地雷无法使用吟唱技能。",
	["Supports attack skills, or other skills that can maim enemies."] = "辅助攻击技能，或其它能使敌人瘫痪的技能。",
	["Supports attack skills, or spell skills that deal damage."] = "辅助能造成伤害的攻击或法术技能。",
	["Supports attack skills, providing a bonus to all damage dealt by those skills while your life is full."] = "辅助攻击技能，当你满血时该技能造成的所有伤害提高。",
	["Supports attack skills."] = "辅助攻击技能。",
	["Supports attack skills. Cannot support skills which create minions."] = "辅助攻击技能。无法辅助召唤生物的技能。",
	["Supports attack skills. Cannot support triggered skills, skills which create minions, or skills used by totems, traps or mines."] = "辅助攻击技能。无法辅助触发技能、召唤生物技能，以及图腾、陷阱和地雷使用的技能。",
	["Supports attacks, causing them to trigger the Prismatic Burst spell. Cannot support triggered attacks or attacks used by things other than you. Cannot modify the skills of minions."] = "辅助攻击，使其触发棱光魔爆法术。不能辅助触发攻击技能或除你之外的生物使用的攻击技能。无法影响召唤生物的技能。",
	["Supports aura skills that affect you and allies, increasing the aura's effect on allies, but preventing it from affecting you at all. Cannot support curse auras, or other auras that only affect enemies. Cannot support skills used by totems. Cannot modify the skills of minions."] = "辅助影响你和友军的光环技能，提高光环对友军的效果，但使其无法作用于你。无法辅助诅咒类光环，或其他只影响敌人的光环。无法辅助图腾所施放的技能。不能调整召唤生物技能。",
	["Supports aura skills that create permanent auras around you, changing their reservation to a cost and making them temporary. Cannot support banner or stance skills."] = "辅助在你周围产生永久性效果的光环技能，将它们的保留效果变为具有消耗的暂时性效果，不能辅助旗帜技能和姿态技能。",
	["Supports aura skills that reserve life or mana to create auras around you."] = "辅助保留生命或魔力并在你周围产生光环的技能。",
	["Supports banner skills. Cannot modify the skills of minions."] = "辅助旗帜技能。无法作用于召唤生物的技能。",
	["Supports bow attack skills that fire arrows forwards as projectiles. These skills will instead fire a payload arrow into the air to land at a targeted location. The supported skills' arrows will then fire out in a circle from where it lands. Cannot support skills that already fire arrows into the air, channelled skills, or skills that create Minions."] = "辅助将箭矢像投射物一般向前发射的弓箭攻击技能。被辅助技能改为朝空中射出一支负载箭矢，落到目标地点。然后向外射出一圈箭矢。不能辅助原本就朝空中射击的技能、吟唱技能或召唤生物技能。",
	["Supports bow attack skills, causing them to trigger when you've spent enough mana in total on other bow attacks. Cannot modify the skills of minions. Cannot support totems, traps, mines, Vaal skills, or channelling skills"] = "辅助弓箭攻击技能，当你在其他弓箭攻击上花费足够魔力时触发它们。无法影响召唤生物的技能。不能辅助图腾、陷阱、地雷、瓦尔技能或吟唱技能",
	["Supports bow attack skills. Cannot support channelled skills, instant skills, Vaal skills, or skills used by totems, traps, or mines."] = "辅助弓类攻击技能。无法辅助引导技能、瞬发技能、瓦尔技能，或由图腾、陷阱、地雷使用的技能。",
	["Supports brand skills that can be recalled."] = "辅助可被召回的烙印技能。",
	["Supports channelling spells you cast yourself, significantly empowering their damage the longer they are channelled for, while also raising their cost. Cannot modify the skills of minions."] = "辅助你自己施放的持续吟唱法术，随着施法时间的提高大幅增强被辅助技能的伤害与消耗。无法修改召唤生物的技能。",
	["Supports hex curse skills, causing them to trigger Doom Blast when the hex ends. Cannot support curse skills which are triggered or applied as an aura."] = "辅助魔蛊诅咒技能，使魔蛊在结束时触发【末日爆炸】。不能辅助触发型和光环类诅咒技能。",
	["Supports hex curse skills, turning them into auras that will apply their effect to all enemies in an area around you."] = "辅助魔蛊诅咒技能，将其变为光环，并将它的效果施加给你周围的所有敌人。",
	["Supports hex curse skills."] = "辅助魔蛊诅咒技能。",
	["Supports hex curse skills. Hexes from auras or cursed ground cannot transfer."] = "辅助魔蛊诅咒技能，光环或诅咒区域的魔蛊无法被转移。",
	["Supports link skills."] = "辅助羁绊技能。",
	["Supports mark curse skills."] = "辅助印记诅咒技能。",
	["Supports melee attack skills that are not triggered."] = "辅助并非被触发施放的近战攻击技能。",
	["Supports melee attack skills which can be exerted. Cannot modify the skills of minions. Vaal skills and channelling skills cannot be exerted."] = "辅助可以被增助的近战攻击技能。无法影响召唤生物的技能。瓦尔技能和持续吟唱技能无法被增助。",
	["Supports melee attack skills without a cooldown. Those skills will be used by Mirage Warriors summoned by General's Cry. Supported skills cannot be supported by Multistrike."] = "辅助没有冷却时间的近战攻击技能。这些技能由将军战吼召唤的幻影武士使用。被辅助技能无法被多重打击辅助。",
	["Supports melee attack skills you use yourself. Cannot modify the skills of minions."] = "辅助你亲自施放的近战攻击技能。无法作用于召唤生物的技能。",
	["Supports melee attack skills, causing them to deal more damage against bleeding enemies, but preventing those skills from inflicting bleeding on enemies in any way."] = "辅助近战攻击技能，使该技能对流血敌人造成更多伤害，但该技能无法再使敌人流血。",
	["Supports melee attack skills, making them repeat three times when used, targeting a random enemy each time. Cannot support Vaal skills, channelling skills, travel skills, retaliation skills or triggered skills."] = "辅助近战攻击技能，使该技能在使用时自动重复三次，每次以一个随机的敌人为目标。无法辅助瓦尔技能、持续吟唱技能、旅行技能、反击技能或触发类技能。",
	["Supports melee attack skills, making them repeat twice when used, targeting a random enemy each time. Cannot support Vaal skills, channelling skills, travel skills, retaliation skills or triggered skills."] = "辅助近战攻击技能，使该技能在使用时自动重复两次，每次以一个随机的敌人为目标。无法辅助瓦尔技能、持续吟唱技能、旅行技能、反击技能或触发类技能。",
	["Supports melee attack skills."] = "辅助近战攻击技能。",
	["Supports melee attack skills. Cannot support skills which create minions."] = "辅助近战攻击技能。无法辅助召唤生物的技能。",
	["Supports melee attack skills. Cannot support triggered attacks, attacks used by things other than you, or skills which create minions."] = "辅助近战攻击技能，无法辅助触发攻击技能、除你之外的生物使用的攻击技能，或能够召唤生物的技能。",
	["Supports melee attack skills. Minions cannot gain rage."] = "辅助近战攻击技能。召唤生物无法获得怒火。",
	["Supports melee attacks you use yourself. Does not modify skills used by minions."] = "辅助你亲自使用的近战攻击。无法影响召唤生物使用的技能。",
	["Supports melee attacks. Does not modify skills used by minions."] = "辅助近战打击技能，无法影响召唤生物使用的技能。",
	["Supports melee strike or slam skills. Every third time you use a supported attack, that use of the skill will be more powerful."] = "辅助近战打击技能和猛击技能。被辅助技能每次施展第三次的时候都会施放强力一击.",
	["Supports melee strike skills that do not inherently apply Trauma. Cannot support triggered skills, Vaal skills, or skills used by things other than you. Cannot modify the skills of minions."] = "辅助本身不会施加内伤的近战打击技能。不能辅助触发类技能、瓦尔技能或除你之外的生物使用的技能。无法影响召唤生物的技能。",
	["Supports melee strike skills, causing their melee strike to deal splash damage around each target hit."] = "辅助近战打击技能，在每个击中的目标周围造成溅射伤害。",
	["Supports melee strike skills, causing them to also strike at extra targets simultaneously. The extra targets must be a minimum distance from the user. If supporting a minion attack skill, the minion's skills will not also strike extra targets. Cannot support Vaal skills or triggered skills."] = "辅助近战打击技能，使该技能可以同时打击额外的目标，额外目标和使用者之间必须保持最小距离。如果用来辅助召唤生物的攻击技能，则该召唤生物不会获得额外打击目标。无法辅助瓦尔技能或触发技能。",
	["Supports non-aura hex curse skills."] = "辅助非光环魔蛊诅咒技能。",
	["Supports non-blessing spells."] = "辅助非祝福法术。",
	["Supports non-instant spell skills."] = "辅助非瞬发法术技能。",
	["Supports offering skills you use yourself."] = "辅助由你亲自施放的奉献技能。",
	["Supports projectile attack skills that use bows or wands. Cannot support triggered skills, channelled skills, or skills that create Minions."] = "辅助使用弓类或法杖的投射物攻击技能。不能辅助触发技能、吟唱技能或召唤生物技能。",
	["Supports projectile attack skills."] = "辅助投射物攻击技能。",
	["Supports projectile skills, and any other skills that chain."] = "辅助投射物和其他任意能连锁的技能。",
	["Supports projectile skills, making their projectiles fork into two projectiles the first time they hit an enemy and don't pierce it."] = "辅助投射物技能，使该技能的投射物在首次击中敌人时不再穿透并分叉成 2 个。",
	["Supports projectile skills, making their projectiles fork into two projectiles the first two times they hit an enemy and don't pierce it."] = "辅助投射物技能，使它们的投射物在头两次击中敌人且未穿透时，分裂为两个。",
	["Supports projectile skills."] = "辅助投射物技能。",
	["Supports projectile spells you cast yourself. Cannot support triggered skills, Vaal skills, instant skills, channelling skills, skills with a reservation or which create minions, or skills used by totems, traps, or mines."] = "辅助你自身施放的投射物法术。无法辅助触发类技能、瓦尔技能、瞬发技能、持续吟唱技能，有保留效果或产生召唤生物技能，以及图腾、陷阱和地雷使用的技能。",
	["Supports ranged attack skills that fire projectiles upwards. Cannot support triggered attacks, attacks used by things other than you, or skills which create minions."] = "辅助向上发射投射物的远程攻击技能。无法辅助触发类攻击、非你亲自使用的攻击，或创造召唤生物的技能。",
	["Supports retaliation skills."] = "辅助反击技能。",
	["Supports skills that can hit enemies, or create minions. When those skills or minions kill enemies, or hit rare or unique enemies they will have a chance to summon a Phantasm minion, which uses a piercing projectile spell that deals physical damage."] = "辅助可以击中敌人或召唤生物的技能。当该技能或召唤生物击败敌人，或击中稀有或传奇敌人时，有一定几率召唤一个幻灵，该生物可以使用穿刺投射物法术造成物理伤害。",
	["Supports skills that create minions which can be damaged. Cannot support triggered skills."] = "辅助可创造可被伤害的召唤生物的技能。无法辅助触发类技能。",
	["Supports skills that create minions."] = "辅助召唤生物技能。",
	["Supports skills that create sentinel minions, causing those minions to be created with a beneficial templar aura."] = "辅助可创造哨兵召唤生物的技能，使这些召唤物被创造时获得圣堂光环增益效果。",
	["Supports skills that fire projectiles from the user. Does not affect projectiles fired from other locations as secondary effects. Does not support skills that fire projectiles in a spiral."] = "辅助玩家自身射出投射物的技能。不会影响其他来源或二次产生的投射物。无法辅助螺旋发射投射物的技能。",
	["Supports skills that have a cooldown. Cannot modify the skills of minions."] = "辅助有冷却时间的技能。无法作用于召唤生物的技能。",
	["Supports skills that hit enemies, causing them to gain bonuses while you have resonance of all three elements, and to grant resonance of elements other than the highest one in a hit. There is a maximum of 50 Resonance for each Element. Cannot support triggered skills, instant skills, orb skills, brands, skills with a reservation, or skills used by totems, traps, or mines. Cannot modify the skills of minions."] = "辅助击中敌人的技能，使其在你具有所有三种元素共振时获得加成，击中时除了造成最高伤害的那一个之外，给予其它元素的共振效果。每种元素的共振效果最多 50 层。不能辅助触发技能、瞬发技能、法球技能、烙印技能、有保留效果的技能，或图腾、陷阱和地雷使用的技能。无法影响召唤生物的技能。",
	["Supports skills that hit enemies, causing them to gain bonuses while you have unholy resonance of lightning, physical and chaos, and to grant unholy resonance of damage types other than the highest one in a hit. There is a maximum of 50 unholy resonance for each damage type. Cannot support triggered skills, instant skills, orb skills, brands, skills with a reservation, or skills used by totems, traps, or mines. Cannot modify the skills of minions."] = "辅助可击中敌人的技能。当你拥有闪电、物理与混沌的罪恶共鸣时，使技能获得加成；并且在一次击中，如果某伤害类型的数值并非最高，则其每次击中会为你提供该伤害类型的罪恶共鸣。每种伤害类型的罪恶共鸣最多 50 层。无法辅助触发类技能、瞬发技能、法球技能、烙印技能、带保留效果的技能，或由图腾、陷阱、地雷使用的技能。无法作用于召唤生物的技能。",
	["Supports skills that hit enemies. Cannot modify the skills of minions."] = "辅助能击中敌人的技能。无法作用于召唤生物的技能。",
	["Supports skills that summon ballista totems. Cannot modify the skills of minions."] = "辅助召唤弩炮图腾的技能。无法影响召唤生物的技能。",
	["Supports skills which create Minions."] = "辅助创造召唤生物的技能。",
	["Supports skills which create brands."] = "辅助产生烙印的技能。",
	["Supports skills which summon totems."] = "辅助召唤图腾的技能。",
	["Supports skills which summon totems. Cannot modify the skills of minions."] = "辅助召唤图腾的技能。无法影响召唤生物的技能。",
	["Supports skills which throw Traps or Mines."] = "辅助陷阱或地雷技能。",
	["Supports skills which throw mines."] = "辅助地雷技能。",
	["Supports skills which throw traps."] = "辅助陷阱技能。",
	["Supports skills with cooldowns."] = "辅助有冷却时间的技能。",
	["Supports slam skills you use yourself, causing them to create fissures when impacting the ground."] = "辅助你亲自施放的猛击技能，使其在击中地面时创造出裂隙。",
	["Supports slam skills, causing them to summon an ancestor totem that uses the skill for you while you're near it. Being near it grants you increased area of effect for melee skills."] = "辅助猛击技能，使其召唤出一个先祖图腾，在你靠近图腾的时候为你使用技能。靠近图腾还可以为你提高近战技能的效果区域。",
	["Supports slam skills, providing a powerful boost when they're used, with a delay before they can be boosted again. Cannot support Vaal skills or triggered skills. Cannot modify the skills of minions. Only skills you use yourself can receive the boost."] = "辅助猛击技能，使它们在使用时得到强力加持，在下一次得到加持前有一定延迟。不能辅助瓦尔技能或触发技能。无法影响召唤生物的技能。只有你自己施放的技能可以得到加持。",
	["Supports spell skills that apply an effect to an area around a targeted location. Cannot support Vaal skills or skills used by totems, traps, or mines. Cannot modify the skills of minions."] = "辅助对目标位置造成范围效果的法术技能。无法辅助瓦尔技能、图腾，陷阱和地雷使用的技能。无法影响召唤生物的技能。",
	["Supports spell skills that are instant and have no reservation. Cannot support Vaal skills or skills used by totems, traps or mines. Cannot modify the skills of minions."] = "辅助瞬发且没有保留效果的法术技能。无法辅助瓦尔技能，或由图腾、陷阱、地雷使用的技能。无法影响召唤生物的技能。",
	["Supports spell skills that are not triggered. Instead of casting that spell, you will summon a totem that casts the spell for you."] = "辅助非触发类法术技能，你将不再直接施放被辅助的法术，而是召唤一个图腾为你施放该法术。",
	["Supports spell skills that deal damage with hits and have no reservation. Cannot support arcane skills, Brand skills, Orb skills, Vaal skills, or skills used by totems, traps or mines. Cannot modify the skills of minions."] = "辅助造成击中伤害且无保留效果的法术技能。无法辅助奥术技能、烙印技能、法球技能、瓦尔技能，以及由图腾、陷阱或地雷使用的技能。无法作用于召唤生物的技能。",
	["Supports spell skills that have no reservation. Cannot support skills used by totems, traps or mines. Cannot modify the skills of minions."] = "辅助没有保留效果的法术技能。无法辅助由图腾、陷阱、地雷使用的技能。无法影响召唤生物的技能。",
	["Supports spell skills that hit enemies and have no reservation. Cannot support brand skills, orb skills, channelling skills, arcane skills, Vaal skills or skills used by traps or mines. Cannot modify the skills of minions."] = "辅助可以击中敌人且没有保留效果的法术技能。不能辅助烙印技能、法球技能、吟唱技能、秘术技能、瓦尔技能或地雷和陷阱使用的技能。不能调整召唤生物技能。",
	["Supports spell skills that hit enemies. Cannot modify the skills of minions."] = "辅助击中敌人的法术技能。无法作用于召唤生物的技能。",
	["Supports spell skills that you cast yourself. Cannot support triggered skills, Vaal skills, instant skills, channelling skills, skills with a reservation or which create minions, or skills used by totems, traps, or mines."] = "辅助你自身施放的法术。无法辅助触发类技能、瓦尔技能、瞬发技能、持续吟唱技能，有保留效果或产生召唤生物技能，以及图腾、陷阱和地雷使用的技能。",
	["Supports spell skills, causing them to be triggered by Intuitive Link. Cannot support skills used by totems, traps, or mines. Vaal skills, channelling skills, and skills with a reservation cannot be triggered."] = "辅助法术技能，使其由直觉链接触发。无法辅助由图腾、陷阱、地雷使用的技能。瓦尔技能、引导技能和有保留效果的技能无法被触发。",
	["Supports spell skills, causing them to be triggered. Cannot support skills used by totems, traps, or mines. Vaal skills, channelling skills, and skills with a reservation cannot be triggered."] = "辅助法术技能，使其被触发。无法辅助由图腾、陷阱、地雷使用的技能。瓦尔技能、引导技能和有保留效果的技能无法被触发。",
	["Supports spell skills, making the increase to physical melee damage from strength also increase their spell damage."] = "辅助法术技能，使力量属性也会像提高近战物理伤害一样提高法术伤害。",
	["Supports spell skills, making their effect reoccur when cast. Cannot support skills with cooldowns, triggered skills, Brand skills, Vaal skills, channelling skills, skills with a reservation, or skills used by totems, traps, or mines. Cannot modify the skills of minions."] = "辅助法术类技能，使其在施放时效果可以重复。无法辅助具有冷却时间的技能、触发类技能、烙印技能、瓦尔技能、持续吟唱技能、有保留效果的技能，或图腾、陷阱和地雷使用的技能。无法影响召唤生物的技能。",
	["Supports spell skills, making them repeat when cast. Cannot support Vaal skills, totem skills, brand skills, channelling skills, triggered skills, instant skills, retaliation skills, blink skills, or skills with a reservation."] = "辅助法术技能，使其施放时重复一次。无法辅助瓦尔技能、图腾技能、烙印技能、持续吟唱技能、触发技能、瞬发技能、反击技能、闪现技能或有保留效果的技能。",
	["Supports spell skills, making them repeat when cast. Cannot support Vaal skills, totem skills, channelling skills, triggered skills, instant skills, retaliation skills, blink skills, or skills with a reservation."] = "辅助法术技能，使其施放时自动重复一次。无法辅助瓦尔技能、图腾技能、持续吟唱技能、触发技能、瞬发技能、反击技能、闪现技能或有保留效果的技能。",
	["Supports spells skills that gain Intensity."] = "辅助可获得法术凝聚的法术技能。",
	["Supports spells that hit enemies. Cannot modify the skills of minions."] = "辅助可以击中敌人的法术技能。无法影响召唤生物的技能。",
	["Supports spells, or attacks that use bows or wands. Instead of using that skill, you will throw a mine that will use the skill for you when you detonate it. Mines cannot use channelling skills."] = "辅助法术技能，或使用弓类或法杖的攻击技能。你不再使用被辅助的技能，而是投掷地雷，当你将地雷引爆时为你使用该技能。地雷无法使用吟唱技能。",
	["Supports spells, or attacks that use bows or wands. Instead of using that skill, you will throw a trap that will use the skill for you when an enemy walks near it. Traps cannot use channelling skills."] = "辅助法术技能，或使用弓类或法杖的攻击技能。你不再使用被辅助的技能，而是投掷陷阱，当一个敌人接近时为你使用该技能。陷阱无法使用吟唱技能。",
	["Supports strike skills."] = "辅助打击技能。",
	["Supports traps skills, making them throw extra traps in a line."] = "辅助陷阱技能，使该技能在一条线上扔出额外陷阱。",
	["Supports traps skills, making them throw extra traps randomly around the targeted location."] = "辅助陷阱技能，使该技能在目标周围随机扔出额外陷阱。",
	["Supports warcry skills you use yourself."] = "辅助由你亲自施放的战吼技能。",
	["Supports warcry skills."] = "辅助战吼技能。",
	["Supports warcry skills. Cannot modify the skills of minions."] = "辅助战吼技能。无法影响召唤生物的技能。",
	["Supports warcry skills. Cannot support retaliation skills or modify the skills of minions."] = "辅助战吼技能。无法辅助反击技能，也无法影响召唤生物的技能。",
