	["Take 40% less Damage from Hits"] = "受到的击中伤害总降 40%",
	["Take 50% less Damage over Time if you've started taking Damage over Time in the past second\n100% more Duration of Ailments on you"] = "若你在过去一秒内开始受到持续伤害，则受到的持续伤害总降 50%\n你身上的异常状态持续时间总增 100%",
	["Take 500 Cold Damage on reaching Maximum Power Charges"] = "暴击球抵达上限时承受 500 冰霜伤害",
	["Take 6000 Fire Damage per Second while Flame-Touched"] = "火焰触碰时每秒受到 6000 点火焰伤害",
	["Take less Physical and Elemental Damage for a short time. Consumes up to 5 Endurance Charges to lengthen the buff and further lessen Physical Damage taken. Shares a cooldown with other Guard skills."] = "短期内受到的物理伤害和元素伤害降低。最多消耗 5 个耐力球使增益效果持续更久，并进一步降低受到的物理伤害。和防卫技能共用冷却时间。",
	["Take no Burning Damage if you've stopped taking Burning Damage Recently"] = "若你近期停止受到燃烧伤害，不会受到燃烧伤害",
