	["Teleport to a location, damaging enemies and leaving Chilled ground in an area at both ends of the teleport. Shares a cooldown with other Blink skills."] = "传送到指定地点，对敌人造成伤害，并在传送开始位置和结束位置留下冰缓地面。和其它闪现技能共用冷却时间。",
	["Teleport to a location, damaging enemies and leaving a trail of burning ground, then repeat the teleport in the other direction. Cannot be triggered, or used by a totem, trap or mine. Cannot be supported by Unleash."] = "传送到指定地点，对敌人造成伤害并在路线上留下燃烧地面。随后朝相反方向重复传送。无法被触发，无法被图腾、陷阱或地雷使用。无法被释出辅助。",
	["Teleport to a location, damaging enemies and leaving a trail of burning ground. Shares a cooldown with other Blink skills."] = "传送到指定地点，对敌人造成伤害并在路线上留下燃烧地面。和其它闪现技能共用冷却时间。",
	["Teleport to a location, damaging enemies in an area at both ends of the teleport. Deals higher damage to chilled enemies, then removes chill from them. Cannot be supported by Unleash."] = "传送到指定地点，对传送开始位置和结束位置的敌人造成伤害。对冰缓的敌人造成更高的伤害，随后移除其冰缓效果。无法被释出辅助。",
	["Teleport to a target destination. Chilled ground is spread in an area around both where the caster was and where they teleported to."] = "传送至指定目的地. 起点跟终点产生一圈冰缓地面.",
	["Teleport to the detonated Rune if you have not detonated Runes in the past 0.5 seconds"] = "若你在过去 0.5 秒内尚未引爆符纹，则传送至被引爆的符纹处",
	["Teleports the character to a nearby monster and attacks with a melee weapon. If no specific monster is targeted, one is picked at random. Grants a buff that increases movement speed for a duration. The cooldown can be bypassed by expending a Frenzy Charge."] = "传送至目标怪物身边并用近战武器对其造成伤害。若是未选定目标，则系统会为其随机指定一只怪物。获得一个增益效果，使移动速度提高一段时间。消耗一个狂怒球能重置其技能冷却。",
	["Teleports the character to a nearby monster and attacks with a melee weapon. If no specific monster is targeted, one is picked at random. Grants a buff that increases movement speed for a duration. The cooldown can be bypassed by expending a Power Charge."] = "传送至目标怪物身边并用近战武器对其造成伤害。若是未选定目标，则系统会为其随机指定一只怪物。获得一个增益效果，使移动速度提高一段时间。消耗一个暴击球能重置其技能冷却。",
	["Teleports you to a nearby enemy, applying a buff to you for a short duration and blinding the enemy for a secondary duration. Performing a melee attack with a One-Handed Weapon removes the buff to exert that attack."] = "将你传送到敌人周围，并在短时间内施加一个增益效果。施展近战攻击会移除该增益效果，并增助这次攻击。",
