	["The artist need not be present \n to make a lasting impression."] = "不需要艺术家的存在来\n留下深远的印象。",
	["The base maximum number of Spectral Tigers is 5."] = "幽虎的基础数量上限为 5。",
	["The base maximum number of Spectral Wolves is 10."] = "幽狼的基础数量上限为 10。",
	["The base maximum number of Spiders is 20."] = "蜘蛛的基础数量上限为 20。",
	["The character swings both their weapons in an arc, damaging monsters in an area in front of them. Requires dual wielding both an Axe and a Sword."] = "在身体前方以弧状同时挥动两把武器，对前方区域的怪物造成伤害。需要双持一把斧类与一把剑类武器。",
	["The character swings their weapon (or both weapons if dual wielding) in an arc, damaging monsters in an area in front of them. Killing Blows on Rare or Unique enemies grant a buff that improves Cleave for a duration. Killing Blows on Rare Enemies also steal their modifiers for a secondary duration. Only works with Axes and Swords."] = "在身体前方以弧状挥动武器（双持时则挥动两把武器），对前方区域的怪物造成伤害。消灭一个稀有或传奇敌人会给你一个增益，在一段时间内强化劈砍。消灭一个稀有敌人还能够在一段时间内窃取其词缀。限定斧类与剑类。",
	["The character swings their weapon (or both weapons if dual wielding) in an arc, damaging monsters in an area in front of them. Only works with Axes and Swords."] = "在身体前方以弧状挥动武器（双持时则挥动两把武器）, 对前方区域的怪物造成伤害。限定斧类与剑类。",
	["The character uses their fist to slam the ground in front of them, with less attack speed, but more damage. This attack deals Lightning Damage to enemies in a large area, with a chance to Shock them. Cannot be used while wielding a Weapon. Cannot be Evaded."] = "角色以拳头敲击前方的地面, 攻速较慢, 伤害较高. 该攻击能对大范围内的敌人造成闪电伤害, 并有几率对其造成感电效果. 持有武器时无法使用.",
	["The default calculation assumes enabled gems in skill socket groups fill the item in socket order disregarding gem colour."] = "默认计算假设技能组中已启用的宝石按插槽顺序填入装备，不考虑宝石颜色。",
	["The default is 1.5 times the enemy's base damage, which is the same value"] = "默认值为敌人基础伤害的 1.5 倍，与游戏内",
	["The default level for normal enemies and standard bosses is 83."] = "普通敌人及普通首领的默认等级为 83。",
	["The default level for pinnacle bosses is 84, and the default level for uber pinnacle bosses is 85."] = "巅峰首领默认等级为 84，终极巅峰首领默认等级为 85。",
	["The effect of Elusive decays over time."] = "灵巧效果随时间衰减。",
	["The enemy will automatically be considered to be Cursed if you have at least one curse enabled,"] = "启用至少一个诅咒时，会自动视为敌人受到诅咒，",
	["The enemy will automatically be considered to be Cursed if you have at least one curse enabled,\nbut you can use this option to force it if necessary."] = "启用至少一个诅咒时，会自动视为敌人受到诅咒，\n必要时可使用此选项强制启用该条件。",
	["The enemy will automatically be considered to be Unique if they are a Boss,"] = "敌人为首领时，会自动视为传奇敌人，",
	["The enemy will automatically be considered to be Unique if they are a Boss,\nbut you can use this option to force it if necessary."] = "敌人为首领时，会自动视为传奇敌人，\n必要时可使用此选项强制启用该条件。",
	["The exact weapon is unknown but should be similar to Glass Shank"] = "具体武器未知，应类似玻璃利片",
	["The first 6 Mana Burn applied to you have no effect"] = "对你施加的前 6 层魔力燃烧不产生效果",
	["The item is invalid."] = "物品无效。",
	["The magnitude of Hallowing Flame stacks applied to the enemy"] = "施加于敌人的每层圣焰强度",
	["The pain is fleeting, but victory is forever."] = "疼痛是短暂的，胜利是永恒的。",
	["The percentage of the roll range the enemy hits for"] = "敌人击中伤害在取值范围中所处的百分比位置",
	["The percentage of the roll range the enemy hits for \n eg at 100% the enemy deals its maximum damage"] = "敌人击中伤害在取值范围中所处的百分比位置\n 例如，设为 100% 时敌人造成其最大伤害",
	["The program is currently running in developer mode, which is not intended for normal use.\nIf you are not expecting this, you may have used the program from the source zip instead of using one of the installers.\nPlease reinstall using one of the installers from the 'Releases' section of the GitHub page."] = "程序当前以开发模式运行，该模式并非供日常使用。\n如果这与你的预期不符，你可能运行了源码压缩包中的程序，而不是通过安装程序安装的版本。\n请使用 GitHub 页面 Releases 区域中的安装程序重新安装。",
	["The savage path is \nalways swift and sure."] = "通往残暴的道路\n总是一往无前无法回头。",
	["The stars are aligned if you have 6 Influence types among other Equipped Items"] = "若其他装备的物品具有 6 种影响类型，群星将会罗列",
	["Their default level is capped by your character level."] = "其默认等级不超过你的角色等级。",
	["Their default level is not capped by your character level."] = "其默认等级不受你的角色等级限制。",
	["There are venoms and virtues aplenty in \n the wilds, if you know where to look."] = "荒野中充满了恶毒与美善，\n只要你知道在何处寻找。",
	["They of Tul"] = "托沃的它",
	["Thick Skin"] = "强化之肤",
