	["Thirst for Horrors"] = "颤栗之饥",
	["This Attack can be Exerted as though it was not a Vaal Skill"] = "该攻击可以如同非瓦尔技能一样被增助",
	["This Items Implicits Cannot Be Changed"] = "此物品的基底词缀无法更改",
	["This Jewel's Socket has 25% increased effect per Allocated Passive Skill between\nit and your Class' starting location"] = "从你职业的出发位置到该珠宝槽之间\n每一点配置的天赋就使该珠宝插槽的效果提高 25%",
	["This Skill Costs nothing"] = "该技能没有消耗",
