	["This Skill's Duration cannot be modified"] = "该技能的持续时间无法被更改",
	["This Skill's Mana Reservation is the total of the Mana Reservations of Supported Skills, and cannot be further modified"] = "该技能的魔力保留等于被辅助技能魔力保留的总量，不能再作更改",
	["This Spell gains Intensity when you Cast it, to a maximum of 3"] = "施放该法术时获得凝聚状态，最大 3 层",
	["This Spell is Triggered when Gained"] = "获得时触发该技能",
	["This Spell loses 1 Intensity every 0.5 seconds while moving, or immediately if you teleport"] = "该法术在移动时每隔 0.5 秒失去 1 层凝聚，传送时会立刻失去",
	["This Spell's Cast Speed cannot be modified"] = "该法术的施法速度不能被调整",
	["This Spell's Cast Time is added to its Cooldown if Triggered"] = "如果触发，该法术的施法时间将添加到其冷却时间。",
	["This Weapon's Critical Strike Chance is 100%"] = "该武器的暴击率为 100%",
	["This also applies Weeping Wounds if the Keystone is Allocated"] = "分配了对应核心天赋时，也会施加泣血创伤",
	["This also implies that the enemy is Bleeding."] = "这也表示敌人正在流血。",
	["This also implies that the enemy is Brittle."] = "这也表示敌人处于脆弱状态。",
	["This also implies that the enemy is Burning."] = "这也表示敌人正在燃烧。",
	["This also implies that the enemy is Sapped."] = "这也表示敌人处于力竭状态。",
	["This also implies that the enemy is Scorched."] = "这也表示敌人处于烧灼状态。",
	["This also implies that the enemy is Shocked."] = "这也表示敌人处于感电状态。",
	["This also implies that you Totems have Hit Recently."] = "这也表示你的图腾近期内造成过击中。",
	["This also implies that you are Burning."] = "这也表示你正在燃烧。",
	["This also implies that you are Chilled."] = "这也表示你被冰缓。",
	["This also implies that you are Poisoned."] = "这也表示你处于中毒状态。",
	["This also implies that you are Shocked."] = "这也表示你处于感电状态。",
	["This also implies that you are channelling"] = "这也表示你正在引导。",
	["This also implies that you have Blocked Recently."] = "这也表示你近期内进行过格挡。",
	["This also implies that you have Hit Recently."] = "这也表示你近期内造成过击中。",
	["This also implies that you have Killed Recently."] = "这也表示你近期内击杀过敌人。",
	["This also implies that you have Suppressed Recently."] = "这也表示你近期内压制过法术伤害。",
	["This also implies that you have a Totem summoned."] = "这也表示你已召唤图腾。",
	["This also implies that you have a Totem summoned.\nThis will affect all 'per Summoned Totem' modifiers, even for non-Totem skills."] = "这也表示你已召唤图腾。\n影响所有按召唤图腾数量生效的词缀，包括非图腾技能。",
	["This also implies that you have been Hit Recently."] = "这也表示你近期内被击中过。",
	["This also implies that you have killed and taunted recently."] = "这也表示你近期内击杀并嘲讽过敌人。",
	["This also implies that you have used a Skill Recently."] = "这也表示你近期内使用过技能。",
	["This also implies that you have used a Skill Recently.\nYou will automatically be considered to have Attacked Recently if your main skill is an attack,\nbut you can use this option to force it if necessary."] = "这也表示你近期内使用过技能。\n主技能为攻击时，自动视为近期内进行过攻击，\n必要时可使用此选项强制启用该条件。",
	["This also implies that you have used a Skill Recently.\nYou will automatically be considered to have Cast a Spell Recently if your main skill is a spell,\nbut you can use this option to force it if necessary."] = "这也表示你近期内使用过技能。\n主技能为法术时，自动视为近期内施放过法术，\n必要时可使用此选项强制启用该条件。",
	["This also implies that you have used a Skill Recently.\nYou will automatically be considered to have used a Minion skill Recently if your main skill is a Minion skill,\nbut you can use this option to force it if necessary."] = "这也表示你近期内使用过技能。\n主技能为召唤生物技能时，自动视为近期内使用过召唤生物技能，\n必要时可使用此选项强制启用该条件。",
	["This also implies that you have used a Skill Recently.\nYou will automatically be considered to have used a Movement skill Recently if your main skill is a movement skill,\nbut you can use this option to force it if necessary."] = "这也表示你近期内使用过技能。\n主技能为位移技能时，自动视为近期内使用过位移技能，\n必要时可使用此选项强制启用该条件。",
	["This also implies that you have used a Skill Recently.\nYou will automatically be considered to have used a Vaal skill Recently if your main skill is a Vaal skill,\nbut you can use this option to force it if necessary."] = "这也表示你近期内使用过技能。\n主技能为瓦尔技能时，自动视为近期内使用过瓦尔技能，\n必要时可使用此选项强制启用该条件。",
	["This also implies that you have used a Skill Recently.."] = "这也表示你近期内使用过技能。",
	["This also implies that your Minions have Killed Recently."] = "这也表示你的召唤生物近期内击杀过敌人。",
	["This also implies that your Skills have Crit Recently."] = "这也表示你的技能近期内造成过暴击。",
	["This also implies that your Totems have Killed Recently."] = "这也表示你的图腾近期内击杀过敌人。",
	["This also implies you have 'Consumed a corpse Recently'"] = "这也表示你近期内消耗过灵柩",
	["This also implies you have 'Used a Warcry Recently', 'Used a Warcry in the past 8 seconds', and 'Used a Skill Recently'"] = "这也表示你近期内使用过战吼、过去 8 秒内使用过战吼，且近期内使用过技能",
	["This applies -10% Cold Resistance to the enemy."] = "使敌人的冰霜抗性 -10%。",
	["This applies -10% Fire Resistance to the enemy."] = "使敌人的火焰抗性 -10%。",
	["This applies -10% Lightning Resistance to the enemy."] = "使敌人的闪电抗性 -10%。",
	["This attack causes three otherworldly tentacles to strike the ground around you, each dealing your attack damage in an area."] = "制造 3 条巨大的藤蔓砸向地面造成一定范围内的武器伤害。每条藤蔓造成一定范围的攻击伤害。",
	["This attack fires icy projectiles in a circle around enemies you hit, dealing attack damage with all physical damage converted to cold."] = "从被击中的敌人周围发射一圈寒冰投射物，并将造成的所有物理伤害转化为冰霜伤害。",
	["This attack is performed repeatedly by a ghostly imitation of your weapon."] = "召唤一个你所使用的武器的复制体来攻击敌人。此技能有短暂冷却时间。",
	["This attack is used by your Statues to deal damage in an area around them while stepping forward. This skill cannot repeat and can only be used by Statues from Frozen Legion."] = "此攻击由你的雕像使用，在其向前移动的同时对它们周围区域造成伤害。该技能无法重复，且只能由冰封军团召唤的雕像使用。",
	["This can be useful if transforming certain notables would break your build."] = "若转换某些核心天赋会破坏构筑，可使用此选项。",
	["This can be useful if you're never going to path towards those excluded nodes and don't care what happens to them."] = "若不打算连接到被排除的节点，也不关心这些节点的转换结果，可使用此选项。",
	["This config option is conditional with missing source and is invalid."] = "此配置选项所需的条件来源缺失，因此无效。",
	["This contains a list of your desired nodes along with their primary, secondary, and minimum weights."] = "此处列出目标节点及其主要、次要和最低权重。",
	["This contains a list of your fallback nodes along with their primary, secondary, and minimum weights."] = "此处列出备用节点及其主要、次要和最低权重。",
	["This controls the maximum amount of points that need to be spent to grab a node before its filtered out"] = "设置获取某节点允许花费的最大天赋点数，超过此值的节点将被过滤",
	["This effect will only be applied while you can inflict Brittle."] = "仅在你可以施加脆弱时应用此效果。",
	["This effect will only be applied while you can inflict Scorched."] = "仅在你可以施加烧灼时应用此效果。",
	["This enables the conditional culling strike from the mace mastery."] = "启用锤类专精中有条件的终结效果。",
	["This file contains the trade site data from https://www.pathofexile.com/api/trade/data/stats"] = "此文件保存交易网站属性数据，来源：https://www.pathofexile.com/api/trade/data/stats",
	["This is an older tree version, which may not be fully compatible with the current game version."] = "这是旧版天赋树，可能无法完全兼容当前游戏版本。",
	["This is automatically enabled if you have a flask active,"] = "拥有生效中的药剂时自动启用，",
	["This is automatically enabled if you have a flask active,\nbut you can use this option to force it if necessary."] = "拥有生效中的药剂时自动启用，\n必要时可使用此选项强制启用该条件。",
	["This is automatically enabled if you have a tincture active,"] = "拥有生效中的酊剂时自动启用，",
	["This is automatically enabled if you have a tincture active,\nbut you can use this option to force it if necessary."] = "拥有生效中的酊剂时自动启用，\n必要时可使用此选项强制启用该条件。",
	["This is for Blood Sap Tincture, but will limit you to only applying a single Bleed on the enemy"] = "此项用于血脂酊剂，但会将你对敌人施加的流血限制为单层",
	["This is for low tolerance, but will limit you to only applying poison a single time"] = "此项用于低容忍，但会限制为仅施加一次中毒",
	["This is for low tolerance, but will limit you to only applying poison a single time\n(Note that you can still apply multiple stacks via 'inflict additional poison' mods)"] = "此项用于低容忍，但会限制为仅施加一次中毒\n（仍可通过额外施加中毒的词缀施加多层中毒。）",
	["This is the average roll of an ignite affecting the enemy if you are constantly attacking"] = "持续攻击时，这是敌人所受点燃伤害的平均浮动值",
	["This item can be anointed by Cassia"] = "此物品可以由卡西亚涂油",
	["This item cannot have sockets"] = "此物品无法拥有插槽",
	["This list can be updated manually or by selecting the node you want to update via the search dropdown list and then moving the node weight sliders."] = "可手动更新此列表，也可从搜索下拉列表中选中节点，再调整节点权重滑块。",
	["This locks it at the default value"] = "此项将其锁定为默认值",
	["This multiplies the damage of a given skill in pvp, for instance any with damage multiplier specific to pvp (from skill or support or item like sire of shards)"] = "对指定技能的玩家对战伤害应用倍率，适用于技能、辅助或破碎传承者等物品提供的玩家对战专属伤害倍率",
	["This node is granted by an item. Removing it will cause no changes"] = "此天赋由物品提供。移除后属性不变",
	["This node is granted by an item. Removing it will give you:"] = "此天赋由物品提供。移除后的属性变化：",
	["This node is only in the compared build"] = "此天赋仅存在于对比构筑中",
	["This option allows you to override the default calculation for the number of Empty Blue Sockets."] = "覆盖空闲蓝色插槽数量的默认计算。",
	["This option allows you to override the default calculation for the number of Empty Blue Sockets.\nThe default calculation assumes enabled gems in skill socket groups fill the item in socket order disregarding gem colour.\nLeave blank for default calculation."] = "覆盖空闲蓝色插槽数量的默认计算。\n默认计算假设技能组中已启用的宝石按插槽顺序填入装备，不考虑宝石颜色。\n留空则使用默认计算。",
	["This option allows you to override the default calculation for the number of Empty Green Sockets."] = "覆盖空闲绿色插槽数量的默认计算。",
	["This option allows you to override the default calculation for the number of Empty Green Sockets.\nThe default calculation assumes enabled gems in skill socket groups fill the item in socket order disregarding gem colour.\nLeave blank for default calculation."] = "覆盖空闲绿色插槽数量的默认计算。\n默认计算假设技能组中已启用的宝石按插槽顺序填入装备，不考虑宝石颜色。\n留空则使用默认计算。",
	["This option allows you to override the default calculation for the number of Empty Red Sockets."] = "覆盖空闲红色插槽数量的默认计算。",
	["This option allows you to override the default calculation for the number of Empty Red Sockets.\nThe default calculation assumes enabled gems in skill socket groups fill the item in socket order disregarding gem colour.\nLeave blank for default calculation."] = "覆盖空闲红色插槽数量的默认计算。\n默认计算假设技能组中已启用的宝石按插槽顺序填入装备，不考虑宝石颜色。\n留空则使用默认计算。",
	["This option allows you to override the default calculation for the number of Empty White Sockets."] = "覆盖空闲白色插槽数量的默认计算。",
	["This option allows you to override the default calculation for the number of Empty White Sockets.\nThe default calculation assumes enabled gems in skill socket groups fill the item in socket order disregarding gem colour.\nLeave blank for default calculation."] = "覆盖空闲白色插槽数量的默认计算。\n默认计算假设技能组中已启用的宝石按插槽顺序填入装备，不考虑宝石颜色。\n留空则使用默认计算。",
	["This option enables Manastorm's Lightning Damage Buff."] = "启用魔力风暴的闪电伤害增益。",
	["This option enables Manastorm's Lightning Damage Buff.\n(When you cast a Spell, Sacrifice all Mana to gain Added Maximum Lightning Damage\nequal to 50% of Sacrificed Mana for 4 seconds)"] = "启用魔力风暴的闪电伤害增益。\n（施放法术时献祭全部魔力，获得附加最大闪电伤害，\n等同于献祭魔力的 50%，持续 4 秒）",
	["This option enables the Everlasting Sacrifice buff that grants +5% to all maximum resists."] = "启用永恒献祭增益，提供所有抗性上限 +5%。",
	["This option is specific to Arborix."] = "此项专用于阿伯瑞斯。",
	["This option is specific to Augyre."] = "此项专用于占星。",
	["This option is specific to Oni-Goroshi."] = "此项专用于鬼弑。",
	["This option is specific to Vulconus."] = "此项专用于火神锻台。",
	["This option prevents EE from being reset by the hit damage of your main skill."] = "防止主技能的击中伤害重置元素之相。",
	["This option sets the Movement Speed from Gamblesprint boots."] = "设置博运步伐长靴提供的移动速度。",
	["This option sets whether an enemy is between you and your linked target."] = "设置敌人是否位于你与你的链接目标之间。",
	["This option sets whether or not the enemy has hit you with Cold Damage in the last 4 seconds."] = "设置敌人是否在过去 4 秒内用冰霜伤害击中过你。",
	["This option sets whether or not the enemy has hit you with Fire Damage in the last 4 seconds."] = "设置敌人是否在过去 4 秒内用火焰伤害击中过你。",
	["This option sets whether or not the enemy has hit you with Lightning Damage in the last 4 seconds."] = "设置敌人是否在过去 4 秒内用闪电伤害击中过你。",
	["This option will also allow you to input the effect of Brittle."] = "同时允许输入脆弱效果。",
	["This option will also allow you to input the effect of Scorched."] = "同时允许输入烧灼效果。",
	["This overrides the default damage amount used to estimate your damage reduction from armour."] = "覆盖估算护甲伤害减免时使用的默认伤害。",
	["This overrides the default damage amount used to estimate your damage reduction from armour.\nThe default is 1.5 times the enemy's base damage, which is the same value\nused in-game to calculate the estimate shown on the character sheet."] = "覆盖估算护甲伤害减免时使用的默认伤害。\n默认值为敌人基础伤害的 1.5 倍，与游戏内\n游戏内用此方式计算角色面板显示的估算值。",
	["This overrides the default enemy level used to estimate your hit and evade chance."] = "覆盖估算命中及闪避几率时使用的默认敌人等级。",
	["This overrides the default enemy level used to estimate your hit and evade chance.\n\nThe default level for normal enemies and standard bosses is 83.\nTheir default level is capped by your character level.\n\nThe default level for pinnacle bosses is 84, and the default level for uber pinnacle bosses is 85.\nTheir default level is not capped by your character level."] = "覆盖估算命中及闪避几率时使用的默认敌人等级。\n\n普通敌人及普通首领的默认等级为 83。\n其默认等级不超过你的角色等级。\n\n巅峰首领默认等级为 84，终极巅峰首领默认等级为 85。\n其默认等级不受你的角色等级限制。",
	["This part of the hit drains the following resources:"] = "此次击中的这一部分将消耗以下资源：",
	["This setting has no effect if you have 100% chance to Defend with Double Armour."] = "以两倍护甲防御的几率达到 100% 时，此设置无效。",
	["This skill is temporarily disabled and cannot be used."] = "此技能暂时被停用，目前无法使用。",
	["This skill is triggered by supported skills to summon Sacred Wisps which use the triggering skill when you do."] = "该技能由被辅助技能触发，召唤圣洁鬼灵，在你使用技能时使用触发技能。",
	["This skill is triggered when you use a Slam or Strike skill, and summons a Mirage Chieftain who will use that Slam or Strike skill once before dissipating."] = "你使用猛击或打击技能时会触发该技能，召唤一个蜃影酋长，它在消失前会使用一次猛击或打击技能。",
	["This slider controls the weight of the following stat:"] = "此滑块控制以下属性的权重：",
	["This spell causes one of your existing Sentinels of Dominance to Ascend, becoming more powerful, gaining new attacks, and overriding its duration, while maintaining its monster modifiers and other bonuses, including from support gems. If you cannot have more Ascended Sentinels of Dominance, an existing one will be refreshed instead."] = "此法术会使你已有的一个统御哨兵将获得飞升 使其变得更加强大并获得新的技能，同时覆盖该哨兵的持续时间，并保留它的相关加成（包括来自宝石的加成）。如果你已经无法拥更多飞升的统御哨兵，那么已有的飞升哨兵将会被刷新。",
	["This spell consumes multiple cooldown uses to summon icy Statues in a ring. Each Statue uses your Frozen Sweep attack once before vanishing. Requires an Axe, Mace, Sceptre, or Staff. This skill cannot be triggered, supported by Spell Echo or Unleash, or used by Totems, Traps, or Mines."] = "此法术消耗多个冷却时间次数来召唤一圈寒冰雕像。每个雕像都会在消失前使用你的冰封横扫攻击。需要斧类、锤类、短杖或长杖。该技能不能由图腾、陷阱、地雷施放，也不能被触发或受“施法回响”和“释出”辅助。",
	["This spell consumes multiple cooldown uses to summon icy Statues in a ring. Each Statue uses your Frozen Sweep attack once before vanishing. Requires an Axe, Mace, Sceptre, or Staff. This skill cannot be triggered, supported by Spell Echo or Unleash, or used by Totems, Traps, or Mines. "] = "此法术消耗多次冷却使用次数，在周围召唤一圈冰封雕像。每个雕像在消失前使用一次你的冰封横扫攻击。需要斧、锤、短杖或长杖。此技能无法被触发，无法被施法回响或释出辅助，也无法由图腾、陷阱或地雷使用。",
	["This spell creates a swarm of ethereal blades which briefly orbit in an area around you, dealing damage every 0.6 seconds to all enemies in their radius."] = "在你的四周召唤出一群虚空的刀刃，以你为中心短暂地飞舞旋转，刀刃每隔 0.6 秒对周围敌人造成一次伤害。",
	["This spell creates ethereal blades which orbit in an area around you, dealing damage every 0.6 seconds to all enemies in their radius. As more blades are added, the damage becomes greater and more frequent."] = "在你的四周召唤出虚空的刀刃, 以你为中心不断飞舞旋转, 刀刃每隔0.6秒对周围敌人造成一次伤害. 随着刀刃的增加, 伤害也会增加.",
	["This spell deals chaos damage in an area around you. Casting this spell will cause you to gain Ruin. If this spell inflicts your seventh Ruin, it will sacrifice a large portion of your life to deal extra chaos damage based on the amount sacrificed, and remove all Ruin from you."] = "在你周围的一个区域造成混沌伤害。施放这个法术会使你获得摧灭。当你获得了 7 层摧灭时，牺牲大量生命值，造成基于牺牲量的额外混沌伤害，并移除你所有的摧灭。",
	["This spell removes some life from one of your Skeleton minions near you or the targeted location to deal chaos damage in an area around it. This effect will chain to your other nearby skeletons. If you have no skeletons near you or the targeted location, it will sacrifice your own life to deal damage instead."] = "该法术会消耗一个你或光标附近魔侍的部分生命值来对其周围造成混沌伤害. 该效果会连锁到你在附近的其他魔侍. 如果你或光标附近已没有魔侍, 则会牺牲你自己的部分生命来造成混沌伤害.",
	["This will affect all 'per Summoned Totem' modifiers, even for non-Totem skills."] = "影响所有按召唤图腾数量生效的词缀，包括非图腾技能。",
	["This will allow the skill to benefit from modifiers on the item that affect socketed gems."] = "此技能将受到该装备上影响插槽中宝石的词缀作用。",
	["This will enable the Acceleration Shrine buff."] = "启用迅速神龛。",
	["This will enable the Acceleration Shrine buff.\n\t50% increased Action Speed\n\t80% increased Projectile Speed"] = "启用迅速神龛。\n\t行动速度提高 50%\n\t投射物速度提高 80%",
	["This will enable the Adrenaline buff, which grants:"] = "启用肾上腺素增益，提供：",
	["This will enable the Adrenaline buff, which grants:\n\t100% increased Damage\n\t25% increased Attack, Cast and Movement Speed\n\t10% additional Physical Damage Reduction"] = "启用肾上腺素增益，提供：\n\t伤害提高 100%\n\t攻击、施法及移动速度提高 25%\n\t额外 10% 物理伤害减免",
	["This will enable the Alchemist's Genius buff:"] = "启用练金奇才增益，提供：",
	["This will enable the Alchemist's Genius buff:\n20% increased Flask Charges gained\n10% increased effect of Flasks"] = "启用练金奇才增益，提供：\n药剂充能获取提高 20%\n药剂效果提高 10%",
	["This will enable the Brutal Shrine buff."] = "启用狂击神龛。",
	["This will enable the Brutal Shrine buff.\n\t50% increased Damage\n\tKnocks Enemies Back on Hit\n\t30% increased Stun Duration on Enemies"] = "启用狂击神龛。\n\t伤害提高 50%\n\t击中时击退敌人\n\t敌人被晕眩的持续时间提高 30%",
	["This will enable the Chaotic Might buff on your minions."] = "为你的召唤生物启用混沌之威增益。",
	["This will enable the Chaotic Might buff on your minions.\n(Grants 30% of Physical Damage as Extra Chaos Damage)"] = "为你的召唤生物启用混沌之威增益。\n（获得等同于物理伤害 30% 的额外混沌伤害）",
	["This will enable the Chaotic Might buff."] = "启用混沌之威增益。",
	["This will enable the Chaotic Might buff.\n(Grants 30% of Physical Damage as Extra Chaos Damage)"] = "启用混沌之威增益。\n（获得等同于物理伤害 30% 的额外混沌伤害）",
	["This will enable the Diamond Shrine buff."] = "启用钻石神龛。",
	["This will enable the Diamond Shrine buff.\n\tAll hits are Critical Strikes"] = "启用钻石神龛。\n\t所有击中都造成暴击",
	["This will enable the Divine Shrine buff."] = "启用圣洁神龛。",
	["This will enable the Divine Shrine buff.\n\tCannot be Damaged"] = "启用圣洁神龛。\n\t不会受到伤害",
	["This will enable the Divinity buff, which grants:"] = "启用神性增益，提供：",
	["This will enable the Divinity buff, which grants:\n\t75% more Elemental Damage\n\t25% less Elemental Damage taken"] = "启用神性增益，提供：\n\t元素伤害总增 75%\n\t承受的元素伤害总降 25%",
	["This will enable the Echoing Shrine buff."] = "启用回响神龛。",
	["This will enable the Echoing Shrine buff.\n\t100% more Attack Speed\n\t100% more Cast Speed\n\tSkills Repeat an additional Time"] = "启用回响神龛。\n\t攻击速度总增 100%\n\t施法速度总增 100%\n\t技能额外重复一次",
	["This will enable the Fanaticism buff itself. (Grants 75% more cast speed, reduced skill cost, and increased area of effect)"] = "启用欣喜若狂增益本身（施法速度总增 75%，技能消耗降低，效果区域提高）。",
	["This will enable the Gloom Shrine buff."] = "启用隐忍神龛。",
	["This will enable the Gloom Shrine buff.\n\tGain 10% of Non-Chaos Damage as extra Chaos Damage\n\tEnemies you Kill have a 40% chance to Explode, dealing a quarter of their maximum Life as Chaos Damage"] = "启用隐忍神龛。\n\t获得等同于非混沌伤害 10% 的额外混沌伤害\n\t你击败的敌人有 40% 的几率爆炸，造成等同于其生命上限四分之一的混沌伤害",
	["This will enable the Greater Freezing Shrine buff."] = "启用高级霜寒神龛。",
	["This will enable the Greater Freezing Shrine buff.\n\tGain 30% of Physical Damage as Extra Cold Damage\n\tIce Novas happen around you"] = "启用高级霜寒神龛。\n\t获得等同于物理伤害 30% 的额外冰霜伤害\n\t在你周围产生冰霜新星",
	["This will enable the Greater Shocking Shrine buff."] = "启用高阶感电神殿效果。",
	["This will enable the Greater Shocking Shrine buff.\n\tGain 30% of Physical Damage as Extra Lightning Damage\n\tShock Novas happen around you"] = "启用高阶感电神殿效果。\n\t获得等同于物理伤害 30% 的额外闪电伤害\n\t在你周围产生闪电新星",
	["This will enable the Greater Skeletal Shrine buff."] = "启用高级魔侍神龛。",
	["This will enable the Greater Skeletal Shrine buff.\n\tGain 30% of Physical Damage as Extra Chaos Damage\n\tSkeletons are summoned to you"] = "启用高级魔侍神龛。\n\t获得等同于物理伤害 30% 的额外混沌伤害\n\t在你身边召唤魔侍",
	["This will enable the Impenetrable Shrine buff."] = "启用无畏神龛。",
	["This will enable the Impenetrable Shrine buff.\n\t100% increased Armour\n\t100% increased Evasion Rating\n\t100% increased maximum Energy Shield"] = "启用无畏神龛。\n\t护甲提高 100%\n\t闪避值提高 100%\n\t能量护盾上限提高 100%",
	["This will enable the Lesser Acceleration Shrine buff."] = "启用低阶加速神殿效果。",
	["This will enable the Lesser Acceleration Shrine buff.\n\t10% increased Action Speed\n\t30% increased Projectile Speed"] = "启用低阶加速神殿效果。\n\t行动速度提高 10%\n\t投射物速度加快 30%",
	["This will enable the Lesser Brutal Shrine buff."] = "启用低阶残暴神殿效果。",
	["This will enable the Lesser Brutal Shrine buff.\n\t20% increased Damage\n\tKnocks Enemies Back on Hit\n\t20% increased Stun Duration on Enemies"] = "启用低阶残暴神殿效果。\n\t伤害提高 20%\n\t击中时击退敌人\n\t敌人的晕眩时间延长 20%",
	["This will enable the Lesser Impenetrable Shrine buff."] = "启用低阶坚不可摧神殿效果。",
	["This will enable the Lesser Impenetrable Shrine buff.\n\t50% increased Armour\n\t50% increased Evasion Rating\n\t50% increased maximum Energy Shield"] = "启用低阶坚不可摧神殿效果。\n\t护甲提高 50%\n\t闪避值提高 50%\n\t能量护盾上限提高 50%",
	["This will enable the Lesser Massive Shrine buff."] = "启用低阶巨大神殿效果。",
	["This will enable the Lesser Massive Shrine buff.\n\t10% increased Character Size\n\t20% increased Area of Effect\n\t20% increased maximum Life"] = "启用低阶巨大神殿效果。\n\t角色体型提高 10%\n\t效果区域提高 20%\n\t生命上限提高 20%",
	["This will enable the Lesser Replenishing Shrine buff."] = "启用低阶恢复神殿效果。",
	["This will enable the Lesser Replenishing Shrine buff.\n\t100% increased Mana Regeneration Rate\n\t3.3% of Life Regenerated per second"] = "启用低阶恢复神殿效果。\n\t魔力再生率提高 100%\n\t每秒再生 3.3% 生命",
	["This will enable the Lesser Resistance Shrine buff."] = "启用低阶抗性神殿效果。",
	["This will enable the Lesser Resistance Shrine buff.\n\t+25% to all Elemental Resistances\n\t+2% to all maximum Resistances"] = "启用低阶抗性神殿效果。\n\t所有元素抗性 +25%\n\t所有抗性上限 +2%",
	["This will enable the Massive Shrine buff."] = "启用威猛神龛。",
	["This will enable the Massive Shrine buff.\n\t30% increased Character Size\n\t40% increased Area of Effect\n\t40% increased maximum Life"] = "启用威猛神龛。\n\t角色体型提高 30%\n\t效果区域提高 40%\n\t生命上限提高 40%",
	["This will enable the Replenishing Shrine buff."] = "启用回复神龛。",
	["This will enable the Replenishing Shrine buff.\n\t200% increased Mana Regeneration Rate\n\t6.7% of Life Regenerated per second"] = "启用回复神龛。\n\t魔力再生率提高 200%\n\t每秒再生 6.7% 生命",
	["This will enable the Resistance Shrine buff."] = "启用抗性神龛。",
	["This will enable the Resistance Shrine buff.\n\t+50% to all Elemental Resistances\n\t+10% to all maximum Resistances"] = "启用抗性神龛。\n\t所有元素抗性 +50%\n\t所有抗性上限 +10%",
	["This will enable the Resonating Shrine buff."] = "启用共鸣神龛。",
	["This will enable the Resonating Shrine buff.\n\t20% chance to gain a Power, Frenzy or Endurance Charge on Hit\n\t60% chance to gain a Power, Frenzy or Endurance Charge on Kill\n\t+1 to Maximum Power Charges\n\t+1 to Maximum Frenzy Charges\n\t+1 to Maximum Endurance Charges"] = "启用共鸣神龛。\n\t击中时有 20% 的几率获得一个暴击球、狂怒球或耐力球\n\t击败敌人时有 60% 的几率获得一个暴击球、狂怒球或耐力球\n\t暴击球数量上限 +1\n\t狂怒球数量上限 +1\n\t耐力球数量上限 +1",
	["This will enable the Sacrificial Zeal buff."] = "启用热情牺牲增益。",
	["This will enable the Sacrificial Zeal buff.\n(Grants 25% of the skill's mana cost as Physical Damage and causes you to take physical damage over time equal to a percentage of the skill's mana cost.)"] = "启用热情牺牲增益。\n（获得等同于技能魔力消耗 25% 的物理伤害，并使你受到等同于技能魔力消耗一定比例的持续物理伤害。）",
	["This will enable the Unholy Might buff on your minions."] = "为你的召唤生物启用不洁之力增益。",
	["This will enable the Unholy Might buff on your minions.\n(Grants 100% of Physical Damage converted to Chaos Damage)\n(25% chance to apply Wither on Hit)"] = "为你的召唤生物启用不洁之力增益。\n（将物理伤害的 100% 转化为混沌伤害）\n（击中时有 25% 的几率施加凋零）",
	["This will enable the Unholy Might buff."] = "启用不洁之力增益。",
	["This will enable the Unholy Might buff.\n(Grants 100% of Physical Damage converted to Chaos Damage)\n(25% chance to apply Wither on Hit)"] = "启用不洁之力增益。\n（将物理伤害的 100% 转化为混沌伤害）\n（击中时有 25% 的几率施加凋零）",
	["This will override the number of Mines per throw"] = "覆盖每次投掷的地雷数量",
	["This will override the number of Traps per throw"] = "覆盖每次投掷的陷阱数量",
	["Thorium Spirit Shield"] = "暗金魔盾",
	["Thorn Rapier"] = "棘刺细剑",
	["Thorned Shrine"] = "荆棘神龛",
	["Thorned Vines"] = "荆棘蔓藤",
	["Thorny"] = "多刺的",
	["Thousand Ribbons"] = "千缎",
	["Thousand Teeth Temu"] = "千齿",
	["Thousands separator:"] = "千位分隔符：",
	["Thread of Hope"] = "希望之线",
	["Three Faces in the Dark"] = "黑暗三面",
	["Three Hands Talisman"] = "三手魔符",
	["Three Rat Talisman"] = "三鼠魔符",
	["Three-step Assault"] = "强袭者",
	["Thresher Claw"] = "撕裂尖爪",
	["Thrill Killer"] = "颤栗打击者",
	["Thrill of Battle"] = "鏖战热血",
	["Thrillsteel"] = "惊险刺激",
	["Throat Stabber"] = "刺喉刃",
	["Throatseeker"] = "割战者",
	["Throw up to 1 additional Trap if dual wielding"] = "双持时最多额外投掷 1 个陷阱",
	["Throwing rate"] = "投掷速率",
	["Throwing time"] = "投掷间隔",
	["Throws a bottle that explodes to deal unarmed attack damage in an area and has a chance to poison. Can consume charges from a Life flask to add further damage. Requires an empty main hand, and no off-hand weapon."] = "投掷一个爆炸瓶，在一片区域内造成徒手攻击伤害，并有几率使敌人中毒。可以消耗生命药剂的充能来进一步增加伤害。需要空出主手，且没有持握副手武器。",
	["Throws a bottle that explodes to deal unarmed attack damage in an area. Can consume charges from your Ruby, Sapphire, and Topaz flasks to add further damage. Requires an empty main hand, and no off-hand weapon."] = "投掷一个爆炸瓶，在一片区域内造成徒手攻击伤害。可以消耗红玉药剂、黄玉药剂、蓝玉药剂的充能来进一步增加伤害。需要空出主手，也不能持握副手武器。",
	["Throws a mine that deals damage in an area when detonated, then launches fiery projectiles that rain down around it, each exploding to deal damage in a smaller area. Placed mines apply a fire exposure aura to nearby enemies."] = "投掷一个地雷，引爆时对一片区域造成伤害，然后发射火焰投射物，在其周围像雨点一样散落，每颗投射物都会小范围的爆炸。放置在地上的地雷，会对其范围内的敌人施加火焰曝露效果。",
	["Throws a mine that deals damage in an area when detonated."] = "投掷一个地雷，引爆时对一片区域造成伤害。",
	["Throws a mine that fires projectiles around it when detonated. These projectiles quickly dissipate as they travel, before disappearing."] = "投掷一个地雷，引爆时向周围发射投射物，在飞行途中快速挥发，并很快消失。",
	["Throws a mine that fires projectiles at enemies when detonated. These projectiles quickly dissipate as they travel, before disappearing."] = "投掷一个地雷，引爆时向敌人发射投射物，在飞行途中快速消散，并很快消失。",
	["Throws a mine that will teleport you to it when detonated. It covers both your escape and arrival with a cloud of smoke that blinds enemies, and gives you a temporary buff to movement speed. Shares a cooldown with other Blink skills."] = "投掷一个地雷，当它引爆时将你传送至该地雷所在处。当传送时，在原本位置与地雷所在位置的区块都会被充满烟雾，致盲其中的敌人，并给你一个提高移动速度的临时增益效果。和其它闪现技能共用冷却时间。",
	["Throws a single bottle that releases a burst when it hits the ground, dealing unarmed attack damage in an area with a chance to poison. The skill chains, bouncing randomly to deal damage multiple times. Can consume charges from a Life flask to add further damage. Requires an empty main hand, and no off-hand weapon."] = "投掷一个爆炸瓶，击中地面时爆发，在一片区域内造成徒手攻击伤害，并有几率使敌人中毒。该技能可以连锁，多次随机弹跳并造成伤害。可以消耗生命药剂的充能来进一步增加伤害。需要空出主手，且没有持握副手武器。",
	["Throws a spectral copy of your melee weapon. It flies out and then returns to you, in a spinning attack that damages enemies in its path."] = "复制手中的近战武器，并将此灵体投掷出去。此灵体将会向外飞出并如同回力镖一般回到你的身边，对所有碰触到的敌人造成伤害。",
	["Throws a spectral copy of your melee weapon. It spins around while flying in a large spiral, damaging enemies in its path, and bouncing if it collides with walls."] = "复制一把手中的近战武器并投掷出去。它会盘旋飞出，形成一个巨大的螺旋，对路径上所有敌人造成伤害。如果碰到墙壁会回弹。",
	["Throws a spectral copy of your shield as a piercing projectile which deals off-hand damage augmented by the defences of the shield. When it reaches the targeted location it will hover in place, repeatedly firing a number of smaller shards as projectiles in all directions. The rate at which it releases shards will increase until all shards have been fired. Modifiers that cause additional projectiles to be fired will add more shards, not more copies of the shield."] = "使用念能力复制副手上的盾并且掷出穿刺投射物，造成盾牌防御属性强化的副手伤害。抵达目标位置时悬停在原地，向各个方向重复发射一定数量的小型碎片投射物。碎片发射速度不断加快，直到碎片发射完毕。影响投射物数量的词缀碎会增加碎片的数量，但不会增加投掷盾的数量。",
	["Throws a spectral copy of your shield as a projectile which cannot pierce, and deals off-hand damage augmented by the defences of the shield. When it collides with something it will shatter, launching a number of smaller shards as projectiles in all directions. Modifiers that cause additional projectiles to be fired will add more shards, not more copies of the shield."] = "使用念能力复制副手上的盾并且掷出制造出根据盾防御属性的副手伤害。该投射物无法穿透敌人，当击中敌人时，该投射物会碎裂，制造出射向各方的小的碎片投射物。影响投射物数量的词缀会增加碎片的数量，但不会增加投掷盾的数量。",
	["Throws a spectral copy of your shield as a projectile which cannot pierce, and deals off-hand damage augmented by the evasion of the shield. When it collides with something it will shatter, launching a number of smaller shards as projectiles in all directions. Modifiers that cause additional projectiles to be fired will add more shards, not more copies of the shield."] = "使用念能力复制副手上的盾并且掷出，根据盾的闪避值属性造成副手伤害。该投射物无法穿透敌人，当击中敌人时，该投射物会碎裂，制造出射向各方的小的碎片投射物。影响投射物数量的词缀会增加碎片的数量，但不会增加投掷盾的数量。",
	["Throws a trap that applies debuff beams to a number of nearby enemies for a duration. The beams chill enemies and deal cold damage over time."] = "投掷陷阱，在一定时间内对周围一定数量的敌人发射带有减益效果的光线。光线会冰缓敌人，并造成持续性冰霜伤害。",
	["Throws a trap that applies debuff beams to a number of nearby enemies for a duration. The beams chill enemies and deal cold damage over time. A beam is also applied to you, granting life and mana regeneration based on the number of debuff beams affecting enemies."] = "投掷陷阱，在一定时间内对周围一定数量的敌人发射带有减益效果的光线。光线会冰缓敌人，并造成持续性冰霜伤害。光线也会基于被其射中的敌人数量，来使你获得一定额度的生命和魔力再生。",
	["Throws a trap that creates a large explosion when triggered, dealing spell damage in an area around it."] = "投掷陷阱，触发后造成一场大爆炸，在周围区域内造成法术伤害。",
	["Throws a trap that creates a series of icy runic explosions in a circle around itself when triggered, dealing cold damage to all enemies caught in the blasts."] = "抛出一个触发时在其周围制造一圈冰霜印记爆破的陷阱，对所有在爆破范围内的敌人造成冰霜伤害。",
	["Throws a trap that creates a series of icy runic explosions when triggered, dealing cold damage to all enemies caught in the blasts."] = "抛出一个触发时会制造一连串冰霜印记爆破的陷阱, 对所有在爆破范围内的敌人造成冰霜伤害.",
	["Throws a trap that creates an explosion when triggered, dealing spell damage in an area around it. A number of smaller explosions occur within a secondary area around the trap in quick succession after the first."] = "投掷陷阱，触发后造成一场爆炸，在周围区域内造成法术伤害。第一次爆炸后陷阱周围的次级区域内会连续快速产生多次小爆炸。",
	["Throws a trap that damages and immobilises a single enemy for a duration based on how much damage was dealt. After the immobilise expires, a debuff remains on the enemy for a duration, lowering their movement speed by an amount which lessens over time. The affected enemy will take increased damage from traps and mines until the debuff expires. Modifiers to spell damage do not affect this skill's damage."] = "投掷一个陷阱，对单个敌人造成伤害并使其定身，定身时长由造成的伤害决定。定身结束后，敌人将承受一个移动速度降低的减益效果。被该减益影响的敌人承受陷阱和地雷的伤害会提高。法术伤害加成不会影响该技能。",
	["Throws a trap that damages and impales a single enemy, and immobilises them for a duration based on how much damage was dealt. Modifiers to spell damage do not affect this skill's damage."] = "投掷一个陷阱，对单个敌人造成伤害、穿刺与定身，定身时长由造成的伤害决定。法术伤害加成不会影响该技能。",
	["Throws a trap that explodes when triggered, dealing fire damage to surrounding enemies and leaving an area of burning ground that damages enemies who walk through it."] = "投掷一个陷阱, 该陷阱被触发时会爆炸并对周围的敌人造成火焰伤害, 且该区域的地面会持续燃烧, 踩在上面的敌人会持续受到伤害.",
	["Throws a trap that explodes when triggered, dealing fire damage to surrounding enemies."] = "投掷一个陷阱，该陷阱被触发时会爆炸并对周围的敌人造成火焰伤害。",
	["Throws a trap that launches a ring of projectiles through the enemy that set it off, dealing lightning damage to them and subsequent targets and leaving a trail of shocked ground."] = "投掷一个陷阱，该陷阱被敌人触发时向四面环状发射投射物，对该敌人和后续接触到的敌人造成闪电伤害，并同时留下感电地面。",
	["Throws a trap that launches a ring of projectiles through the enemy that set it off, dealing lightning damage to them and subsequent targets."] = "投掷一个陷阱, 该陷阱被触发时将会向全方位散射出闪电投射物, 投射物将会对触发及接触到的敌人造成闪电伤害.",
	["Throws a trap that launches projectiles through the enemy that set it off, dealing lightning damage to them and subsequent targets."] = "投掷一个陷阱，该陷阱被触发时将会散射出闪电投射物，投射物将会对触发及接触到的敌人造成闪电伤害。",
	["Throws a trap that releases a number of flames in different directions around it when triggered. The flames last for a duration repeatedly dealing damage."] = "投掷陷阱，触发后向不同方向喷射烈焰。烈焰将持续一段时间，并重复造成伤害。",
	["Throws a trap that releases a number of flames in different directions around it when triggered. The flames last for a duration, rotating around the trap and repeatedly dealing damage. Burning enemies are dealt more damage."] = "投掷陷阱，触发后向不同方向喷射烈焰。烈焰持续一段时间，会在陷阱周围旋转，并重复造成伤害。对燃烧的敌人造成更多伤害。",
	["Throws a trap that, when triggered by an enemy, converts that enemy to your side for a short duration. Does not affect unique monsters or players."] = "投掷一个陷阱, 触发该陷阱的敌人将会短暂的转化为你的手下为你而战.",
	["Throws a trap which, once triggered, fires a spectral copy of your melee weapon. It spins around while flying in a large spiral, damaging enemies in its path, and bouncing if it collides with walls. If dual wielding, each Trap thrown will randomly use either the main hand or off hand weapon."] = "投掷一个陷阱，触发时发射一个近战武器的灵幻副本。它会盘旋飞出，形成一个巨大的螺旋，对路径上所有敌人造成伤害。如果碰到墙壁会回弹。双持时每个投掷的陷阱会随机使用主手或副手武器。",
	["Throws a trap which, once triggered, fires many spectral copies of your melee weapon. They fly out in all directions and then return to where the trap triggered, in a spinning attack that damages enemies in their path. If dual wielding, each Trap thrown will randomly use either the main hand or off hand weapon."] = "投掷一个陷阱，触发时发射多个近战武器的灵幻副本。它们向四面八方飞出后返回陷阱触发点，以回旋形式攻击并对沿途路径上的敌人造成伤害。双持时每个投掷的陷阱会随机使用主手或副手武器。",
	["Throws a trap which, once triggered, releases a number of waves. Each wave deals damage in a series of small bursts in a line, ending with a larger burst."] = "投掷陷阱，触发后发射多股冲击波。每股冲击波都会在其行进线路上产生连续的小冲击，最后以一次大冲击结束。",
	["Throws a trap which, once triggered, repeatedly releases a number of waves for a duration. Each wave deals damage in a series of small bursts in a line, ending with a larger burst."] = "投掷陷阱，触发后会在一定时间内持续发射冲击波。每股冲击波都会在其行进线路上产生连续的小冲击，最后以一次大冲击结束。",
	["Throws a trap which, once triggered, swings two copies of your equipped Dagger, Claw or One Handed Sword around it in circles, each repeatedly damaging enemies it spins through."] = "投掷一个陷阱，触发时旋转挥舞你装备的两把匕首、爪类或单手剑的副本，反复不断对它范围内的敌人造成伤害。",
	["Throws a trap which, once triggered, swings two copies of your equipped Dagger, Claw, One Handed Sword or One Handed Axe around it in a circle, each damaging enemies it spins through."] = "投掷一个陷阱，触发时旋转挥舞你装备的两把匕首、爪类、单手剑或单手斧的副本，对它范围内的敌人造成伤害。",
	["Throws a trap which, once triggered, swings two copies of your equipped Two Handed Sword around it in circles for a duration, each repeatedly damaging enemies it spins through"] = "投掷一个陷阱，触发时旋转挥舞你装备的两把双手剑的副本，反复不断对它范围内的敌人造成伤害，持续一定时间。",
	["Throws a trap which, once triggered, will repeatedly strike multiple areas around it for a duration, dealing lightning damage."] = "投掷陷阱，触发后会在一定时间内连续电击多个区域，并造成闪电伤害。",
	["Throws an intangible spectral copy of your melee weapon. It flies out and then becomes tangible as it returns to you, in a spinning attack that only hits and damages enemies while returning."] = "复制手中的近战武器，并将此无形灵体投掷出去。此灵体将会向外飞出，并在归返时化为实体，仅能在返回时击中敌人并造成伤害。",
	["Throws chains ahead of you, attaching them to targets hit. Enemies chained to you will grant rage when hit. When chains are broken, they snap and deal attack damage in an area around the target they were attached to. Requires a One Handed Mace, Sceptre, Sword or Axe."] = "向你的前方投掷连锁钩爪，附着在命中的目标上。被束缚的敌人受到攻击时为施法者提供怒火。当锁链断裂时，会在束缚目标周围区域造成攻击伤害。限定单手锤、短杖、剑类或斧类。",
	["Throws out a trap which creates a rift, attracting a malefic hand from another realm. When the trap is triggered, the hand tears the bottom of the breach out, shattering reality to deal spell damage in an area."] = "投掷一个陷阱, 该陷阱会创造一个裂隙，并从异界吸引来一只恶魔之手。当陷阱被触发时，这只手会撕裂裂隙的底部，粉碎现实，在一个区域内造成法术伤害。",
	["Throws several spectral copies of your melee weapon. They fly out and then return to you, in a spinning attack that damages enemies in their path."] = "复制数把手中的近战武器，把它们投掷出去。它们飞出后会以回旋形式返回，伤害沿途路径上的敌人。",
	["Thrust an Axe or Sword forward to form a cluster of shards in front of you. The cluster will fire a number of projectiles in sequence, aiming at enemies in front of or close to it."] = "向前投掷一把剑或斧头，在前方凝聚一团剑刃。它会依次对前方或靠近它的敌人发射投射物。",
	["Thrust an Axe or Sword forward, consuming your Steel Shards to form a cluster of shards in front of you. The cluster will fire a number of projectiles in sequence, aiming at enemies in front of or close to it. Steel Shards are gained with the Call of Steel Skill."] = "向前投掷一把剑或斧头，消耗钢刃碎片在前方凝聚一团剑刃。它会依次对前方或靠近它的敌人发射投射物。钢刃碎片由【钢铁呼唤】提供。",
