	["Unleash a beam of fire that burns enemies it touches. Remaining in the beam raises the burning, adding a portion of the beam's damage in stages. Enemies who leave the beam continue to burn for a duration. Increasing cast speed also increases the rate at which the beam turns."] = "发出一束灼热光线，被击中的敌人会受到不断叠加的燃烧效果。每叠加一层效果都会附加一定比例的光线基础伤害。脱离光线范围后的一段时间内依然会受到燃烧伤害。增加施法速度可以加快光线的转角速度。",
	["Unleash a beam of fire that burns enemies it touches. Remaining in the beam raises the burning, adding a portion of the beam's damage in stages. Inflicts Fire Exposure at maximum stages. Enemies who leave the beam continue to burn for a duration. Increasing cast speed also increases the rate at which the beam turns."] = "发出一束灼热光线，被击中的敌人会受到不断叠加的燃烧效果。每叠加一层效果都会附加一定比例的光线基础伤害。叠满之后会造成火焰曝露。脱离光线范围后的一段时间内依然会受到燃烧伤害。增加施法速度可以加快光线的转角速度。",
	["Unleash orbs of energy while you channel that repeatedly jump away from the targeted location until their duration expires, dealing damage in a small area after each jump. When you stop channelling, all remaining orbs explode, dealing higher damage in a larger area."] = "在你持续吟唱时，创造多个能量球，并不断跳离目标区域，直到持续时间消失，每一跳都会对小范围内造成伤害。当你停止吟唱，所有剩余的能量球会爆炸，对更大范围造成更高伤害。",
	["Unleash orbs of energy while you channel that repeatedly jump towards the targeted location until their duration expires, dealing damage in a small area after each jump. When you stop channelling, all remaining orbs explode, dealing higher damage in a larger area."] = "在你持续吟唱时，创造多个能量球，并不断跳向目标区域，直到持续时间消失，每一跳都会对小范围内造成伤害。当你停止吟唱，所有剩余的能量球会爆炸，对更大范围造成更高伤害。",
	["Unleashed"] = "释放的",
	["Unleashed Potential"] = "释放潜能",
	["Unleashes a ball of fire towards a target which explodes, damaging nearby foes."] = "释放一颗球型火焰向前飞射, 接触到怪物时会爆炸并对周围敌人造成伤害",
	["Unleashes a vile contagion on enemies, dealing chaos damage over time. If an enemy dies while affected by Contagion, the debuff spreads to other enemies, but each time it spreads, it only deals three quarters as much damage as before."] = "对你的敌人造成持续的混沌伤害。受到瘟疫影响的敌人被击败时，其减益效果将会传染到周边敌人的身上，每次传播造成的伤害为原先的四分之三。",
	["Unleashes a vile contagion on enemies, dealing chaos damage over time. If an enemy dies while affected by Contagion, the debuff spreads to other enemies."] = "对你的敌人造成持续的混沌伤害。受到瘟疫影响的敌人被击败时，其减益效果将会传染到周边敌人的身上。",
	["Unleashes a vile contagion on enemies, dealing chaos damage over time. If an enemy is hit while affected by Contagion, the debuff spreads to other enemies."] = "对你的敌人造成持续的混沌伤害。受到瘟疫影响的敌人被击中时，其减益效果将会传染到周边敌人的身上。",
