	["Wave your wand to create a hovering kinetic projectile. After a short duration, the projectile is fired at an enemy, dealing area damage on impact and chaining to further targets. Using this attack again will reset the duration for all hovering projectiles. Multiple projectiles fired in sequence will attempt to target different enemies. Cannot be directly used by traps or mines."] = "挥舞法杖创造一枚悬停的动能投射物，短暂延迟后，投射物将自动射向一名敌人，在撞击时造成范围伤害并连锁至更多目标。再次使用此技能将为所有悬停投射物重置持续时间。连续发射的多个投射物会自动选择不同敌人作为目标。无法被陷阱或地雷直接使用。",
	["Wave your wand to create multiple hovering kinetic projectiles. After a short duration, the projectiles explode, dealing area damage. Using this attack again will reset the duration for all hovering projectiles. Cannot be directly used by traps or mines."] = "挥动你的法杖，创造多个悬浮的动能投射物。在短暂延迟后，这些投射物会爆炸，造成范围伤害。再次使用该攻击会重置所有悬浮投射物的持续时间。无法被陷阱或地雷直接使用。",
