	["Weighted Sum searches will always sort using descending weighted sum\nAdditional post filtering options can be done these include:\nHighest Stat Value - Sort from highest to lowest Stat Value change of equipping item\nHighest Stat Value / Price - Sorts from highest to lowest by estimated Stat Value per currency\nLowest Price - Sorts from lowest to highest price of retrieved items\nHighest Weight - Displays the order retrieved from trade"] = "加权总分搜索始终按加权总分降序排列。\n还可对结果进行以下后续排序：\n最高属性评分：按装备物品带来的属性评分变化，从高到低排列。\n最高属性评分／价格：按每单位通货对应的预计属性评分，从高到低排列。\n最低价格：按搜索到的物品价格，从低到高排列。\n最高权重：保留交易网站返回的顺序。",
	["Wellwater Phylactery"] = "井水灵器",
	["Wereclaw Talisman"] = "亡爪魔符",
	["Whakatutuki o Matua"] = "瓦卡图图里",
	["Whalebone Rapier"] = "鲸骨细刃",
	["What need have I for defence when my enemies"] = "当我的敌人已化为灰烬与碎骨时",
	["Wheel of the Stormsail"] = "暴雨之舵",
	["When 90% of your Hex's Duration Expires on an Enemy, Eat 1 Soul per Enemy Power"] = "当你在敌人身上的魔蛊持续时间消减 90% 后，每一点敌人威力值使你吞噬 1 个灵魂",
	["When Channelling Empowered Spells ends, this Skill Triggers again for every\ntime it was Triggered while Channelling"] = "引导强化法术结束时，此技能按其引导期间已触发次数再次触发",
	["When Hit during effect, 25% of Life loss from Damage taken occurs over 4 seconds instead"] = "效果持续期间受到击中伤害，则生命损失的 25% 会改为在 4 秒内逐渐丧失",
	["When Hit, gain a random Movement Speed modifier from 20% reduced to 50% increased, until Hit again"] = "被击中时获得从降低 20% 至提高 50% 之间的随机移动速度修正，直到被再次击中",
	["When Hit, gain a random Movement Speed modifier from 40% reduced to 100% increased, until Hit again"] = "被击中时获得从降低 40% 至提高 100% 之间的随机移动速度修正，直到被再次击中",
	["When a nearby Minion dies, gain Rotten Bulwark equal to (7-9)% of its maximum Life"] = "周围的一个召唤生物死亡时，获得等同于其最大生命值 (7-9)% 的腐朽壁垒",
	["When an Enemy Hit deals Elemental Damage to you, their Resistance to those Elements becomes zero for 4 seconds"] = "当敌人对你造成元素伤害时，使其对应元素抗性变为零，持续 4 秒",
	["When bound by faith\n and respect, the flock\n will overwhelm the wolf."] = "以忠诚和尊敬连接，\n连狼群也被制伏的团结。",
	["When enabled, the mana spent by Arcane Cloak used at full mana"] = "启用后，满魔力时使用奥术斗篷消耗的魔力",
	["When enabled, the mana spent by Arcane Cloak used at full mana \nwill be added to the value provided in # of Mana spent Recently."] = "启用后，满魔力时使用奥术斗篷消耗的魔力\n会加至“近期内消耗的魔力”所填数值。",
	["When hit, release a nova of fiery vengeance, dealing spell fire damage and blinding enemies struck."] = "被击中时，释放炽焰复仇新星，对被击中的敌人造成火焰伤害并使其致盲。",
	["When hit, release a nova of venomous bile that deals spell chaos damage. This nova poisons and hinders on hit."] = "当你被击中时，释放毒液胆汁新星，造成法术混沌伤害。该新星在命中时会使敌人中毒并造成缓速。",
	["When used at range, throws out a chain, pulling you to the enemy hit dealing damage in an area behind them. When close to the enemy, just causes the area damage directly. Requires a One Handed Mace, Sceptre, Sword or Axe."] = "远程使用时，会投掷一条锁链，将你拉近被击中的敌人，并对它们身后一片区域内造成伤害。如果贴近敌人使用，则只会直接造成范围伤害。限定单手锤、短杖、剑类或斧类。",
	["When used in the Synthesiser, the new item will have an additional Herald Modifier"] = "在忆境之台上使用时，新物品获得一个额外的捷属性",
	["When winning is all that matters, you'll use everything at your disposal."] = "当胜利成为唯一的指望，你就会放手一搏。",
	["When you Attack, take (15-20)% of Life as Physical Damage for\neach Warcry Exerting the Attack"] = "攻击时，每有一个増助的战吼，\n便受到相当于生命值(15-20)%的物理伤害",
	["When you Cast a Spell, Sacrifice all Mana to gain Added Maximum Lightning Damage\nequal to 25% of Sacrificed Mana for 4 seconds"] = "当你施放法术时，献祭所有魔力，获得等同于献祭魔力 25% 的附加最大闪电伤害，持续 4 秒",
	["When you Cast a Spell, Sacrifice all Mana to gain Added Maximum Lightning Damage\nequal to 50% of Sacrificed Mana for 4 seconds"] = "当你施放法术时，献祭所有魔力，获得等同于献祭魔力 50% 的附加最大闪电伤害，持续 4 秒",
	["When you Hit an Enemy with an Arrow from a Supported Skill, Summon a Mirage Archer which uses that Skill"] = "当你用被辅助技能发射的箭矢击中敌人时，召唤 1 个会使用此技能的幻影弓手",
	["When you Hit an Enemy with an Arrow from a Supported Skill, Summon a Mirage Archer which uses that Skill\nMirage Archer can use Triggered Attacks as though they were not Triggered"] = "当你用被辅助技能发射的箭矢击中敌人时，召唤 1 个会使用此技能的幻影弓手\n幻影弓手可以使用触发攻击，并视作没有触发",
	["When you Kill a Rare Monster, (15-20)% chance to gain one of its Modifiers for 10 seconds"] = "当你击败稀有怪物时，有 (15-20)% 的几率获得该怪物的一种属性修正 10 秒",
	["When you Kill a Rare Monster, (21-30)% chance to gain one of its Modifiers for 10 seconds"] = "当你击败稀有怪物时，有 (21-30)% 的几率获得该怪物的一种属性修正 10 秒",
	["When you Kill a Rare Monster, (31-40)% chance to gain one of its Modifiers for 10 seconds"] = "当你击败稀有怪物时，有 (31-40)% 的几率获得该怪物的一种属性修正 10 秒",
	["When you Kill an Enemy Cursed with a Non-Aura Hex, become Immune to"] = "当你消灭一个被非光环魔蛊诅咒的敌人时，在魔蛊剩余",
	["When you Kill an Enemy Cursed with a Non-Aura Hex, become Immune to\nCurses for remaining Hex Duration"] = "当你消灭一个被非光环魔蛊诅咒的敌人时，在魔蛊剩余\n的持续时间中免疫诅咒",
	["When you Warcry, you and nearby Allies gain Onslaught for 4 seconds"] = "你使用战吼时， 你和周围友军在 4 秒内获得猛攻",
	["When you attack with The Saviour and deal a critical strike, this skill can summon a Mirage Saviour. Summoned Mirage Saviours will fight for you using whichever of your attack skills you dealt the critical strike with that caused them to be summoned. Mirage Saviours will not be resummoned using the same skills if you already have the maximum number of them."] = "使用救世者攻击并造成暴击时，该技能会召唤一个蜃影救世者。召唤的蜃影救世者会使用你在造成暴击时施展的技能。一旦达到他们的召唤上限，你就无法用相同的技能再次召唤他们。",
	["When you kill a Poisoned Enemy during any Flask Effect, Enemies within 1.5 metres are Poisoned"] = "在任意药剂生效期间击杀中毒的敌人时，1.5 米内的敌人陷入中毒",
	["When you leave your Banner's Area, recover (10-15)% of the Valour consumed for that Banner"] = "当你离开自己的旗帜范围时，恢复该旗帜消耗胆魄的 (10-15)%",
	["When you leave your Banner's Area, recover (16-25)% of the Valour consumed for that Banner"] = "当你离开自己的旗帜范围时，恢复该旗帜消耗胆魄的 (16-25)%",
	["When you leave your Banner's Area, recover 30% of the Valour consumed for that Banner"] = "当你离开自己的旗帜范围时，恢复该旗帜消耗胆魄的 30%",
	["When you lose Temporal Chains you gain maximum Rage"] = "你失去时空锁链时，获得最大怒火",
	["When you take a Savage Hit, lose Baryatic Tension to recover that much Life, up to maximum"] = "承受残暴打击时，失去重压张力并回复等量的生命，最高不超过最大值",
	["When your Hits Impale Enemies, also Impale other Enemies near them\nInflict 5 additional Impales on Enemies you Impale\nFor 5 seconds after you Impale Enemies, they cannot be Impaled again, and Impales cannot be Called from them"] = "你击中穿刺的敌人时，也穿刺他周围的其它敌人\n对你穿刺的敌人施加 5 次额外穿刺\n你穿刺敌人后 5 秒内不能对它重复穿刺，并且这些穿刺无法被呼唤",
	["When your Traps Trigger, your nearby Traps also Trigger"] = "当你的陷阱触发时，你周围的陷阱也跟着触发",
	["Where you step, the sky darkens."] = "所行之处，天色为之暗淡。",
	["While Minions have Energy Shield, their Hits Ignore Monster Elemental Resistances"] = "召唤生物有能量护盾时，它们的击中无视怪物的元素抗性",
