	["While active, grants the Avian's Might and Avian's Flight buffs in sequence. Avian's Might grants you and your minions a chance to deal Double Damage with hits for a duration. Avian's Flight grants you and your minions increased Movement Speed for a secondary duration."] = "当生效时，依次轮流赋予玩家鸟之力量和鸟之斗魄。鸟之力量会让你和你的召唤生物被击中后短时间内有一定几率造成双倍伤害。鸟之斗魄会让你和你的召唤生物移动速度增加。",
	["While active, grants the Cat's Stealth and Cat's Agility buffs in sequence. Cat's Stealth increases your critical strike chance, makes you harder to see, and gives you a chance to avoid damage for a short duration. Cat's Agility increases your attack and cast speed for a longer secondary duration."] = "当生效时，依次轮流赋予玩家猫之隐匿和猫之敏捷。猫之隐匿会提高暴击率，短时间内有一定几率避免伤害，并使你更难被敌人发现。猫之敏捷会在一段时间内增加你的攻击和施法速度。",
	["While active, periodically adds Crab Barriers to you, and grants additional Physical Damage reduction for each Crab Barrier you have. All Crab Barriers are lost when you take physical damage from a hit."] = "当生效时，每隔一段时间获得深海屏障，每个深海屏障使你获得额外物理伤害减免。所有的深海屏障会在你受到物理伤害时失去。",
	["While active, periodically applies a Spider's Web debuff to nearby Enemies, and Hinders them. Each Spider's Web on an Enemy increases the Damage they take. Hinder reduces their movement speed."] = "当生效时，每隔一段时间对周围敌人施加蜘蛛网减益效果，并减缓他们的移动速度。每层敌人身上的蜘蛛网会增加他们受到的伤害。",
	["While active, this skill inflicts the Weeping Black debuff on impaled enemies you hit with bow attacks. Weeping Black deals physical damage over time, and can stack up to five times. This skill cannot be cast by Totems."] = "在激活状态下，此技能使你用弓类攻击击中穿刺的敌人时施加漆黑鸣泣减益效果。漆黑鸣泣造成持续物理伤害，最多可叠加至 5 层。此技能无法由图腾施放。",
	["While active, your bow attacks inflict Cinderflame. Cinderflame deals fire damage over time, and can stack up to ten times. This skill cannot be cast by Totems."] = "在激活状态下，你的弓类攻击施加灰烬余火。灰烬余火造成持续火焰伤害，最多可叠加至 10 层。此技能无法由图腾施放。",
	["While affected by Glorious Madness, inflict Mania on nearby Enemies every second"] = "受疯狂荣光影响时，每秒对周围敌人施加狂热",
	["While ensnared, enemies take increased Projectile Damage from Attack Hits"] = "被诱捕的敌人承受的攻击击中投射物伤害提高",
	["While ensnared, enemies take increased Projectile Damage from Attack Hits\nEnsnared enemies always count as moving, and have less movement speed while trying to break the snare."] = "被诱捕的敌人承受的攻击击中投射物伤害提高\n被诱捕的敌人始终视为正在移动，尝试挣脱诱捕时移动速度总降。",
	["While in Her Embrace, take 0.5% of your total Maximum Life and Energy Shield as Fire Damage per second per Level"] = "受到她的拥抱影响时，每级根据你的最大生命和最大护盾总量，造成每秒 0.5% 火焰伤害",
	["While on Low Life, Life Flasks gain (3-6) Charges every 3 seconds"] = "低血时，生命药剂每 3 秒获得 (3-6) 层充能",
	["While the mind endures, so too will the body."] = "当心灵升华至永久不灭时, 肉体也将随之永存.",
	["While this skill is active, supported spells will be repeatedly triggered."] = "该技能激活时，被辅助的法术会反复触发。",
	["While you channel this skill, it releases pulses of electrical energy, dealing lightning damage in a growing semicircular area in front of you."] = "汇聚雷霆之力并从手中快速释放多次闪电，对你面前弧状区域内的所有敌人造成伤害，并逐渐扩大范围。",
	["While you channel this skill, it releases pulses of electrical energy, dealing lightning damage in a semicircular area in front of you."] = "汇聚雷霆之力并从手中快速释放多次闪电，对你面前弧状区域内的所有敌人造成伤害。",
	["While you have Disgorge Supported Spells fire Projectiles in a circle"] = "拥有喷吐时，被辅助法术会向四周发射投射物",
	["While you have at least 3 Ghastly Eye Jewels socketed:"] = "当你插上至少 3 颗苍白之凝珠宝时：",
	["While you have at least 3 Hypnotic Eye Jewels socketed:"] = "当你插上至少 3 颗安睡之凝珠宝时：",
	["While you have at least 3 Murderous Eye Jewels socketed:"] = "当你插上至少 3 颗凶残之凝珠宝时：",
	["While you have at least 3 Searching Eye Jewels socketed:"] = "当你插上至少 3 颗锐利之凝珠宝时：",
	["While you have no placed Banner, you can gain Valour"] = "未放置旗帜时，你可以获得胆魄",
	["While you run, this skill creates a small explosion with each step, dealing fire damage in an area around you."] = "该技能在你奔跑时每一步产生小规模爆炸，对周围造成火焰伤害。",
	["While you walk, this skill causes corpses near your steps to explode, dealing fire damage in an area. The explosions of the corpses are not affected by modifiers to spell damage, and cannot be reflected."] = "在你移动时，该技能会引爆周围的灵柩，造成火焰范围伤害。灵柩的爆炸无法被法术伤害词缀加成，并且该伤害无法被反射。",
