	["With at least 1000 Strength, 20% of Damage dealt by your Raised Zombies is Leeched to you as Life"] = "当力量超过 1000 时，魔卫复苏造成伤害的 20% 转化为给你的生命偷取",
	["With at least 40 Dexterity in Radius, Animate Weapon can Animate up to 12 Ranged Weapons"] = "若范围内含有 40 点敏捷，幻化武器可以幻化最多 12 把远程武器",
	["With at least 40 Dexterity in Radius, Animate Weapon can Animate up to 20 Ranged Weapons"] = "若范围内含有 40 点敏捷，幻化武器可以幻化最多 20 把远程武器",
