	["You will automatically be considered to have unbroken Ward if you have Olroth's Resolve active or\nan Iron Flask with enough Flask Charges gained on Ward Break."] = "启用欧罗什的决心，或满足下述条件时，自动视为结界未破：\n使用坚铁药剂，并在结界破裂时获得足够的药剂充能。",
	["You will automatically be considered to have used a Minion skill Recently if your main skill is a Minion skill,"] = "主技能为召唤生物技能时，自动视为近期内使用过召唤生物技能，",
	["You will automatically be considered to have used a Movement skill Recently if your main skill is a movement skill,"] = "主技能为位移技能时，自动视为近期内使用过位移技能，",
