	["You're the crazy one!"] = "你才疯了！",
	["Your Absolution Skill Damage will not be scaled with Count setting."] = "赦罪技能自身的伤害不随数量设置缩放。",
	["Your Absolution Skill Damage will not be scaled with Count setting.\nBy default it multiplies both minion count and skill hit count which leads to incorrect\nTotal DPS calculation since Absolution cannot inherently shotgun.\nDo not enable if you use Spell Totem support, Spell Cascade support or similar supports"] = "赦罪技能自身的伤害不随数量设置缩放。\n默认同时乘以召唤生物数量和技能击中次数，可能导致\n总每秒伤害计算不准确，因为赦免本身无法使多个投射物重复命中同一目标。\n使用法术图腾、多重范围施法或类似辅助时请勿启用",
	["Your Action Speed is at least 90% of base value"] = "你的行动速度至少是基础值的90%",
	["Your Aura Buffs do not affect allies"] = "光环效果对友军没有作用",
